<body>
<div>
<p xml:id="subtitle1" begin="553055001t" end="573910002t" region="region0" style="style0">OLDER BEK:<span style="style1"> Few know</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2" begin="553055001t" end="573910002t" region="region1" style="style0"><span style="style1">the whole story.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle3" begin="573910002t" end="610610000t" region="region2" style="style0"><span style="style1">it goes something like this...</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle4" begin="573910002t" end="610610000t" region="region0" style="style0"><span style="style1">From what I recall,</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle5" begin="618125006t" end="641057500t" region="region3" style="style0"><span style="style1">Before history began,</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle6" begin="641057500t" end="667340006t" region="region4" style="style0"><span style="style1">Egypt was the birthplace</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle7" begin="641057500t" end="667340006t" region="region5" style="style0"><span style="style1">of all life.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle8" begin="667340006t" end="701952500t" region="region6" style="style0"><span style="style1">A paradise worthy of the gods</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle9" begin="667340006t" end="701952500t" region="region7" style="style0"><span style="style1">who created it.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle10" begin="701952500t" end="727400006t" region="region8" style="style0"><span style="style1">decided to live there</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle11" begin="701952500t" end="727400006t" region="region9" style="style0"><span style="style1">So the gods</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle12" begin="727400006t" end="741157500t" region="region10" style="style0"><span style="style1">alongside their</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle13" begin="727400006t" end="741157500t" region="region1" style="style0"><span style="style1">lesser creation,</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle14" begin="747002506t" end="760760000t" region="region11" style="style0"><span style="style1">man.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle15" begin="766187505t" end="784955003t" region="region8" style="style0"><span style="style1">no mistaking the gods</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle16" begin="766187505t" end="784955003t" region="region12" style="style0"><span style="style1">But there was</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle17" begin="784955003t" end="806227505t" region="region0" style="style0"><span style="style1">amongst the mortals</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle18" begin="784955003t" end="806227505t" region="region13" style="style0"><span style="style1">who worshipped them.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle19" begin="806227505t" end="828335006t" region="region13" style="style0"><span style="style1">The gods were taller</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle20" begin="828335006t" end="843345001t" region="region14" style="style0"><span style="style1">their veins instead of blood.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle21" begin="828335006t" end="843345001t" region="region15" style="style0"><span style="style1">with gold running through</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle22" begin="862112500t" end="881297500t" region="region16" style="style0"><span style="style1">transform at will</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle23" begin="862112500t" end="881297500t" region="region17" style="style0"><span style="style1">And they could</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle24" begin="881297500t" end="904240002t" region="region18" style="style0"><span style="style1">of frightening beasts.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle25" begin="881297500t" end="904240002t" region="region10" style="style0"><span style="style1">into all manner</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle26" begin="935940003t" end="973475001t" region="region19" style="style0"><span style="style1">between two mighty brothers.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle27" begin="935940003t" end="973475001t" region="region4" style="style0"><span style="style1">Egypt itself was divided</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle28" begin="973475001t" end="1006427505t" region="region4" style="style0"><span style="style1">Osiris, the God of Life,</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle29" begin="973475001t" end="1006427505t" region="region13" style="style0"><span style="style1">was the beloved king</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle30" begin="1006427505t" end="1031029999t" region="region20" style="style0"><span style="style1">made bountiful by the Nile.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle31" begin="1006427505t" end="1031029999t" region="region21" style="style0"><span style="style1">of all the lands</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle32" begin="1048137506t" end="1086507505t" region="region20" style="style0"><span style="style1">ruled the far barren desert</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle33" begin="1048137506t" end="1086507505t" region="region22" style="style0"><span style="style1">His brother, Set,</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle34" begin="1086507505t" end="1131547500t" region="region19" style="style0"><span style="style1">bitterness in his isolation.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle35" begin="1086507505t" end="1131547500t" region="region23" style="style0"><span style="style1">finding both strength and</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle36" begin="1131547500t" end="1167422506t" region="region24" style="style0"><span style="style1">But then the time came</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle37" begin="1131547500t" end="1167422506t" region="region0" style="style0"><span style="style1">for Osiris to crown</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle38" begin="1131547500t" end="1167422506t" region="region25" style="style0"><span style="style1">a new king.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle39" begin="1167422506t" end="1195782503t" region="region13" style="style0"><span style="style1">His only son, Horus.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle40" begin="1195782503t" end="1220395008t" region="region26" style="style0"><span style="style1">It was a decision that would</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle41" begin="1195782503t" end="1220395008t" region="region27" style="style0"><span style="style1">test the brothers' bond</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle42" begin="1220395008t" end="1238745006t" region="region28" style="style0"><span style="style1">and the fate of all Egypt.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle43" begin="1441857500t" end="1461877500t" region="region29" style="style0"><span style="style1">But the gods are only</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle44" begin="1441857500t" end="1461877500t" region="region30" style="style0"><span style="style1">half our tale.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle45" begin="1468557506t" end="1488995006t" region="region31" style="style0"><span style="style1">It had become clear</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle46" begin="1488995006t" end="1511102508t" region="region19" style="style0"><span style="style1">the course of destiny alone.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle47" begin="1488995006t" end="1511102508t" region="region4" style="style0"><span style="style1">that they couldn't shape</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle48" begin="1511102508t" end="1532782500t" region="region2" style="style0"><span style="style1">A man of exceptional judgment,</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle49" begin="1532782500t" end="1561977500t" region="region32" style="style0"><span style="style1">wisdom and fortitude</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle50" begin="1532782500t" end="1561977500t" region="region1" style="style0"><span style="style1">would be needed.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle51" begin="1561977500t" end="1607027505t" region="region8" style="style0"><span style="style1">I was not such a man.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle52" begin="1561977500t" end="1607027505t" region="region17" style="style0"><span style="style1">Unfortunately,</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle53" begin="1607027505t" end="1634970002t" region="region28" style="style0"><span style="style1">my younger foolhardy self,</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle54" begin="1607027505t" end="1634970002t" region="region33" style="style0"><span style="style1">But before you dismiss</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle55" begin="1634970002t" end="1649572507t" region="region34" style="style0"><span style="style1">remember...</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle56" begin="1656660003t" end="1677097505t" region="region16" style="style0"><span style="style1">Never doubt a man</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle57" begin="1677097505t" end="1702117500t" region="region35" style="style0"><span style="style1">fighting for the one thing</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle58" begin="1677097505t" end="1702117500t" region="region27" style="style0"><span style="style1">as powerful as any god.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle59" begin="1702117500t" end="1712127500t" region="region0" style="style0">MAN: Three hundred,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle60" begin="1702117500t" end="1712127500t" region="region25" style="style0">impossible.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle61" begin="1712127500t" end="1722555000t" region="region1" style="style0">OLDER BEK:<span style="style1"> Love.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle62" begin="1728400006t" end="1741739999t" region="region13" style="style0">It's the best price.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle63" begin="1760100007t" end="1775110002t" region="region36" style="style0">(GRUNTS) Thief!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle64" begin="1775110002t" end="1792207500t" region="region37" style="style0">(GRUNTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle65" begin="1792207500t" end="1804305001t" region="region37" style="style0">MAN: Stop!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle66" begin="1832247500t" end="1856442503t" region="region27" style="style0">This dress is hopeless.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle67" begin="1832247500t" end="1856442503t" region="region38" style="style0">ZAYA: (SIGHS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle68" begin="1856442503t" end="1873957501t" region="region23" style="style0">I need to buy some ribbon</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle69" begin="1856442503t" end="1873957501t" region="region39" style="style0">to even begin</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle70" begin="1873957501t" end="1893142500t" region="region0" style="style0">to make it suitable</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle71" begin="1873957501t" end="1893142500t" region="region40" style="style0">for the coronation.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle72" begin="1893142500t" end="1915250002t" region="region41" style="style0">I say we spend tomorrow</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle73" begin="1893142500t" end="1915250002t" region="region42" style="style0">together instead.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle74" begin="1915250002t" end="1952367500t" region="region43" style="style0">tomorrow together.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle75" begin="1915250002t" end="1952367500t" region="region44" style="style0">At the coronation.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle76" begin="1915250002t" end="1952367500t" region="region45" style="style0">We are spending</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle77" begin="1952367500t" end="1962377500t" region="region18" style="style0">the gods shall give us</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle78" begin="1952367500t" end="1962377500t" region="region38" style="style0">We're blessed</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle79" begin="1962377500t" end="1972805000t" region="region1" style="style0">in our lifetime.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle80" begin="1962377500t" end="1972805000t" region="region46" style="style0">a new king</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle81" begin="1972805000t" end="1992407500t" region="region47" style="style0">Horus?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle82" begin="1992407500t" end="2002835000t" region="region48" style="style0">You know I couldn't care less</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle83" begin="1992407500t" end="2002835000t" region="region36" style="style0">about the gods.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle84" begin="2002835000t" end="2016602503t" region="region28" style="style0">Well, they care about you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle85" begin="2022437500t" end="2043710001t" region="region49" style="style0">Bek! Give it back.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle86" begin="2022437500t" end="2043710001t" region="region50" style="style0">Oh, yeah?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle87" begin="2062477500t" end="2074992502t" region="region28" style="style0">to wear something special.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle88" begin="2062477500t" end="2074992502t" region="region51" style="style0">I knew you wanted</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle89" begin="2124625001t" end="2138392506t" region="region52" style="style0">Did you steal it</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle90" begin="2124625001t" end="2138392506t" region="region42" style="style0">from a shopkeeper</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle91" begin="2138392506t" end="2156325003t" region="region53" style="style0">or from someone's closet?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle92" begin="2156325003t" end="2171345008t" region="region0" style="style0">It was quicker than</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle93" begin="2156325003t" end="2171345008t" region="region13" style="style0">waiting for the gods</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle94" begin="2171345008t" end="2183850001t" region="region3" style="style0">to answer my prayers.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle95" begin="2218890006t" end="2236405003t" region="region40" style="style0">everything we need.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle96" begin="2218890006t" end="2236405003t" region="region52" style="style0">The gods give us</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle97" begin="2236405003t" end="2258095005t" region="region54" style="style0">Yes. Their generosity</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle98" begin="2236405003t" end="2258095005t" region="region55" style="style0">knows no bounds.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle99" begin="2271862508t" end="2286037502t" region="region56" style="style0">(SIGHS) You look beautiful.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle100" begin="2305222502t" end="2324825001t" region="region33" style="style0">Zaya, when I asked you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle101" begin="2305222502t" end="2324825001t" region="region13" style="style0">to run away with me,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle102" begin="2332747500t" end="2346097502t" region="region57" style="style0">I promised you a good life.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle103" begin="2351525008t" end="2371127508t" region="region58" style="style0">Dresses worthy of a princess.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle104" begin="2371127508t" end="2382797500t" region="region32" style="style0">A new one every day.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle105" begin="2371127508t" end="2382797500t" region="region37" style="style0">(CHUCKLES)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle106" begin="2382797500t" end="2402817500t" region="region21" style="style0">Rivers of jewels</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle107" begin="2382797500t" end="2402817500t" region="region39" style="style0">to adorn you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle108" begin="2402817500t" end="2415332502t" region="region13" style="style0">to raise our family.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle109" begin="2402817500t" end="2415332502t" region="region10" style="style0">A golden palace</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle110" begin="2415332502t" end="2434935001t" region="region54" style="style0">And how many children</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle111" begin="2415332502t" end="2434935001t" region="region59" style="style0">would we have?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle112" begin="2445780002t" end="2459130006t" region="region37" style="style0">(CHUCKLES)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle113" begin="2459130006t" end="2471645008t" region="region42" style="style0">(SOFTLY) A dozen.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle114" begin="2475392502t" end="2497917505t" region="region0" style="style0">I would do anything</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle115" begin="2475392502t" end="2497917505t" region="region60" style="style0">to make you happy.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle116" begin="2497917505t" end="2520860007t" region="region48" style="style0">OLDER BEK:<span style="style1"> And how was Horus,</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle117" begin="2497917505t" end="2520860007t" region="region36" style="style0"><span style="style1">the king-to-be,</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle118" begin="2520860007t" end="2540045006t" region="region19" style="style0"><span style="style1">preparing for his great day?</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle119" begin="2540045006t" end="2556307502t" region="region61" style="style0">(SNORING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle120" begin="2597600003t" end="2613027500t" region="region1" style="style0">Lord of the Air.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle121" begin="2631805008t" end="2653067500t" region="region51" style="style0">Quite an occasion</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle122" begin="2631805008t" end="2653067500t" region="region25" style="style0">last night.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle123" begin="2653067500t" end="2664747501t" region="region32" style="style0">Already crowds press</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle124" begin="2653067500t" end="2664747501t" region="region30" style="style0">cheek-to-cheek</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle125" begin="2664747501t" end="2681855008t" region="region28" style="style0">to catch a glimpse of you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle126" begin="2681855008t" end="2694777501t" region="region27" style="style0">You will look splendid.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle127" begin="2681855008t" end="2694777501t" region="region62" style="style0">SERVANT 2:</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle128" begin="2694777501t" end="2711050007t" region="region42" style="style0">(GRUNTING SOFTLY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle129" begin="2711050007t" end="2723137500t" region="region63" style="style0">Eventually.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle130" begin="2711050007t" end="2723137500t" region="region64" style="style0">(GIGGLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle131" begin="2763177500t" end="2791130007t" region="region14" style="style0"><span style="style1">♪ Glorious, glorious Horus! ♪</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle132" begin="2763177500t" end="2791130007t" region="region50" style="style0">SERVANTS:</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle133" begin="2791130007t" end="2816985003t" region="region48" style="style0">OLDER BEK:<span style="style1"> But don't discount</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle134" begin="2791130007t" end="2816985003t" region="region42" style="style0"><span style="style1">Horus yet either.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle135" begin="2816985003t" end="2835752502t" region="region65" style="style0"><span style="style1">to the fate of the world</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle136" begin="2816985003t" end="2835752502t" region="region54" style="style0"><span style="style1">Because when it comes</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle137" begin="2835752502t" end="2857025003t" region="region7" style="style0"><span style="style1">in one's hands,</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle138" begin="2857025003t" end="2882880000t" region="region14" style="style0"><span style="style1">by the strength they possess.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle139" begin="2857025003t" end="2882880000t" region="region35" style="style0"><span style="style1">even gods can be surprised</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle140" begin="2885385001t" end="2900405006t" region="region66" style="style0">(SIGHS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle141" begin="2950037506t" end="2968387505t" region="region27" style="style0">If I was to be crowned,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle142" begin="2968387505t" end="2984232500t" region="region67" style="style0">I might have spent</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle143" begin="2968387505t" end="2984232500t" region="region40" style="style0">the preceding hours</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle144" begin="2984232500t" end="3002592508t" region="region0" style="style0">composing a message</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle145" begin="2984232500t" end="3002592508t" region="region59" style="style0">for my people.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle146" begin="3002592508t" end="3023437500t" region="region21" style="style0">Could the people</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle147" begin="3002592508t" end="3023437500t" region="region30" style="style0">love him more?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle148" begin="3023437500t" end="3045545001t" region="region54" style="style0">doesn't think we need</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle149" begin="3023437500t" end="3045545001t" region="region68" style="style0">Maybe Lord Horus</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle150" begin="3023437500t" end="3045545001t" region="region55" style="style0">boring speeches.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle151" begin="3045545001t" end="3071410007t" region="region28" style="style0">to toasting his own glory.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle152" begin="3045545001t" end="3071410007t" region="region32" style="style0">Except when it comes</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle153" begin="3071410007t" end="3088507505t" region="region28" style="style0">Many toasts were required.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle154" begin="3088507505t" end="3112285008t" region="region19" style="style0">of which songs will be sung.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle155" begin="3088507505t" end="3112285008t" region="region51" style="style0">I was doing deeds</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle156" begin="3112285008t" end="3135635001t" region="region69" style="style0">The great lion he slayed</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle157" begin="3112285008t" end="3135635001t" region="region53" style="style0">was terrorizing villages.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle158" begin="3135635001t" end="3166917502t" region="region53" style="style0">All the more song-worthy.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle159" begin="3135635001t" end="3166917502t" region="region38" style="style0">It was? Good.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle160" begin="3174422500t" end="3187772503t" region="region66" style="style0">(SIGHS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle161" begin="3187772503t" end="3202375008t" region="region5" style="style0">That's nice.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle162" begin="3233647500t" end="3249920006t" region="region3" style="style0">That's fine, thank...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle163" begin="3233647500t" end="3249920006t" region="region62" style="style0">(STUTTERS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle164" begin="3258260003t" end="3270357506t" region="region11" style="style0">You.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle165" begin="3270357506t" end="3293707500t" region="region56" style="style0">A shame I've come too late.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle166" begin="3293707500t" end="3321242507t" region="region44" style="style0">sober and clothed.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle167" begin="3293707500t" end="3321242507t" region="region17" style="style0">But here I am,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle168" begin="3327495003t" end="3342097508t" region="region44" style="style0">Don't tell anyone.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle169" begin="3342097508t" end="3362117508t" region="region41" style="style0">I have a bad reputation</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle170" begin="3342097508t" end="3362117508t" region="region70" style="style0">to keep.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle171" begin="3370875006t" end="3383797500t" region="region53" style="style0">(SOFTLY) Come here. Come.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle172" begin="3393807500t" end="3407575003t" region="region40" style="style0">No. No, no. No, no!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle173" begin="3407575003t" end="3416332502t" region="region61" style="style0">(SCREAMS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle174" begin="3416332502t" end="3430517506t" region="region66" style="style0">(GASPS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle175" begin="3501005006t" end="3526860002t" region="region69" style="style0">HATHOR: Hard to believe,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle176" begin="3501005006t" end="3526860002t" region="region53" style="style0">but you look like a king.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle177" begin="3526860002t" end="3551055006t" region="region71" style="style0">If that's what excites you,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle178" begin="3526860002t" end="3551055006t" region="region60" style="style0">who am I to judge?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle179" begin="3551055006t" end="3565230001t" region="region40" style="style0">Jewelry excites me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle180" begin="3568987505t" end="3583997500t" region="region65" style="style0">Then look to your wrist,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle181" begin="3583997500t" end="3594007500t" region="region42" style="style0">is not too great.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle182" begin="3583997500t" end="3594007500t" region="region38" style="style0">if the effort</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle183" begin="3594007500t" end="3617785003t" region="region53" style="style0">The Bracelet of 42 Stars.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle184" begin="3617785003t" end="3645727501t" region="region71" style="style0">To remind you of the demons</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle185" begin="3617785003t" end="3645727501t" region="region42" style="style0">I slayed for you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle186" begin="3645727501t" end="3666165001t" region="region4" style="style0">A more valuable treasure</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle187" begin="3645727501t" end="3666165001t" region="region18" style="style0">Egypt has never known.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle188" begin="3666165001t" end="3685767501t" region="region36" style="style0">This old thing?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle189" begin="3685767501t" end="3709127505t" region="region71" style="style0">How can the Goddess of Love</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle190" begin="3685767501t" end="3709127505t" region="region72" style="style0">not know what love is?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle191" begin="3709127505t" end="3740410006t" region="region56" style="style0">who flutters her eyelashes,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle192" begin="3709127505t" end="3740410006t" region="region23" style="style0">It's not bedding any girl</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle193" begin="3740410006t" end="3764177500t" region="region40" style="style0">mighty lion-slayer.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle194" begin="3764177500t" end="3794625000t" region="region73" style="style0">I was celebrating the hunt.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle195" begin="3764177500t" end="3794625000t" region="region0" style="style0">You would know that</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle196" begin="3764177500t" end="3794625000t" region="region60" style="style0">had you been here.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle197" begin="3794625000t" end="3824237500t" region="region3" style="style0">Dead animals less so.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle198" begin="3794625000t" end="3824237500t" region="region0" style="style0">I value my freedom.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle199" begin="3824237500t" end="3843015008t" region="region3" style="style0">problem wearing them.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle200" begin="3824237500t" end="3843015008t" region="region51" style="style0">Well, you have no</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle201" begin="3843015008t" end="3865112500t" region="region30" style="style0">Hathor, don't.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle202" begin="3843015008t" end="3865112500t" region="region74" style="style0">Oh...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle203" begin="3865112500t" end="3884297500t" region="region47" style="style0">Don't.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle204" begin="3884297500t" end="3903492508t" region="region51" style="style0">That's no way for</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle205" begin="3884297500t" end="3903492508t" region="region44" style="style0">a queen to behave.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle206" begin="3903492508t" end="3928095003t" region="region33" style="style0">Then it's a good thing</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle207" begin="3903492508t" end="3928095003t" region="region1" style="style0">I'm not a queen.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle208" begin="3928095003t" end="3949367505t" region="region43" style="style0">anything more dull</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle209" begin="3928095003t" end="3949367505t" region="region45" style="style0">Can you imagine</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle210" begin="3928095003t" end="3949367505t" region="region5" style="style0">than sitting</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle211" begin="3949367505t" end="3961465006t" region="region13" style="style0">on a throne all day?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle212" begin="3998582503t" end="4014009999t" region="region44" style="style0">are you asking me?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle213" begin="3998582503t" end="4014009999t" region="region75" style="style0">What exactly</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle214" begin="4029030003t" end="4044039999t" region="region65" style="style0">Did I ask you something?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle215" begin="4061565006t" end="4074069999t" region="region18" style="style0">I'm not sure. Did you?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle216" begin="4124537500t" end="4135800001t" region="region42" style="style0">SERVANT: My Lord.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle217" begin="4142480007t" end="4154567500t" region="region59" style="style0">It's starting.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle218" begin="4257172502t" end="4271357506t" region="region66" style="style0">(SIGHS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle219" begin="4341845006t" end="4355185000t" region="region36" style="style0">(DRUMS BEATING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle220" begin="4385215000t" end="4402322507t" region="region1" style="style0">(CROWD CHEERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle221" begin="4512850007t" end="4524937500t" region="region1" style="style0">(BIRDS CHIRPING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle222" begin="4658825003t" end="4705117500t" region="region65" style="style0">Hathor, Goddess of Love!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle223" begin="4705117500t" end="4720137505t" region="region44" style="style0">(CROWD APPLAUDING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle224" begin="4836917501t" end="4885297500t" region="region18" style="style0">Goddess of Protection!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle225" begin="4836917501t" end="4885297500t" region="region50" style="style0">Nephthys,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle226" begin="4941192506t" end="4954950000t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle227" begin="4963300007t" end="4976640001t" region="region77" style="style0">Sir.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle228" begin="4963300007t" end="4976640001t" region="region78" style="style0">Oh...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle229" begin="4979980003t" end="4995825000t" region="region3" style="style0">Thank you, young man.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle230" begin="5014185008t" end="5035447500t" region="region65" style="style0">nice to strangers today.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle231" begin="5014185008t" end="5035447500t" region="region0" style="style0">You've been awfully</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle232" begin="5035447500t" end="5047962502t" region="region40" style="style0">Show me your hands.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle233" begin="5070070003t" end="5088420002t" region="region27" style="style0">What? Gifts for Osiris.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle234" begin="5088420002t" end="5101770006t" region="region36" style="style0">ZAYA: Hurry up!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle235" begin="5105517500t" end="5138470002t" region="region3" style="style0">Thoth, God of Wisdom!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle236" begin="5189772503t" end="5211880006t" region="region42" style="style0">Greetings, Thoth.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle237" begin="5211880006t" end="5235647500t" region="region65" style="style0">that your former student</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle238" begin="5211880006t" end="5235647500t" region="region32" style="style0">Did you ever imagine</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle239" begin="5235647500t" end="5248162502t" region="region67" style="style0">would one day wear</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle240" begin="5235647500t" end="5248162502t" region="region40" style="style0">the crown of Egypt?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle241" begin="5265677500t" end="5294047508t" region="region18" style="style0">a range of attributes,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle242" begin="5265677500t" end="5294047508t" region="region38" style="style0">Horus evinced</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle243" begin="5294047508t" end="5315310000t" region="region24" style="style0">some of which may well</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle244" begin="5294047508t" end="5315310000t" region="region18" style="style0">a leadership position.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle245" begin="5294047508t" end="5315310000t" region="region17" style="style0">correlate with</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle246" begin="5322407506t" end="5335330000t" region="region30" style="style0">If he's lucky.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle247" begin="5344097508t" end="5359942503t" region="region44" style="style0">(TRUMPETS BLOWING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle248" begin="5359942503t" end="5395390000t" region="region30" style="style0">Praise Osiris!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle249" begin="5403740007t" end="5415827500t" region="region1" style="style0">(CROWD CHEERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle250" begin="5415827500t" end="5448362502t" region="region44" style="style0">King of all Egypt!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle251" begin="5465877500t" end="5495907500t" region="region27" style="style0">Hail Ra, Lord of Light.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle252" begin="5495907500t" end="5523025006t" region="region19" style="style0">ALL: Hail Ra, Lord of Light!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle253" begin="5535947500t" end="5565560000t" region="region3" style="style0">fit to bless this day</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle254" begin="5535947500t" end="5565560000t" region="region67" style="style0">My father has seen</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle255" begin="5577657501t" end="5607270001t" region="region79" style="style0">as you all bless us</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle256" begin="5577657501t" end="5607270001t" region="region3" style="style0">with your generosity.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle257" begin="5667747501t" end="5690690003t" region="region44" style="style0">someone with much.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle258" begin="5667747501t" end="5690690003t" region="region75" style="style0">A token from</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle259" begin="5706117500t" end="5725720000t" region="region58" style="style0">And from someone with little.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle260" begin="5746157500t" end="5771605005t" region="region19" style="style0">and stand at the Final Gate,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle261" begin="5746157500t" end="5771605005t" region="region51" style="style0">But when both die</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle262" begin="5782450006t" end="5803305006t" region="region53" style="style0">what is their value then?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle263" begin="5803305006t" end="5825412508t" region="region3" style="style0">I say they are equal.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle264" begin="5825412508t" end="5851267505t" region="region19" style="style0">Symbols of lives well-lived.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle265" begin="5866277500t" end="5895890000t" region="region42" style="style0">to the Afterlife.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle266" begin="5866277500t" end="5895890000t" region="region10" style="style0">All are welcome</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle267" begin="5912580006t" end="5926337500t" region="region44" style="style0">This is my legacy.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle268" begin="5936347500t" end="5975562508t" region="region13" style="style0">we crown a new king.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle269" begin="5936347500t" end="5975562508t" region="region46" style="style0">But today,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle270" begin="5975562508t" end="6006417500t" region="region54" style="style0">he will have a legacy</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle271" begin="5975562508t" end="6006417500t" region="region80" style="style0">And one day,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle272" begin="5975562508t" end="6006417500t" region="region25" style="style0">of his own.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle273" begin="6006417500t" end="6038535001t" region="region1" style="style0">Lord of the Air.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle274" begin="6006417500t" end="6038535001t" region="region38" style="style0">My son Horus,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle275" begin="6038535001t" end="6056467500t" region="region2" style="style0">(CROWD ROARING AND APPLAUDING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle276" begin="6177005000t" end="6193277506t" region="region30" style="style0">Are you ready?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle277" begin="6177005000t" end="6193277506t" region="region75" style="style0">(WHISPERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle278" begin="6201200003t" end="6215385008t" region="region78" style="style0">I am.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle279" begin="6265852508t" end="6279610002t" region="region37" style="style0">SET: Wait!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle280" begin="6279610002t" end="6293377506t" region="region78" style="style0">Wait.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle281" begin="6293377506t" end="6312980006t" region="region36" style="style0">Sorry I'm late.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle282" begin="6312980006t" end="6339670002t" region="region13" style="style0">to cross the desert.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle283" begin="6312980006t" end="6339670002t" region="region10" style="style0">Ugh, three days</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle284" begin="6339670002t" end="6370952503t" region="region71" style="style0">And nearly one more to pass</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle285" begin="6339670002t" end="6370952503t" region="region81" style="style0">through all your admirers.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle286" begin="6370952503t" end="6385555008t" region="region1" style="style0">(CROWD LAUGHING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle287" begin="6386797500t" end="6401400003t" region="region11" style="style0">Set!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle288" begin="6401400003t" end="6422672506t" region="region1" style="style0">Good to see you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle289" begin="6401400003t" end="6422672506t" region="region82" style="style0">Brother.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle290" begin="6422672506t" end="6437682500t" region="region42" style="style0">And you, brother.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle291" begin="6437682500t" end="6456450000t" region="region3" style="style0">a place for you here.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle292" begin="6437682500t" end="6456450000t" region="region83" style="style0">There's always</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle293" begin="6469800002t" end="6491907505t" region="region44" style="style0">You must be proud.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle294" begin="6469800002t" end="6491907505t" region="region84" style="style0">Such a big day</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle295" begin="6469800002t" end="6491907505t" region="region10" style="style0">for the family.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle296" begin="6500665003t" end="6516927500t" region="region78" style="style0">I am.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle297" begin="6516927500t" end="6548627501t" region="region32" style="style0">Look at you, nephew.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle298" begin="6516927500t" end="6548627501t" region="region5" style="style0">Magnificent.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle299" begin="6548627501t" end="6560307502t" region="region53" style="style0">here'll make a fine king.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle300" begin="6548627501t" end="6560307502t" region="region52" style="style0">At least someone</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle301" begin="6566977500t" end="6581580003t" region="region44" style="style0">you wouldn't come.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle302" begin="6566977500t" end="6581580003t" region="region75" style="style0">I was afraid</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle303" begin="6581580003t" end="6594930007t" region="region27" style="style0">No, I wouldn't miss it.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle304" begin="6594930007t" end="6606600000t" region="region85" style="style0">Ah.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle305" begin="6617862500t" end="6633300006t" region="region82" style="style0">For you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle306" begin="6617862500t" end="6633300006t" region="region78" style="style0">Oh...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle307" begin="6651650003t" end="6675845008t" region="region36" style="style0">A hunting horn.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle308" begin="6675845008t" end="6707117500t" region="region41" style="style0">of a ram that flattened</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle309" begin="6675845008t" end="6707117500t" region="region27" style="style0">10 gods slower than me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle310" begin="6675845008t" end="6707117500t" region="region84" style="style0">From the skull</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle311" begin="6707117500t" end="6722972506t" region="region36" style="style0">It's beautiful.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle312" begin="6722972506t" end="6736729999t" region="region42" style="style0">Yeah? Try it out.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle313" begin="6780110002t" end="6793877506t" region="region61" style="style0">From Set.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle314" begin="6793877506t" end="6806799999t" region="region1" style="style0">(CROWD CHEERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle315" begin="6816402508t" end="6843927506t" region="region65" style="style0">Let Ra himself hear you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle316" begin="6816402508t" end="6843927506t" region="region82" style="style0">Come on!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle317" begin="6867277500t" end="6886055008t" region="region75" style="style0">(BLOWS HORN)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle318" begin="6867277500t" end="6886055008t" region="region37" style="style0">(CHEERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle319" begin="6942357505t" end="6957785000t" region="region30" style="style0">(MAN SHOUTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle320" begin="6957785000t" end="6982397505t" region="region28" style="style0">I think someone heard you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle321" begin="6982397505t" end="6994495006t" region="region13" style="style0">(FOOTSTEPS MARCHING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle322" begin="7217627500t" end="7232230003t" region="region44" style="style0">What is this, Set?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle323" begin="7268095000t" end="7282280003t" region="region44" style="style0">(SOLDIER SHOUTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle324" begin="7287697500t" end="7300212502t" region="region86" style="style0">(CLATTERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle325" begin="7316902508t" end="7327737500t" region="region0" style="style0">(SOLDIERS SHOUTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle326" begin="7316902508t" end="7327737500t" region="region39" style="style0">(CROWD GASPS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle327" begin="7345680007t" end="7357767500t" region="region42" style="style0">You recognize it?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle328" begin="7397807500t" end="7410322502t" region="region18" style="style0">Father gave it to you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle329" begin="7430760002t" end="7461207502t" region="region33" style="style0">Kept me alive for many</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle330" begin="7430760002t" end="7461207502t" region="region18" style="style0">a night in the desert.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle331" begin="7491655003t" end="7507917500t" region="region61" style="style0">Fight me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle332" begin="7507917500t" end="7521267502t" region="region18" style="style0">Stay out of this, son.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle333" begin="7507917500t" end="7521267502t" region="region17" style="style0">Father, don't.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle334" begin="7537122508t" end="7554637506t" region="region11" style="style0">Why?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle335" begin="7554637506t" end="7593842506t" region="region56" style="style0">what have you accomplished?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle336" begin="7554637506t" end="7593842506t" region="region69" style="style0">In 1,000 years of peace,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle337" begin="7593842506t" end="7628037500t" region="region28" style="style0">who dream of nothing more.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle338" begin="7593842506t" end="7628037500t" region="region21" style="style0">A land of people</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle339" begin="7628037500t" end="7642640003t" region="region42" style="style0">It's my turn now.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle340" begin="7642640003t" end="7662242503t" region="region30" style="style0">I won't fight.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle341" begin="7662242503t" end="7684767506t" region="region32" style="style0">I love you, brother.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle342" begin="7662242503t" end="7684767506t" region="region44" style="style0">With all my heart.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle343" begin="7712292503t" end="7736070007t" region="region5" style="style0">(ISIS GASPS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle344" begin="7712292503t" end="7736070007t" region="region46" style="style0">CROWD: No!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle345" begin="7736070007t" end="7748992500t" region="region53" style="style0">I love you, too, brother.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle346" begin="7770682502t" end="7784867506t" region="region85" style="style0">No!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle347" begin="7796130007t" end="7808217500t" region="region39" style="style0">ISIS: Osiris!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle348" begin="7858267500t" end="7892472503t" region="region87" style="style0">Well, this truly</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle349" begin="7858267500t" end="7892472503t" region="region36" style="style0">for the family.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle350" begin="7858267500t" end="7892472503t" region="region75" style="style0">is a big day</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle351" begin="7908317500t" end="7925842507t" region="region66" style="style0">I, Set,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle352" begin="7945445006t" end="7967552508t" region="region19" style="style0">shall be your one true king.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle353" begin="7974640006t" end="7999242500t" region="region44" style="style0">King of all Egypt!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle354" begin="7999242500t" end="8030942502t" region="region43" style="style0">of those who stand</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle355" begin="7999242500t" end="8030942502t" region="region45" style="style0">Behold the fate</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle356" begin="7999242500t" end="8030942502t" region="region37" style="style0">in my way.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle357" begin="8044292506t" end="8058049999t" region="region66" style="style0">Gods...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle358" begin="8073070003t" end="8097265008t" region="region3" style="style0">Bow before me or die.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle359" begin="8137722508t" end="8178169999t" region="region0" style="style0">Mortals, worship me</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle360" begin="8137722508t" end="8178169999t" region="region36" style="style0">or be enslaved!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle361" begin="8213627505t" end="8228219999t" region="region42" style="style0">(CROWD MURMURING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle362" begin="8241152502t" end="8260755001t" region="region39" style="style0">(SOFTLY) Bek!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle363" begin="8260755001t" end="8288279999t" region="region53" style="style0">the Afterlife was a gift.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle364" begin="8260755001t" end="8288279999t" region="region67" style="style0">My brother thought</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle365" begin="8301212502t" end="8328319999t" region="region54" style="style0">I think a king should</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle366" begin="8301212502t" end="8328319999t" region="region18" style="style0">have higher standards.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle367" begin="8338747500t" end="8362942503t" region="region10" style="style0">you have to buy</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle368" begin="8338747500t" end="8362942503t" region="region80" style="style0">From now on,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle369" begin="8338747500t" end="8362942503t" region="region25" style="style0">your way in</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle370" begin="8362942503t" end="8377962508t" region="region40" style="style0">with riches earned.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle371" begin="8408817500t" end="8428837500t" region="region40" style="style0">(BREATHING SHAKILY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle372" begin="8428837500t" end="8452197502t" region="region36" style="style0">has just begun.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle373" begin="8428837500t" end="8452197502t" region="region88" style="style0">Your journey</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle374" begin="8467635008t" end="8481810002t" region="region50" style="style0">(GASPING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle375" begin="8467635008t" end="8481810002t" region="region61" style="style0">(SOBBING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle376" begin="8558967500t" end="8571482502t" region="region76" style="style0">(CRYING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle377" begin="8624037505t" end="8638630000t" region="region36" style="style0">It's yours now.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle378" begin="8655737506t" end="8674087505t" region="region65" style="style0">but now is not the time.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle379" begin="8655737506t" end="8674087505t" region="region45" style="style0">Many of us will</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle380" begin="8655737506t" end="8674087505t" region="region10" style="style0">stand with you,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle381" begin="8731642502t" end="8749157500t" region="region32" style="style0">-I looked up to you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle382" begin="8731642502t" end="8749157500t" region="region40" style="style0">-Of course you did.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle383" begin="8755420006t" end="8768760000t" region="region37" style="style0">(GRUNTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle384" begin="8779187500t" end="8793372503t" region="region3" style="style0">That would be unwise.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle385" begin="8853432503t" end="8869277500t" region="region3" style="style0">you still never miss?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle386" begin="8853432503t" end="8869277500t" region="region62" style="style0">Is it true</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle387" begin="8869277500t" end="8883462503t" region="region18" style="style0">Doesn't that get dull?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle388" begin="8916415006t" end="8933512503t" region="region38" style="style0">(CROWD GASPS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle389" begin="8916415006t" end="8933512503t" region="region89" style="style0">(SET LAUGHS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle390" begin="8933512503t" end="8946445006t" region="region44" style="style0">sight was perfect.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle391" begin="8933512503t" end="8946445006t" region="region17" style="style0">I thought your</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle392" begin="9056137506t" end="9069060000t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle393" begin="9147480007t" end="9159567500t" region="region36" style="style0">(BOTH GRUNTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle394" begin="9209617500t" end="9221715001t" region="region36" style="style0">You fight well.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle395" begin="9230055000t" end="9246327506t" region="region10" style="style0">Are you so sure</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle396" begin="9230055000t" end="9246327506t" region="region36" style="style0">you're his son?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle397" begin="9347680007t" end="9359767500t" region="region42" style="style0">(INHALES SHARPLY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle398" begin="9378545008t" end="9390632500t" region="region37" style="style0">(GRUNTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle399" begin="9429837500t" end="9442352502t" region="region37" style="style0">(GRUNTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle400" begin="9466547506t" end="9479470000t" region="region61" style="style0">(ROARING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle401" begin="9530355000t" end="9545375005t" region="region42" style="style0">(CROWD SCREAMING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle402" begin="9716380006t" end="9729720000t" region="region25" style="style0">(SET ROARS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle403" begin="9835247505t" end="9849432508t" region="region78" style="style0">Zaya!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle404" begin="9860267500t" end="9875705005t" region="region77" style="style0">Bek!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle405" begin="9860267500t" end="9875705005t" region="region78" style="style0">Zaya!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle406" begin="9881122500t" end="9890715000t" region="region11" style="style0">Bek!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle407" begin="9890715000t" end="9907822507t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle408" begin="9918250007t" end="9934512503t" region="region1" style="style0">(SOLDIERS SHOUT)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle409" begin="9934512503t" end="9949115008t" region="region30" style="style0">(HORUS GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle410" begin="10203530002t" end="10233560002t" region="region28" style="style0">You're not fit to be King.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle411" begin="10203530002t" end="10233560002t" region="region4" style="style0">I'm doing Egypt a favor.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle412" begin="10248997508t" end="10260667500t" region="region37" style="style0">(GROANING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle413" begin="10300707500t" end="10315310003t" region="region28" style="style0">(HORUS CONTINUES GROANING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle414" begin="10353680002t" end="10376622506t" region="region36" style="style0">(SCREAMING) No!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle415" begin="10376622506t" end="10390380000t" region="region85" style="style0">No!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle416" begin="10447945006t" end="10464207502t" region="region1" style="style0">(HORUS GROANING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle417" begin="10513005001t" end="10530520000t" region="region76" style="style0">(CRYING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle418" begin="10563472502t" end="10577657506t" region="region11" style="style0">Set!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle419" begin="10739905008t" end="10750740000t" region="region19" style="style0">(SOFTLY) Forgive me, Father.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle420" begin="10771177500t" end="10786197505t" region="region40" style="style0">(SOLDIERS SHOUTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle421" begin="10812887501t" end="10828325006t" region="region76" style="style0">(GROWLS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle422" begin="10828325006t" end="10840830000t" region="region37" style="style0">BEK: Zaya!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle423" begin="10844170002t" end="10858355006t" region="region90" style="style0">Zaya!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle424" begin="10924250002t" end="10958455006t" region="region13" style="style0"><span style="style1">And so Set was King.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle425" begin="10924250002t" end="10958455006t" region="region62" style="style0">OLDER BEK:</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle426" begin="10958455006t" end="10994320002t" region="region19" style="style0"><span style="style1">many gods stood against him.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle427" begin="10958455006t" end="10994320002t" region="region35" style="style0"><span style="style1">In the year that followed,</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle428" begin="10994320002t" end="11034360002t" region="region20" style="style0"><span style="style1">they paid with their lives.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle429" begin="10994320002t" end="11034360002t" region="region9" style="style0"><span style="style1">One by one,</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle430" begin="11034360002t" end="11061467500t" region="region44" style="style0"><span style="style1">things were worse.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle431" begin="11034360002t" end="11061467500t" region="region75" style="style0"><span style="style1">For mortals,</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle432" begin="11070235008t" end="11091497500t" region="region2" style="style0"><span style="style1">Most were forced into slavery,</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle433" begin="11091497500t" end="11111517500t" region="region16" style="style0"><span style="style1">the tiniest penny</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle434" begin="11091497500t" end="11111517500t" region="region91" style="style0"><span style="style1">and denied even</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle435" begin="11111517500t" end="11141547500t" region="region92" style="style0"><span style="style1">into the Afterlife.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle436" begin="11111517500t" end="11141547500t" region="region17" style="style0"><span style="style1">to buy our way</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle437" begin="11141547500t" end="11181587500t" region="region28" style="style0"><span style="style1">Horus withdrew into exile.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle438" begin="11141547500t" end="11181587500t" region="region54" style="style0"><span style="style1">Blinded and defeated,</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle439" begin="11181587500t" end="11203695001t" region="region4" style="style0"><span style="style1">Those who prayed for him</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle440" begin="11181587500t" end="11203695001t" region="region39" style="style0"><span style="style1">to save Egypt</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle441" begin="11203695001t" end="11221210000t" region="region93" style="style0"><span style="style1">were sorely disappointed.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle442" begin="11230395008t" end="11256667505t" region="region10" style="style0"><span style="style1">But I was never</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle443" begin="11230395008t" end="11256667505t" region="region1" style="style0"><span style="style1">much for prayer.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle444" begin="11256667505t" end="11282940001t" region="region20" style="style0"><span style="style1">enslaved to a cruel master.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle445" begin="11256667505t" end="11282940001t" region="region21" style="style0"><span style="style1">I had found Zaya</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle446" begin="11301707500t" end="11330495008t" region="region4" style="style0"><span style="style1">But how could I free her</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle447" begin="11301707500t" end="11330495008t" region="region30" style="style0"><span style="style1">from all this?</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle448" begin="11330495008t" end="11352592500t" region="region43" style="style0"><span style="style1">It was the maddest</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle449" begin="11330495008t" end="11352592500t" region="region39" style="style0"><span style="style1">of all plans.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle450" begin="11482305000t" end="11501907500t" region="region27" style="style0">control the wind, Zaya,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle451" begin="11482305000t" end="11501907500t" region="region63" style="style0">You may not</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle452" begin="11501907500t" end="11517345005t" region="region18" style="style0">could close a shutter.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle453" begin="11501907500t" end="11517345005t" region="region51" style="style0">but I'd think you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle454" begin="11524432502t" end="11539035006t" region="region36" style="style0">Sorry, My Lord.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle455" begin="11566560003t" end="11602007500t" region="region35" style="style0">Pretty one, if ever I find</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle456" begin="11566560003t" end="11602007500t" region="region53" style="style0">my desk disordered again,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle457" begin="11602007500t" end="11620367508t" region="region33" style="style0">I'll throw you outside</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle458" begin="11602007500t" end="11620367508t" region="region30" style="style0">to push stone.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle459" begin="11620367508t" end="11632872500t" region="region30" style="style0">Is that clear?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle460" begin="11687932506t" end="11703360001t" region="region4" style="style0">URSHU: Come on, come on!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle461" begin="11687932506t" end="11703360001t" region="region13" style="style0">Haven't got all day.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle462" begin="11756332503t" end="11781362508t" region="region94" style="style0">I'd like to drop him</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle463" begin="11756332503t" end="11781362508t" region="region32" style="style0">from a great height.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle464" begin="11756332503t" end="11781362508t" region="region37" style="style0">(CHUCKLES)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle465" begin="11781362508t" end="11800547508t" region="region40" style="style0">Morning. (CHUCKLES)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle466" begin="11800547508t" end="11815140002t" region="region30" style="style0">(URSHU URGING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle467" begin="11800547508t" end="11815140002t" region="region46" style="style0">(WHIPLASH)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle468" begin="11815140002t" end="11837247505t" region="region71" style="style0">One day, I'm going to steal</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle469" begin="11815140002t" end="11837247505t" region="region60" style="style0">you away from him.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle470" begin="11837247505t" end="11853927501t" region="region44" style="style0">always the answer?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle471" begin="11837247505t" end="11853927501t" region="region17" style="style0">ZAYA: Is theft</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle472" begin="11853927501t" end="11880210007t" region="region2" style="style0">You're either rich or nothing.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle473" begin="11853927501t" end="11880210007t" region="region4" style="style0">It is now in this world.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle474" begin="11880210007t" end="11893550001t" region="region42" style="style0">(CHUCKLES SOFTLY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle475" begin="11898142506t" end="11914405001t" region="region28" style="style0">Even if you could free me,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle476" begin="11914405001t" end="11941522508t" region="region54" style="style0">what about my family?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle477" begin="11914405001t" end="11941522508t" region="region89" style="style0">Our friends?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle478" begin="11941522508t" end="11962367500t" region="region41" style="style0">Can you steal all Egypt</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle479" begin="11941522508t" end="11962367500t" region="region59" style="style0">away from Set?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle480" begin="11962367500t" end="11983222500t" region="region27" style="style0">Only Horus can free us.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle481" begin="11962367500t" end="11983222500t" region="region95" style="style0">(SCOFFS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle482" begin="11983222500t" end="11999495006t" region="region43" style="style0">You really believe</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle483" begin="11983222500t" end="11999495006t" region="region30" style="style0">the gods care?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle484" begin="11999495006t" end="12012000000t" region="region32" style="style0">If Horus could come,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle485" begin="11999495006t" end="12012000000t" region="region61" style="style0">he would.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle486" begin="12024097501t" end="12039952507t" region="region17" style="style0">I want to show</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle487" begin="12024097501t" end="12039952507t" region="region30" style="style0">you something.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle488" begin="12122527500t" end="12148810006t" region="region4" style="style0">ZAYA: Set's army returns</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle489" begin="12122527500t" end="12148810006t" region="region40" style="style0">with spoils of war.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle490" begin="12148810006t" end="12162985000t" region="region51" style="style0">His vault will be</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle491" begin="12148810006t" end="12162985000t" region="region42" style="style0">unlocked tonight.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle492" begin="12162985000t" end="12177170003t" region="region1" style="style0">The perfect time</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle493" begin="12177170003t" end="12190937508t" region="region1" style="style0">to sneak inside.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle494" begin="12177170003t" end="12190937508t" region="region63" style="style0">for someone</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle495" begin="12190937508t" end="12207200003t" region="region11" style="style0">Why?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle496" begin="12207200003t" end="12229725006t" region="region32" style="style0">They say Horus' eyes</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle497" begin="12207200003t" end="12229725006t" region="region36" style="style0">are kept there.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle498" begin="12229725006t" end="12242647500t" region="region1" style="style0">his power again.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle499" begin="12229725006t" end="12242647500t" region="region38" style="style0">He would have</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle500" begin="12242647500t" end="12257667505t" region="region42" style="style0">Steal from a god?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle501" begin="12257667505t" end="12282687500t" region="region41" style="style0">Only a madman would try</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle502" begin="12257667505t" end="12282687500t" region="region39" style="style0">such a thing.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle503" begin="12282687500t" end="12302290000t" region="region58" style="style0">we could find someone so mad?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle504" begin="12282687500t" end="12302290000t" region="region96" style="style0">Where do you suppose</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle505" begin="12318562506t" end="12335660002t" region="region53" style="style0">The plans should be here.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle506" begin="12335660002t" end="12352340000t" region="region33" style="style0">Urshu built the vault.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle507" begin="12335660002t" end="12352340000t" region="region3" style="style0">He's Set's architect.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle508" begin="12369030006t" end="12383205000t" region="region5" style="style0">What's this?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle509" begin="12390720007t" end="12402390000t" region="region28" style="style0">Uh, Set's pyramid of sand.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle510" begin="12424497501t" end="12442847500t" region="region41" style="style0">BEK: He's built himself</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle511" begin="12424497501t" end="12442847500t" region="region40" style="style0">quite the fire pit.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle512" begin="12442847500t" end="12464537501t" region="region19" style="style0">He must cook massive feasts.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle513" begin="12464537501t" end="12482887500t" region="region35" style="style0">It's the pit to the center</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle514" begin="12464537501t" end="12482887500t" region="region39" style="style0">of the world.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle515" begin="12482887500t" end="12507500003t" region="region4" style="style0">The source of his power.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle516" begin="12482887500t" end="12507500003t" region="region37" style="style0">No feasts.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle517" begin="12521267508t" end="12532520000t" region="region61" style="style0">Found it.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle518" begin="12546705003t" end="12572977500t" region="region97" style="style0">The treasure will pass</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle519" begin="12546705003t" end="12572977500t" region="region27" style="style0">through the front gate.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle520" begin="12572977500t" end="12582987500t" region="region44" style="style0">isn't the problem.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle521" begin="12572977500t" end="12582987500t" region="region17" style="style0">The front gate</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle522" begin="12582987500t" end="12603007500t" region="region18" style="style0">It's what comes after.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle523" begin="12603007500t" end="12623027500t" region="region44" style="style0">rigged with traps.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle524" begin="12603007500t" end="12623027500t" region="region63" style="style0">Two bridges</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle525" begin="12623027500t" end="12633455000t" region="region44" style="style0">of them endlessly.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle526" begin="12623027500t" end="12633455000t" region="region75" style="style0">Urshu boasts</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle527" begin="12642222508t" end="12655145001t" region="region65" style="style0">Good thing I'm cheating.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle528" begin="12803207500t" end="12817392503t" region="region44" style="style0">properly, soldier.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle529" begin="12803207500t" end="12817392503t" region="region46" style="style0">Welcome me</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle530" begin="12833237500t" end="12852015008t" region="region56" style="style0">the Queen of Egypt waiting.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle531" begin="12833237500t" end="12852015008t" region="region62" style="style0">Don't keep</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle532" begin="13005077501t" end="13030107506t" region="region71" style="style0">SET:<span style="style1"> I think you missed me.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle533" begin="13005077501t" end="13030107506t" region="region64" style="style0">(CHUCKLES)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle534" begin="13030107506t" end="13053457500t" region="region40" style="style0">I have to miss you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle535" begin="13053457500t" end="13065555001t" region="region43" style="style0">I'm your prisoner,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle536" begin="13053457500t" end="13065555001t" region="region37" style="style0">after all.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle537" begin="13065555001t" end="13084322500t" region="region51" style="style0">Oh, this prison's</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle538" begin="13065555001t" end="13084322500t" region="region25" style="style0">not so bad.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle539" begin="13084322500t" end="13100177506t" region="region13" style="style0">Well, I'm miserable.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle540" begin="13113935000t" end="13129790006t" region="region32" style="style0">You have a funny way</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle541" begin="13113935000t" end="13129790006t" region="region30" style="style0">of showing it.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle542" begin="13133537500t" end="13157315003t" region="region65" style="style0">Can I borrow your knife?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle543" begin="13157315003t" end="13199860006t" region="region23" style="style0">So if you had the chance,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle544" begin="13157315003t" end="13199860006t" region="region59" style="style0">you'd kill me?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle545" begin="13209452506t" end="13221967508t" region="region3" style="style0">How could I kill you?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle546" begin="13235307501t" end="13251162507t" region="region38" style="style0">But you would</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle547" begin="13235307501t" end="13251162507t" region="region39" style="style0">if you could.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle548" begin="13263667500t" end="13280357506t" region="region56" style="style0">Better keep your eyes open.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle549" begin="13263667500t" end="13280357506t" region="region88" style="style0">(WHISPERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle550" begin="13383787500t" end="13395885001t" region="region61" style="style0">Lord Set.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle551" begin="13403807500t" end="13418410003t" region="region82" style="style0">(LAUGHS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle552" begin="13403807500t" end="13418410003t" region="region78" style="style0">Oh...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle553" begin="13418410003t" end="13433012508t" region="region13" style="style0">And, uh... Mistress.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle554" begin="13443847500t" end="13463867500t" region="region18" style="style0">come at a better time.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle555" begin="13443847500t" end="13463867500t" region="region10" style="style0">Perhaps I might</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle556" begin="13463867500t" end="13484722500t" region="region51" style="style0">SET: No, come in.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle557" begin="13463867500t" end="13484722500t" region="region39" style="style0">Don't be shy.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle558" begin="13484722500t" end="13500160006t" region="region39" style="style0">(SET EXHALES)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle559" begin="13524762500t" end="13538947505t" region="region76" style="style0">Come on.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle560" begin="13614017500t" end="13654057500t" region="region35" style="style0">No one has ever so honored</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle561" begin="13614017500t" end="13654057500t" region="region42" style="style0">the great God Ra.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle562" begin="13654057500t" end="13677835003t" region="region65" style="style0">over its peak and marvel</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle563" begin="13654057500t" end="13677835003t" region="region75" style="style0">He will pass</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle564" begin="13677835003t" end="13695350001t" region="region41" style="style0">at the tribute you have</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle565" begin="13677835003t" end="13695350001t" region="region60" style="style0">built in his name.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle566" begin="13710787506t" end="13723709999t" region="region25" style="style0">Is that it?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle567" begin="13732477508t" end="13745400001t" region="region37" style="style0">I'm sorry?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle568" begin="13753332508t" end="13766255001t" region="region54" style="style0">Well, can you make it</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle569" begin="13753332508t" end="13766255001t" region="region25" style="style0">any taller?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle570" begin="13785022500t" end="13800460006t" region="region66" style="style0">Taller?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle571" begin="13800460006t" end="13825062500t" region="region19" style="style0">Yes, it's a simple question.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle572" begin="13825062500t" end="13843829999t" region="region19" style="style0">that might be difficult, um,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle573" begin="13825062500t" end="13843829999t" region="region21" style="style0">(STUTTERS) Well,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle574" begin="13854257500t" end="13871365006t" region="region30" style="style0">now, I mean...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle575" begin="13871365006t" end="13889715005t" region="region38" style="style0">Relax, Urshu.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle576" begin="13871365006t" end="13889715005t" region="region25" style="style0">I'm joking.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle577" begin="13902647508t" end="13914317500t" region="region76" style="style0">(LAUGHS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle578" begin="13924327500t" end="13937260002t" region="region76" style="style0">Tell me,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle579" begin="13948105003t" end="13974377500t" region="region26" style="style0">why'd your father choose you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle580" begin="13948105003t" end="13974377500t" region="region13" style="style0">to be master builder</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle581" begin="13974377500t" end="13996902502t" region="region3" style="style0">one of your brothers?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle582" begin="13974377500t" end="13996902502t" region="region63" style="style0">rather than</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle583" begin="13996902502t" end="14020262506t" region="region35" style="style0">I suppose because I proved</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle584" begin="13996902502t" end="14020262506t" region="region65" style="style0">to be the best, My Lord.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle585" begin="14020262506t" end="14045282500t" region="region19" style="style0">to be the best to my father.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle586" begin="14020262506t" end="14045282500t" region="region21" style="style0">As I shall prove</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle587" begin="14064467500t" end="14098255003t" region="region44" style="style0">from dawn to dusk.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle588" begin="14064467500t" end="14098255003t" region="region10" style="style0">He shall see it</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle589" begin="14098255003t" end="14115770001t" region="region65" style="style0">is worth more than gold.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle590" begin="14098255003t" end="14115770001t" region="region51" style="style0">Your satisfaction</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle591" begin="14124527500t" end="14144547500t" region="region36" style="style0">Oh, gold, gold!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle592" begin="14144547500t" end="14159567505t" region="region98" style="style0">You'll have plenty</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle593" begin="14144547500t" end="14159567505t" region="region44" style="style0">for the Afterlife.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle594" begin="14144547500t" end="14159567505t" region="region63" style="style0">enough gold</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle595" begin="14159567505t" end="14173335008t" region="region76" style="style0">A toast!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle596" begin="14182927508t" end="14199607505t" region="region19" style="style0">To Egypt's greatest builder.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle597" begin="14219627505t" end="14247987502t" region="region3" style="style0">A toast to my legacy.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle598" begin="14264667500t" end="14277182502t" region="region40" style="style0">(ELEPHANTS TRUMPET)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle599" begin="14409817505t" end="14424002508t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle600" begin="14471965006t" end="14484887500t" region="region40" style="style0">(BREATHING HEAVILY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle601" begin="14794372508t" end="14806460001t" region="region39" style="style0">(BEK SCREAMS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle602" begin="14821480006t" end="14834819999t" region="region78" style="style0">Whoa!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle603" begin="14842335006t" end="14854839999t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle604" begin="15000407505t" end="15014999999t" region="region5" style="style0">(CHITTERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle605" begin="15027515001t" end="15043787508t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle606" begin="15054632508t" end="15069642503t" region="region65" style="style0">get that many scorpions?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle607" begin="15054632508t" end="15069642503t" region="region51" style="style0">Where do you even</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle608" begin="15426245000t" end="15446682500t" region="region23" style="style0">Enough to make you afraid</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle609" begin="15426245000t" end="15446682500t" region="region40" style="style0">of your own shadow.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle610" begin="15746147500t" end="15765749999t" region="region19" style="style0">&quot;The circle is the trigger.&quot;</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle611" begin="15794955008t" end="15807460001t" region="region44" style="style0">So I'll go 'round.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle612" begin="15851257505t" end="15867520001t" region="region13" style="style0">Well, that was easy.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle613" begin="15896297500t" end="15909230002t" region="region37" style="style0">(RATTLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle614" begin="16140712503t" end="16155732508t" region="region40" style="style0">(BREATHING SHAKILY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle615" begin="16175752508t" end="16187840001t" region="region61" style="style0">(PANTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle616" begin="16233307506t" end="16246229999t" region="region36" style="style0">A third bridge.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle617" begin="16279600002t" end="16298785001t" region="region35" style="style0">Doesn't say anything about</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle618" begin="16279600002t" end="16298785001t" region="region36" style="style0">a third bridge.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle619" begin="16316717500t" end="16329650002t" region="region42" style="style0">This is criminal.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle620" begin="16349670002t" end="16363855006t" region="region42" style="style0">And only one eye.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle621" begin="16410565003t" end="16427662500t" region="region61" style="style0">Terrific.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle622" begin="16427662500t" end="16462285005t" region="region23" style="style0">Zaya, you'd say a prayer,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle623" begin="16427662500t" end="16462285005t" region="region99" style="style0">I'll roll the bones.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle624" begin="16492732506t" end="16506489999t" region="region37" style="style0">(RATTLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle625" begin="16576977500t" end="16589492502t" region="region66" style="style0">(YELLS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle626" begin="16671660003t" end="16686262508t" region="region18" style="style0">(SCORPIONS CHITTERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle627" begin="16689592502t" end="16703777506t" region="region66" style="style0">(GASPS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle628" begin="16770925003t" end="16784692507t" region="region37" style="style0">(CHUCKLES)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle629" begin="16865607508t" end="16877277500t" region="region78" style="style0">Zaya!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle630" begin="16897297500t" end="16909812502t" region="region28" style="style0">(WHISPERING) I'm so sorry.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle631" begin="16944017506t" end="16976959999t" region="region18" style="style0">were not sufficient...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle632" begin="16944017506t" end="16976959999t" region="region94" style="style0">As if using my house</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle633" begin="16944017506t" end="16976959999t" region="region32" style="style0">for your fornicating</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle634" begin="17027427500t" end="17042865005t" region="region17" style="style0">You dare steal</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle635" begin="17027427500t" end="17042865005t" region="region30" style="style0">from the King?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle636" begin="17110430002t" end="17140460002t" region="region56" style="style0">in an orderly office, Zaya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle637" begin="17110430002t" end="17140460002t" region="region83" style="style0">I pride myself</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle638" begin="17156732508t" end="17183422506t" region="region53" style="style0">understand that, did you?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle639" begin="17156732508t" end="17183422506t" region="region38" style="style0">You never did</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle640" begin="17183422506t" end="17207607500t" region="region26" style="style0">Oh, and this pathetic little</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle641" begin="17183422506t" end="17207607500t" region="region1" style="style0">trinket of yours</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle642" begin="17207607500t" end="17227627500t" region="region40" style="style0">of you, I'm afraid.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle643" begin="17207607500t" end="17227627500t" region="region51" style="style0">will save neither</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle644" begin="17227627500t" end="17241812503t" region="region53" style="style0">(SOFTLY) Set is your god.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle645" begin="17241812503t" end="17257240000t" region="region94" style="style0">-It was all my idea.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle646" begin="17241812503t" end="17257240000t" region="region100" style="style0">-Liar!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle647" begin="17317717500t" end="17332737505t" region="region30" style="style0">what you took.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle648" begin="17317717500t" end="17332737505t" region="region75" style="style0">Give me back</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle649" begin="17399467501t" end="17416992508t" region="region37" style="style0">Thank you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle650" begin="17432420003t" end="17451187502t" region="region10" style="style0">to the jackals.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle651" begin="17432420003t" end="17451187502t" region="region101" style="style0">-Feed them</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle652" begin="17432420003t" end="17451187502t" region="region47" style="style0">-Wait!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle653" begin="17464537506t" end="17486227508t" region="region40" style="style0">(BREATHING HEAVILY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle654" begin="17486227508t" end="17503325005t" region="region33" style="style0">I took something else.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle655" begin="17486227508t" end="17503325005t" region="region36" style="style0">(URSHU SCREAMS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle656" begin="17553792506t" end="17569220001t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle657" begin="17553792506t" end="17569220001t" region="region102" style="style0">Run!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle658" begin="17632620003t" end="17644717506t" region="region1" style="style0">(HORSE WHINNIES)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle659" begin="17632620003t" end="17644717506t" region="region82" style="style0">(URGING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle660" begin="17751070002t" end="17776935008t" region="region33" style="style0">(CHUCKLES) You did it.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle661" begin="17751070002t" end="17776935008t" region="region44" style="style0">Where's the other?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle662" begin="17789857501t" end="17808625000t" region="region4" style="style0">You know how hard it was</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle663" begin="17789857501t" end="17808625000t" region="region44" style="style0">to steal that one?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle664" begin="17808625000t" end="17823227505t" region="region5" style="style0">(BOTH LAUGH)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle665" begin="17848247500t" end="17860762502t" region="region66" style="style0">(GASPS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle666" begin="17885375006t" end="17897880000t" region="region76" style="style0">(GROANS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle667" begin="17990475001t" end="18005495006t" region="region61" style="style0">(GASPING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle668" begin="18005495006t" end="18018000000t" region="region18" style="style0">I'll love you forever.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle669" begin="18021340002t" end="18033437505t" region="region90" style="style0">Zaya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle670" begin="18033437505t" end="18048030000t" region="region3" style="style0">Death is not the end.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle671" begin="18050952502t" end="18065137506t" region="region78" style="style0">Zaya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle672" begin="18214870006t" end="18224462506t" region="region42" style="style0">(HORSES NEIGHING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle673" begin="18224462506t" end="18236977508t" region="region78" style="style0">Whoa.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle674" begin="18298697500t" end="18314970006t" region="region53" style="style0">I'll make it right, Zaya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle675" begin="18740807501t" end="18761245001t" region="region3" style="style0">any more worshippers.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle676" begin="18740807501t" end="18761245001t" region="region0" style="style0">HORUS: I don't need</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle677" begin="18777517508t" end="18799197500t" region="region38" style="style0">Tributes that</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle678" begin="18777517508t" end="18799197500t" region="region30" style="style0">rot and stink.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle679" begin="18812130002t" end="18837577508t" region="region67" style="style0">Unless you brought</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle680" begin="18812130002t" end="18837577508t" region="region40" style="style0">more wine, get out.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle681" begin="18847170007t" end="18859257500t" region="region44" style="style0">I'm no worshipper.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle682" begin="18869267500t" end="18888870000t" region="region38" style="style0">What are you?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle683" begin="18869267500t" end="18888870000t" region="region25" style="style0">Some thief?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle684" begin="18899297500t" end="18918492508t" region="region39" style="style0">Yes. A thief.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle685" begin="18933085003t" end="18949347500t" region="region44" style="style0">Set took from you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle686" begin="18933085003t" end="18949347500t" region="region21" style="style0">I have something</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle687" begin="18961027501t" end="18978135008t" region="region76" style="style0">(GROANS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle688" begin="19049447500t" end="19069885000t" region="region0" style="style0">No mortal could rob</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle689" begin="19049447500t" end="19069885000t" region="region89" style="style0">Set's vault.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle690" begin="19084070003t" end="19107430007t" region="region33" style="style0">You pilfered one of my</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle691" begin="19084070003t" end="19107430007t" region="region40" style="style0">followers' corpses.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle692" begin="19107430007t" end="19119100000t" region="region10" style="style0">They never even</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle693" begin="19107430007t" end="19119100000t" region="region64" style="style0">got close.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle694" begin="19126615006t" end="19139120000t" region="region1" style="style0">Give them to me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle695" begin="19141625001t" end="19154557505t" region="region76" style="style0">Not yet.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle696" begin="19154557505t" end="19169567500t" region="region1" style="style0">Give me my eyes.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle697" begin="19169567500t" end="19185422506t" region="region3" style="style0">I have a proposition.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle698" begin="19185422506t" end="19199180000t" region="region13" style="style0">You bargain with me?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle699" begin="19209607500t" end="19222957502t" region="region37" style="style0">(GRUNTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle700" begin="19288862508t" end="19306377506t" region="region36" style="style0">I'm willing to.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle701" begin="19288862508t" end="19306377506t" region="region88" style="style0">You're lucky</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle702" begin="19306377506t" end="19319717500t" region="region65" style="style0">a three-legged elephant.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle703" begin="19306377506t" end="19319717500t" region="region21" style="style0">You can't strike</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle704" begin="19333485003t" end="19358097508t" region="region48" style="style0">You want a reward, I suppose?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle705" begin="19333485003t" end="19358097508t" region="region78" style="style0">Gold?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle706" begin="19358097508t" end="19371855001t" region="region51" style="style0">Gold I can steal.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle707" begin="19358097508t" end="19371855001t" region="region70" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle708" begin="19539937500t" end="19554122503t" region="region75" style="style0">(CLATTERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle709" begin="19539937500t" end="19554122503t" region="region61" style="style0">(EXHALES)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle710" begin="19585822506t" end="19598755008t" region="region10" style="style0">There's someone</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle711" begin="19585822506t" end="19598755008t" region="region39" style="style0">I want saved.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle712" begin="19632115001t" end="19646717506t" region="region37" style="style0">From what?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle713" begin="19658397508t" end="19670485000t" region="region47" style="style0">Death.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle714" begin="19670485000t" end="19690922500t" region="region76" style="style0">(SCOFFS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle715" begin="19690922500t" end="19703855003t" region="region69" style="style0">Didn't your father teach</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle716" begin="19690922500t" end="19703855003t" region="region53" style="style0">that death isn't the end?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle717" begin="19703855003t" end="19725127505t" region="region42" style="style0">It can't be done.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle718" begin="19725127505t" end="19750982500t" region="region94" style="style0">Well, figure it out.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle719" begin="19725127505t" end="19750982500t" region="region1" style="style0">Lord of the Air!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle720" begin="19725127505t" end="19750982500t" region="region38" style="style0">You're Horus,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle721" begin="19750982500t" end="19773090002t" region="region41" style="style0">Or maybe I'll just toss</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle722" begin="19750982500t" end="19773090002t" region="region65" style="style0">what I have in the Nile.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle723" begin="19773090002t" end="19787275006t" region="region78" style="style0">Wait.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle724" begin="19890287500t" end="19901132500t" region="region19" style="style0">HORUS:<span style="style1"> Stay with the living.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle725" begin="19910307500t" end="19924492503t" region="region3" style="style0">Stay with the living.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle726" begin="19937007506t" end="19949105008t" region="region3" style="style0">Stay with the living.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle727" begin="19987057506t" end="20010407500t" region="region33" style="style0">where I can reach her.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle728" begin="19987057506t" end="20010407500t" region="region98" style="style0">-She's gone beyond</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle729" begin="19987057506t" end="20010407500t" region="region44" style="style0">-But you're a god.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle730" begin="20010407500t" end="20029602508t" region="region13" style="style0">1,000 of your years,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle731" begin="20010407500t" end="20029602508t" region="region38" style="style0">Gods may live</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle732" begin="20029602508t" end="20045030003t" region="region36" style="style0">cure mortality.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle733" begin="20029602508t" end="20045030003t" region="region38" style="style0">but we cannot</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle734" begin="20060457500t" end="20080477500t" region="region51" style="style0">It's time for her</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle735" begin="20060457500t" end="20080477500t" region="region42" style="style0">to walk the path.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle736" begin="20080477500t" end="20090487500t" region="region3" style="style0">something you can do.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle737" begin="20080477500t" end="20090487500t" region="region38" style="style0">There must be</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle738" begin="20090487500t" end="20103002502t" region="region13" style="style0">I've done all I can.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle739" begin="20121352500t" end="20146382506t" region="region58" style="style0">Oh, thou who art everlasting,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle740" begin="20146382506t" end="20167655006t" region="region103" style="style0">send your servant</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle741" begin="20146382506t" end="20167655006t" region="region51" style="style0">to guide the dead</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle742" begin="20146382506t" end="20167655006t" region="region89" style="style0">to new life.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle743" begin="20227715006t" end="20245647505t" region="region40" style="style0">Anubis, come forth.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle744" begin="20245647505t" end="20260240000t" region="region30" style="style0">(WIND HOWLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle745" begin="20381195000t" end="20398302507t" region="region42" style="style0">You are released.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle746" begin="20483800002t" end="20519675008t" region="region43" style="style0">The doors of Earth</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle747" begin="20483800002t" end="20519675008t" region="region1" style="style0">are open to you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle748" begin="20519675008t" end="20540112508t" region="region17" style="style0">You must begin</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle749" begin="20519675008t" end="20540112508t" region="region39" style="style0">your journey.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle750" begin="20540112508t" end="20555122503t" region="region42" style="style0">She died a slave.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle751" begin="20555122503t" end="20568055006t" region="region13" style="style0">she won't be allowed</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle752" begin="20555122503t" end="20568055006t" region="region51" style="style0">Without treasure,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle753" begin="20568055006t" end="20580560000t" region="region27" style="style0">through the Final Gate.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle754" begin="20585152503t" end="20601415000t" region="region44" style="style0">What do you offer?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle755" begin="20601415000t" end="20620600000t" region="region40" style="style0">into the Afterlife.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle756" begin="20601415000t" end="20620600000t" region="region83" style="style0">She can't pass</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle757" begin="20636037505t" end="20656892506t" region="region3" style="style0">For you, Lord Anubis,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle758" begin="20656892506t" end="20677747506t" region="region53" style="style0">who is upon his mountain,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle759" begin="20656892506t" end="20677747506t" region="region54" style="style0">Governor of the Bows,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle760" begin="20707777506t" end="20722370001t" region="region3" style="style0">I have only my smile.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle761" begin="20733215001t" end="20748235006t" region="region61" style="style0">So be it.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle762" begin="20782847501t" end="20800372508t" region="region37" style="style0">BEK: Zaya!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle763" begin="20802032500t" end="20821217500t" region="region78" style="style0">Zaya!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle764" begin="20821217500t" end="20830810000t" region="region32" style="style0">The dead don't speak</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle765" begin="20821217500t" end="20830810000t" region="region30" style="style0">to the living.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle766" begin="20957610006t" end="20972620001t" region="region42" style="style0">Stay on the path.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle767" begin="21080652508t" end="21093992502t" region="region56" style="style0">HORUS: Now give them to me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle768" begin="21109847508t" end="21129450007t" region="region54" style="style0">-You've done nothing!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle769" begin="21109847508t" end="21129450007t" region="region61" style="style0">-My eyes.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle770" begin="21129450007t" end="21151547500t" region="region71" style="style0">Spend the rest of your days</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle771" begin="21129450007t" end="21151547500t" region="region56" style="style0">wandering around sightless.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle772" begin="21151547500t" end="21163645001t" region="region41" style="style0">I have nothing to lose.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle773" begin="21151547500t" end="21163645001t" region="region60" style="style0">Do you understand?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle774" begin="21163645001t" end="21185335003t" region="region1" style="style0">Give me my eyes.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle775" begin="21185335003t" end="21200355008t" region="region58" style="style0">her again or I'll die trying.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle776" begin="21185335003t" end="21200355008t" region="region23" style="style0">I will do anything to see</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle777" begin="21215365003t" end="21232462500t" region="region23" style="style0">You want to hide from me?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle778" begin="21215365003t" end="21232462500t" region="region40" style="style0">Learn to talk less.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle779" begin="21265832503t" end="21280852508t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle780" begin="21265832503t" end="21280852508t" region="region74" style="style0">Here.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle781" begin="21293775001t" end="21308377506t" region="region66" style="style0">(GASPS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle782" begin="21377612506t" end="21390545008t" region="region66" style="style0">(SIGHS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle783" begin="21390545008t" end="21402215000t" region="region44" style="style0">Where's the other?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle784" begin="21406390003t" end="21420992508t" region="region37" style="style0">(STUTTERS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle785" begin="21426827505t" end="21442255000t" region="region44" style="style0">Where's the other?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle786" begin="21442255000t" end="21461857500t" region="region71" style="style0">Well, I'm not exactly sure,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle787" begin="21442255000t" end="21461857500t" region="region70" style="style0">but I...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle788" begin="21461857500t" end="21477712506t" region="region13" style="style0">I'll snap your neck.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle789" begin="21477712506t" end="21494392502t" region="region61" style="style0">(CHOKING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle790" begin="21494392502t" end="21516917505t" region="region35" style="style0">You must hate Set for what</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle791" begin="21494392502t" end="21516917505t" region="region18" style="style0">he did to your father.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle792" begin="21555705003t" end="21572385000t" region="region5" style="style0">The pyramid.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle793" begin="21572385000t" end="21584900002t" region="region33" style="style0">I know how to get into</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle794" begin="21572385000t" end="21584900002t" region="region30" style="style0">Set's pyramid.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle795" begin="21597832506t" end="21611590000t" region="region11" style="style0">How?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle796" begin="21622017500t" end="21633280001t" region="region11" style="style0">How?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle797" begin="21644960002t" end="21659145006t" region="region78" style="style0">Oh...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle798" begin="21666650003t" end="21683747501t" region="region61" style="style0">(GASPING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle799" begin="21683747501t" end="21704602502t" region="region56" style="style0">his power locked up, right?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle800" begin="21683747501t" end="21704602502t" region="region0" style="style0">It's where he keeps</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle801" begin="21704602502t" end="21730467508t" region="region35" style="style0">If I could get you inside,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle802" begin="21704602502t" end="21730467508t" region="region40" style="style0">could you kill him?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle803" begin="21734632502t" end="21749235006t" region="region5" style="style0">(BEK GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle804" begin="21770090007t" end="21782177500t" region="region18" style="style0">How would you do that?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle805" begin="21787187505t" end="21802615000t" region="region1" style="style0">I saw the plans.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle806" begin="21802615000t" end="21819305006t" region="region76" style="style0">Tell me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle807" begin="21819305006t" end="21828480006t" region="region10" style="style0">-I'll show you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle808" begin="21819305006t" end="21828480006t" region="region66" style="style0">-Go on.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle809" begin="21828480006t" end="21842237500t" region="region27" style="style0">If you bring Zaya back.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle810" begin="21879365006t" end="21892287500t" region="region40" style="style0">There may be a way.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle811" begin="21916065003t" end="21942337500t" region="region56" style="style0">the Afterlife once entered.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle812" begin="21916065003t" end="21942337500t" region="region41" style="style0">HORUS: No one may leave</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle813" begin="21942337500t" end="21954435001t" region="region18" style="style0">through the Nine Gates</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle814" begin="21942337500t" end="21954435001t" region="region10" style="style0">But the journey</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle815" begin="21954435001t" end="21967785005t" region="region33" style="style0">will take several days</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle816" begin="21954435001t" end="21967785005t" region="region5" style="style0">to complete.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle817" begin="21982377500t" end="22005320002t" region="region28" style="style0">can make Anubis turn back.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle818" begin="21982377500t" end="22005320002t" region="region51" style="style0">And only the King</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle819" begin="22020757508t" end="22052447500t" region="region27" style="style0">and take back the crown</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle820" begin="22020757508t" end="22052447500t" region="region38" style="style0">If I kill Set</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle821" begin="22052447500t" end="22071642508t" region="region27" style="style0">reaches the Final Gate,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle822" begin="22052447500t" end="22071642508t" region="region0" style="style0">before your beloved</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle823" begin="22082477500t" end="22097497505t" region="region19" style="style0">I might be able to save her.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle824" begin="22112507500t" end="22127945005t" region="region37" style="style0">(RUMBLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle825" begin="22175072502t" end="22189675006t" region="region36" style="style0">Try to keep up.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle826" begin="22249317506t" end="22272667500t" region="region0" style="style0">SET: My magnificent</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle827" begin="22249317506t" end="22272667500t" region="region59" style="style0">bloody hounds.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle828" begin="22272667500t" end="22293522500t" region="region40" style="style0">(SOLDIERS CHEERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle829" begin="22293522500t" end="22332727500t" region="region21" style="style0">You are the true</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle830" begin="22293522500t" end="22332727500t" region="region30" style="style0">sons of Egypt.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle831" begin="22332727500t" end="22352330000t" region="region0" style="style0">You are my children</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle832" begin="22332727500t" end="22352330000t" region="region60" style="style0">of iron and blood.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle833" begin="22369855006t" end="22386952503t" region="region43" style="style0">No father could be</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle834" begin="22369855006t" end="22386952503t" region="region25" style="style0">more proud.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle835" begin="22407390003t" end="22423652500t" region="region28" style="style0">have choked on our spears.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle836" begin="22407390003t" end="22423652500t" region="region17" style="style0">The rebel gods</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle837" begin="22437420003t" end="22462857500t" region="region41" style="style0">The rest have retreated</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle838" begin="22437420003t" end="22462857500t" region="region27" style="style0">to Nephthys' stronghold</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle839" begin="22462857500t" end="22492887500t" region="region32" style="style0">where they now stand</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle840" begin="22462857500t" end="22492887500t" region="region42" style="style0">ready to face us.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle841" begin="22492887500t" end="22520005006t" region="region0" style="style0">But you, my legions</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle842" begin="22492887500t" end="22520005006t" region="region59" style="style0">of the desert,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle843" begin="22520005006t" end="22541695008t" region="region28" style="style0">will bring them reckoning!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle844" begin="22541695008t" end="22553782500t" region="region37" style="style0">(CHEERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle845" begin="22572967500t" end="22589657506t" region="region35" style="style0">So take your fill of gold!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle846" begin="22572967500t" end="22589657506t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle847" begin="22621775008t" end="22633862500t" region="region51" style="style0">And if you should</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle848" begin="22621775008t" end="22633862500t" region="region59" style="style0">fall in battle</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle849" begin="22633862500t" end="22653047500t" region="region28" style="style0">and travel the Nine Gates,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle850" begin="22653047500t" end="22683077500t" region="region18" style="style0">who it is you worship!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle851" begin="22653047500t" end="22683077500t" region="region10" style="style0">tell my brother</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle852" begin="22683077500t" end="22707690003t" region="region33" style="style0">GENERAL: Division Set!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle853" begin="22683077500t" end="22707690003t" region="region36" style="style0">Amarn! Ta! Rai!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle854" begin="22713107500t" end="22727292503t" region="region76" style="style0">Fall in!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle855" begin="22736050002t" end="22754400001t" region="region30" style="style0">Forward march!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle856" begin="22857005003t" end="22871607508t" region="region36" style="style0">(MNEVIS GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle857" begin="22871607508t" end="22883277500t" region="region76" style="style0">My Lord.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle858" begin="22908307505t" end="22930832507t" region="region0" style="style0">Your royal treasury</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle859" begin="22908307505t" end="22930832507t" region="region60" style="style0">has been breached.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle860" begin="22951270007t" end="22973785000t" region="region39" style="style0">SET:<span style="style1"> Urshu...</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle861" begin="22973785000t" end="23002980000t" region="region104" style="style0">Wasn't the eye meant to lure</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle862" begin="22973785000t" end="23002980000t" region="region32" style="style0">those loyal to Horus</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle863" begin="22973785000t" end="23002980000t" region="region1" style="style0">to their deaths?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle864" begin="23013407500t" end="23029262506t" region="region36" style="style0">(MNEVIS GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle865" begin="23013407500t" end="23029262506t" region="region62" style="style0">Yes, Lord.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle866" begin="23029262506t" end="23048030003t" region="region53" style="style0">And weren't your traps...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle867" begin="23060127506t" end="23076807502t" region="region56" style="style0">What was the term you used?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle868" begin="23087235003t" end="23101837508t" region="region5" style="style0">Thief-proof?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle869" begin="23108090003t" end="23123100000t" region="region37" style="style0">Yes, Lord.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle870" begin="23128527505t" end="23141877508t" region="region28" style="style0">Can you pick up the trail?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle871" begin="23141877508t" end="23155217501t" region="region30" style="style0">I'll find him.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle872" begin="23155217501t" end="23173985000t" region="region43" style="style0">And find whichever</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle873" begin="23155217501t" end="23173985000t" region="region39" style="style0">of his allies</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle874" begin="23173985000t" end="23196510002t" region="region18" style="style0">to steal back his eye.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle875" begin="23173985000t" end="23196510002t" region="region51" style="style0">was clever enough</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle876" begin="23228627505t" end="23246977502t" region="region18" style="style0">It was a mortal, Lord.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle877" begin="23267415003t" end="23277842503t" region="region61" style="style0">A mortal?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle878" begin="23277842503t" end="23292862508t" region="region13" style="style0">(CHUCKLES NERVOUSLY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle879" begin="23353747500t" end="23366262502t" region="region25" style="style0">Who is she?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle880" begin="23366262502t" end="23378360003t" region="region5" style="style0">His servant.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle881" begin="23378360003t" end="23398380003t" region="region18" style="style0">In my defense, Lord...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle882" begin="23398380003t" end="23429662506t" region="region26" style="style0">Believe me, I'm very curious</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle883" begin="23398380003t" end="23429662506t" region="region19" style="style0">to hear what your excuse is.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle884" begin="23429662506t" end="23440090006t" region="region44" style="style0">But not right now.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle885" begin="23440090006t" end="23453430000t" region="region37" style="style0">Yes, Lord.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle886" begin="23493062508t" end="23509742506t" region="region56" style="style0">Well, it appears you're not</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle887" begin="23509742506t" end="23526840002t" region="region32" style="style0">the cleverest mortal</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle888" begin="23509742506t" end="23526840002t" region="region40" style="style0">in Egypt after all.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle889" begin="23533927500t" end="23547277502t" region="region30" style="style0">This thief is.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle890" begin="23574385000t" end="23594405000t" region="region28" style="style0">BEK: So what is your plan?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle891" begin="23594405000t" end="23612765008t" region="region18" style="style0">the God of the Desert,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle892" begin="23594405000t" end="23612765008t" region="region17" style="style0">HORUS: To kill</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle893" begin="23612765008t" end="23626522502t" region="region44" style="style0">the desert itself.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle894" begin="23612765008t" end="23626522502t" region="region75" style="style0">we must kill</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle895" begin="23634027500t" end="23646960002t" region="region1" style="style0">Kill the desert?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle896" begin="23654465000t" end="23671572507t" region="region57" style="style0">How do you kill the desert?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle897" begin="23734127500t" end="23754147500t" region="region13" style="style0">to my grandfather's.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle898" begin="23734127500t" end="23754147500t" region="region46" style="style0">We must go</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle899" begin="23754147500t" end="23767080002t" region="region19" style="style0">He'll help us with our task.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle900" begin="23767080002t" end="23784177500t" region="region42" style="style0">Your grandfather?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle901" begin="23784177500t" end="23798780003t" region="region36" style="style0">The Sun God Ra?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle902" begin="23784177500t" end="23798780003t" region="region88" style="style0">You mean Ra?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle903" begin="23816712502t" end="23833402508t" region="region13" style="style0">is your grandfather?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle904" begin="23816712502t" end="23833402508t" region="region21" style="style0">So where exactly</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle905" begin="23872607508t" end="23892627508t" region="region88" style="style0">You're being</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle906" begin="23872607508t" end="23892627508t" region="region39" style="style0">funny, right?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle907" begin="23892627508t" end="23907220002t" region="region26" style="style0">You think I'd put any effort</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle908" begin="23892627508t" end="23907220002t" region="region53" style="style0">into trying to amuse you?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle909" begin="23918482503t" end="23939337505t" region="region28" style="style0">would be useful right now.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle910" begin="23918482503t" end="23939337505t" region="region10" style="style0">It seems flying</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle911" begin="23939337505t" end="23963115008t" region="region54" style="style0">Without both my eyes,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle912" begin="23939337505t" end="23963115008t" region="region40" style="style0">I cannot transform.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle913" begin="23963115008t" end="23975620001t" region="region17" style="style0">I need to pray</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle914" begin="23963115008t" end="23975620001t" region="region39" style="style0">for strength.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle915" begin="23983135008t" end="23999397505t" region="region56" style="style0">Oh, that's not encouraging.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle916" begin="23999397505t" end="24017330002t" region="region56" style="style0">the bottom of this mountain</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle917" begin="23999397505t" end="24017330002t" region="region23" style="style0">Be silent or you'll reach</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle918" begin="24017330002t" end="24034010000t" region="region53" style="style0">than you reached the top.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle919" begin="24017330002t" end="24034010000t" region="region88" style="style0">much quicker</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle920" begin="24044437500t" end="24056952502t" region="region30" style="style0">(WIND HOWLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle921" begin="24044437500t" end="24056952502t" region="region105" style="style0">(GASPS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle922" begin="24220870006t" end="24250065005t" region="region27" style="style0">Great Ra, know my name.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle923" begin="24264657500t" end="24278007502t" region="region0" style="style0">The Lord of the Air</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle924" begin="24264657500t" end="24278007502t" region="region40" style="style0">seeks your embrace.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle925" begin="24345572500t" end="24371437506t" region="region53" style="style0">I need your help. Please!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle926" begin="24345572500t" end="24371437506t" region="region41" style="style0">(WHISPERS) Grandfather,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle927" begin="24525752500t" end="24539937505t" region="region37" style="style0">Impressed!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle928" begin="24544937500t" end="24562045006t" region="region76" style="style0">(LAUGHS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle929" begin="24795187500t" end="24808537502t" region="region5" style="style0">(BEK GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle930" begin="24873190007t" end="24884860000t" region="region53" style="style0">HORUS: Stay in my shadow.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle931" begin="24892375006t" end="24910307505t" region="region44" style="style0">-Just do as I say.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle932" begin="24892375006t" end="24910307505t" region="region74" style="style0">-Why?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle933" begin="24910307505t" end="24922405006t" region="region17" style="style0">(SKIN SIZZLES)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle934" begin="24910307505t" end="24922405006t" region="region76" style="style0">(GROANS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle935" begin="24939085003t" end="24954930000t" region="region51" style="style0">HORUS: Hail, thou</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle936" begin="24939085003t" end="24954930000t" region="region39" style="style0">Great God Ra.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle937" begin="24968280002t" end="24994562508t" region="region54" style="style0">Normally, when a bird</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle938" begin="24968280002t" end="24994562508t" region="region42" style="style0">lands on my boat,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle939" begin="24994562508t" end="25007902502t" region="region21" style="style0">I kill it before</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle940" begin="24994562508t" end="25007902502t" region="region5" style="style0">it can shit.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle941" begin="25029592503t" end="25045855000t" region="region39" style="style0">What is this?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle942" begin="25045855000t" end="25069215003t" region="region28" style="style0">to the source of Creation?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle943" begin="25045855000t" end="25069215003t" region="region41" style="style0">You dare bring a mortal</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle944" begin="25069215003t" end="25094662508t" region="region58" style="style0">I could not leave him behind.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle945" begin="25069215003t" end="25094662508t" region="region96" style="style0">He's valuable to me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle946" begin="25094662508t" end="25127187501t" region="region44" style="style0">Why have you come?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle947" begin="25094662508t" end="25127187501t" region="region106" style="style0">Ah.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle948" begin="25127187501t" end="25144295008t" region="region52" style="style0">I would only ask</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle949" begin="25127187501t" end="25144295008t" region="region42" style="style0">something of you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle950" begin="25144295008t" end="25161392506t" region="region42" style="style0">Oh, in that case,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle951" begin="25161392506t" end="25196422500t" region="region71" style="style0">I shall stop what I'm doing</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle952" begin="25161392506t" end="25196422500t" region="region72" style="style0">and heed your bidding.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle953" begin="25196422500t" end="25214365008t" region="region41" style="style0">Grandfather, I'm sorry.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle954" begin="25196422500t" end="25214365008t" region="region3" style="style0">I mean no disrespect.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle955" begin="25214365008t" end="25233967508t" region="region83" style="style0">You don't know</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle956" begin="25214365008t" end="25233967508t" region="region36" style="style0">the difference.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle957" begin="25233967508t" end="25246890001t" region="region53" style="style0">(HOWLING IN THE DISTANCE)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle958" begin="25287765001t" end="25306532500t" region="region3" style="style0">Stay there. Be quiet.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle959" begin="25325717500t" end="25343242507t" region="region44" style="style0">I have work to do.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle960" begin="25372020006t" end="25385360000t" region="region36" style="style0">(GRUNTS SOFTLY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle961" begin="25528840002t" end="25546772500t" region="region48" style="style0">And put the mortal below deck</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle962" begin="25528840002t" end="25546772500t" region="region107" style="style0">if you want him to live.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle963" begin="25765332508t" end="25777002500t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle964" begin="25963027506t" end="25976785000t" region="region37" style="style0">(GROWLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle965" begin="26053117506t" end="26068962502t" region="region1" style="style0">(APOPHIS GROANS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle966" begin="26090235003t" end="26104002507t" region="region37" style="style0">(GRUNTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle967" begin="26356747500t" end="26388030001t" region="region54" style="style0">Crawl back to shadow,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle968" begin="26356747500t" end="26388030001t" region="region60" style="style0">you stinking worm!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle969" begin="26403467506t" end="26434332507t" region="region54" style="style0">You shall never feast</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle970" begin="26403467506t" end="26434332507t" region="region36" style="style0">on my creation!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle971" begin="26452682506t" end="26471450003t" region="region42" style="style0">Try as you might.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle972" begin="26507732500t" end="26527335000t" region="region23" style="style0">Things would be different</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle973" begin="26507732500t" end="26527335000t" region="region55" style="style0">if I could dwell</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle974" begin="26527335000t" end="26554870007t" region="region28" style="style0">in the garden of the Nile.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle975" begin="26527335000t" end="26554870007t" region="region0" style="style0">amongst my children</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle976" begin="26554870007t" end="26582812506t" region="region28" style="style0">to fight the demon Apophis</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle977" begin="26554870007t" end="26582812506t" region="region10" style="style0">It is my burden</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle978" begin="26582812506t" end="26597822500t" region="region44" style="style0">night after night.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle979" begin="26597822500t" end="26616590000t" region="region0" style="style0">Egypt must never be</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle980" begin="26597822500t" end="26616590000t" region="region40" style="style0">destroyed by Chaos.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle981" begin="26626192508t" end="26644960007t" region="region5" style="style0">So, you see,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle982" begin="26644960007t" end="26666640000t" region="region21" style="style0">there are things</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle983" begin="26644960007t" end="26666640000t" region="region36" style="style0">worse than Set.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle984" begin="26677067500t" end="26691670003t" region="region39" style="style0">You're wrong.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle985" begin="26691670003t" end="26712942506t" region="region4" style="style0">That demon isn't the one</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle986" begin="26691670003t" end="26712942506t" region="region27" style="style0">who murdered my father.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle987" begin="26712942506t" end="26724205006t" region="region44" style="style0">Murdered your son.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle988" begin="26724205006t" end="26750895003t" region="region18" style="style0">They are both my sons.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle989" begin="26750895003t" end="26767157500t" region="region32" style="style0">They were both equal</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle990" begin="26750895003t" end="26767157500t" region="region25" style="style0">in my eyes.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle991" begin="26767157500t" end="26785100007t" region="region53" style="style0">As is all of my creation.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle992" begin="26785100007t" end="26809702502t" region="region28" style="style0">of its destiny is my will.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle993" begin="26785100007t" end="26809702502t" region="region0" style="style0">And the uncertainty</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle994" begin="26820130002t" end="26835567508t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle995" begin="26887695000t" end="26917307500t" region="region33" style="style0">So what is it actually</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle996" begin="26887695000t" end="26917307500t" region="region3" style="style0">that brings you here?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle997" begin="26929405001t" end="26949425001t" region="region23" style="style0">Allow me to fill my flask</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle998" begin="26929405001t" end="26949425001t" region="region60" style="style0">with these waters.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle999" begin="26993640006t" end="27006979999t" region="region65" style="style0">The waters are not mine.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1000" begin="27277667500t" end="27295192507t" region="region43" style="style0">You plan to quench</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1001" begin="27277667500t" end="27295192507t" region="region1" style="style0">the desert fire.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1002" begin="27314795006t" end="27331892503t" region="region30" style="style0">To become King</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1003" begin="27314795006t" end="27331892503t" region="region75" style="style0">To kill Set.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1004" begin="27331892503t" end="27348155000t" region="region18" style="style0">as your father wished.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1005" begin="27348155000t" end="27364427506t" region="region43" style="style0">Grant me the power</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1006" begin="27348155000t" end="27364427506t" region="region39" style="style0">to fly again.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1007" begin="27364427506t" end="27387777500t" region="region0" style="style0">I heard your prayer</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1008" begin="27364427506t" end="27387777500t" region="region36" style="style0">the first time.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1009" begin="27387777500t" end="27399875001t" region="region40" style="style0">I let you come here</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1010" begin="27399875001t" end="27412807505t" region="region10" style="style0">and I grant you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1011" begin="27399875001t" end="27412807505t" region="region39" style="style0">passage home.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1012" begin="27412807505t" end="27435750007t" region="region36" style="style0">But after that?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1013" begin="27435750007t" end="27458265000t" region="region3" style="style0">Without both my eyes,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1014" begin="27458265000t" end="27476625008t" region="region23" style="style0">I doubt I'm strong enough</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1015" begin="27458265000t" end="27476625008t" region="region89" style="style0">to beat Set.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1016" begin="27476625008t" end="27488295000t" region="region40" style="style0">So become stronger.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1017" begin="27498305000t" end="27522917505t" region="region40" style="style0">so lazy for so long</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1018" begin="27498305000t" end="27522917505t" region="region38" style="style0">Have you been</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1019" begin="27522917505t" end="27552112503t" region="region108" style="style0">that you've forgotten</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1020" begin="27522917505t" end="27552112503t" region="region52" style="style0">every god's life</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1021" begin="27522917505t" end="27552112503t" region="region39" style="style0">is a journey?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1022" begin="27552112503t" end="27587977500t" region="region84" style="style0">When you stray</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1023" begin="27552112503t" end="27587977500t" region="region10" style="style0">from your path,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1024" begin="27552112503t" end="27587977500t" region="region59" style="style0">you grow weak.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1025" begin="27587977500t" end="27600075001t" region="region46" style="style0">(POUNDING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1026" begin="27587977500t" end="27600075001t" region="region61" style="style0">BEK: Hey!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1027" begin="27610085001t" end="27640115001t" region="region56" style="style0">lugging around this mortal?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1028" begin="27610085001t" end="27640115001t" region="region63" style="style0">Why are you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1029" begin="27640115001t" end="27657629999t" region="region23" style="style0">He had the gall to strike</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1030" begin="27640115001t" end="27657629999t" region="region60" style="style0">a bargain with me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1031" begin="27663892506t" end="27682660003t" region="region85" style="style0">Ah.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1032" begin="27682660003t" end="27709767501t" region="region54" style="style0">Not worth the papyrus</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1033" begin="27682660003t" end="27709767501t" region="region3" style="style0">it's written on, hmm?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1034" begin="27709767501t" end="27735215006t" region="region26" style="style0">(SIGHS) What does it matter?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1035" begin="27709767501t" end="27735215006t" region="region40" style="style0">He is but a mortal.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1036" begin="27834062506t" end="27862422503t" region="region52" style="style0">I do not approve</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1037" begin="27834062506t" end="27862422503t" region="region42" style="style0">of how Set rules.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1038" begin="27862422503t" end="27885782507t" region="region53" style="style0">you would be much better.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1039" begin="27862422503t" end="27885782507t" region="region51" style="style0">But I'm uncertain</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1040" begin="28023000003t" end="28048437500t" region="region28" style="style0">the last of the rebel gods</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1041" begin="28023000003t" end="28048437500t" region="region17" style="style0">GENERAL: Lord,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1042" begin="28048437500t" end="28061787502t" region="region42" style="style0">behind her walls.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1043" begin="28048437500t" end="28061787502t" region="region83" style="style0">have retreated</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1044" begin="28073050003t" end="28088059999t" region="region36" style="style0">Every last one?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1045" begin="28090982502t" end="28108915000t" region="region61" style="style0">Yes, sir.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1046" begin="28108915000t" end="28129770001t" region="region41" style="style0">Good. Then they're ripe</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1047" begin="28108915000t" end="28129770001t" region="region55" style="style0">for the picking.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1048" begin="28152295003t" end="28165645006t" region="region1" style="style0">a bit excessive?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1049" begin="28152295003t" end="28165645006t" region="region46" style="style0">Isn't this</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1050" begin="28172732503t" end="28191917502t" region="region4" style="style0">She'd want them to fight</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1051" begin="28172732503t" end="28191917502t" region="region13" style="style0">to the death anyway.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1052" begin="28204432506t" end="28220695001t" region="region44" style="style0">She was your wife.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1053" begin="28220695001t" end="28237385008t" region="region0" style="style0">All the more reason</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1054" begin="28220695001t" end="28237385008t" region="region89" style="style0">to kill her.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1055" begin="28251142502t" end="28267415008t" region="region5" style="style0">From now on,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1056" begin="28267415008t" end="28281172502t" region="region44" style="style0">the way of things.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1057" begin="28267415008t" end="28281172502t" region="region75" style="style0">this will be</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1058" begin="28288677500t" end="28308697500t" region="region76" style="style0">Our way.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1059" begin="28308697500t" end="28323717505t" region="region97" style="style0">Better get used to it.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1060" begin="28308697500t" end="28323717505t" region="region27" style="style0">(EXHALES THROUGH TEETH)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1061" begin="28367932508t" end="28383360003t" region="region40" style="style0">(SOLDIERS SHOUTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1062" begin="28598987500t" end="28618589999t" region="region36" style="style0">(BOTH GRUNTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1063" begin="28708272508t" end="28721612502t" region="region44" style="style0">(SOLDIERS YELLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1064" begin="28905967506t" end="28937667508t" region="region35" style="style0">Is it right that a goddess</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1065" begin="28905967506t" end="28937667508t" region="region28" style="style0">should perform such labor?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1066" begin="28946425006t" end="28962270002t" region="region18" style="style0">Since you became King,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1067" begin="28962270002t" end="28989377500t" region="region71" style="style0">the need for burial shrouds</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1068" begin="28962270002t" end="28989377500t" region="region36" style="style0">has been great.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1069" begin="29009397500t" end="29031505001t" region="region19" style="style0">You could have been a queen.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1070" begin="29031505001t" end="29049855000t" region="region23" style="style0">NEPHTHYS: You should know</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1071" begin="29031505001t" end="29049855000t" region="region55" style="style0">why I could not.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1072" begin="29061117501t" end="29074467505t" region="region71" style="style0">SET: Then, when I asked you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1073" begin="29061117501t" end="29074467505t" region="region89" style="style0">to marry me,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1074" begin="29094070003t" end="29109915000t" region="region13" style="style0">why did you say yes?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1075" begin="29109915000t" end="29130352500t" region="region27" style="style0">rode out of the desert.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1076" begin="29109915000t" end="29130352500t" region="region0" style="style0">I remember when you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1077" begin="29143285003t" end="29190412500t" region="region0" style="style0">Impetuous. Dashing.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1078" begin="29143285003t" end="29190412500t" region="region89" style="style0">So handsome.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1079" begin="29190412500t" end="29215025005t" region="region48" style="style0">I braved those stinging winds</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1080" begin="29190412500t" end="29215025005t" region="region107" style="style0">just to be at your side.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1081" begin="29227957508t" end="29241297501t" region="region36" style="style0">the great deeds</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1082" begin="29227957508t" end="29241297501t" region="region88" style="style0">And imagined</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1083" begin="29241297501t" end="29255065005t" region="region13" style="style0">accomplish together.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1084" begin="29241297501t" end="29255065005t" region="region82" style="style0">we would</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1085" begin="29258822508t" end="29272997502t" region="region13" style="style0">It didn't all sting.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1086" begin="29289677500t" end="29304697505t" region="region18" style="style0">Some parts were sweet.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1087" begin="29317630007t" end="29337650007t" region="region44" style="style0">NEPHTHYS: Perhaps.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1088" begin="29337650007t" end="29358505008t" region="region45" style="style0">I still thought</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1089" begin="29337650007t" end="29358505008t" region="region38" style="style0">we could have</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1090" begin="29337650007t" end="29358505008t" region="region25" style="style0">been happy.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1091" begin="29369757500t" end="29389777500t" region="region109" style="style0">I should have been enough</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1092" begin="29369757500t" end="29389777500t" region="region36" style="style0">to fulfill you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1093" begin="29389777500t" end="29402292502t" region="region61" style="style0">(EXHALES)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1094" begin="29425652506t" end="29444002503t" region="region27" style="style0">Nothing can fulfill me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1095" begin="29479867500t" end="29499887500t" region="region18" style="style0">That's why Ra was wise</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1096" begin="29499887500t" end="29520742500t" region="region23" style="style0">to ensure you would never</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1097" begin="29499887500t" end="29520742500t" region="region39" style="style0">have a child.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1098" begin="29564540003t" end="29576637506t" region="region42" style="style0">(NEPHTHYS GROANS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1099" begin="29625017505t" end="29639202508t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1100" begin="29668815008t" end="29680902500t" region="region37" style="style0">(WHIMPERS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1101" begin="29730117500t" end="29752642502t" region="region11" style="style0">Why?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1102" begin="29752642502t" end="29779749999t" region="region13" style="style0">until it's too late.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1103" begin="29752642502t" end="29779749999t" region="region51" style="style0">No one will know,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1104" begin="29786012506t" end="29797275006t" region="region49" style="style0">(NEPHTHYS SCREAMS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1105" begin="29925317505t" end="29939909999t" region="region39" style="style0">(BEK SCREAMS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1106" begin="29955347505t" end="29970357500t" region="region30" style="style0">(HORUS GROWLS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1107" begin="29970357500t" end="29982872502t" region="region5" style="style0">(BOTH GRUNT)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1108" begin="30010397500t" end="30027505006t" region="region66" style="style0">(SPITS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1109" begin="30027505006t" end="30042515001t" region="region21" style="style0">Maybe next time,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1110" begin="30027505006t" end="30042515001t" region="region25" style="style0">keep flying</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1111" begin="30042515001t" end="30057535006t" region="region32" style="style0">until we're actually</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1112" begin="30042515001t" end="30057535006t" region="region30" style="style0">on the ground.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1113" begin="30057535006t" end="30083390002t" region="region56" style="style0">What Ra gave, he took back.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1114" begin="30083390002t" end="30102992502t" region="region5" style="style0">(BOTH GROAN)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1115" begin="30102992502t" end="30115507505t" region="region58" style="style0">I thought he was helping you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1116" begin="30115507505t" end="30128022507t" region="region13" style="style0">I got what I needed.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1117" begin="30141362500t" end="30173480002t" region="region53" style="style0">cannot quench Set's fire.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1118" begin="30141362500t" end="30173480002t" region="region54" style="style0">The whole of the Nile</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1119" begin="30173480002t" end="30195587505t" region="region28" style="style0">the water of Creation can.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1120" begin="30173480002t" end="30195587505t" region="region32" style="style0">But a few drops from</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1121" begin="30202675001t" end="30221025000t" region="region1" style="style0">Kill the desert.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1122" begin="30221025000t" end="30245220003t" region="region3" style="style0">Set will be weakened.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1123" begin="30221025000t" end="30245220003t" region="region0" style="style0">With his fire gone,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1124" begin="30245220003t" end="30260647500t" region="region25" style="style0">Vulnerable.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1125" begin="30260647500t" end="30270657500t" region="region51" style="style0">What would happen</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1126" begin="30260647500t" end="30270657500t" region="region55" style="style0">if I drank that?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1127" begin="30281502500t" end="30323212502t" region="region41" style="style0">You would be refreshed.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1128" begin="30281502500t" end="30323212502t" region="region40" style="style0">Then you would die.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1129" begin="30323212502t" end="30352825001t" region="region27" style="style0">of Creation would kill.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1130" begin="30323212502t" end="30352825001t" region="region108" style="style0">It doesn't seem right</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1131" begin="30323212502t" end="30352825001t" region="region83" style="style0">that the water</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1132" begin="30352825001t" end="30374097502t" region="region3" style="style0">For wasting my water.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1133" begin="30352825001t" end="30374097502t" region="region51" style="style0">I would kill you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1134" begin="30399545008t" end="30419147508t" region="region5" style="style0">What's this?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1135" begin="30419147508t" end="30437497506t" region="region103" style="style0">So you don't have</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1136" begin="30419147508t" end="30437497506t" region="region44" style="style0">something to drink</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1137" begin="30419147508t" end="30437497506t" region="region63" style="style0">to bring me</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1138" begin="30437497506t" end="30448342507t" region="region3" style="style0">cupped in your hands.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1139" begin="30455012503t" end="30474615003t" region="region40" style="style0">I'm not your slave.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1140" begin="30474615003t" end="30490877500t" region="region40" style="style0">My father taught me</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1141" begin="30490877500t" end="30509237508t" region="region33" style="style0">it's unworthy of a god</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1142" begin="30490877500t" end="30509237508t" region="region1" style="style0">to strike a man.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1143" begin="30509237508t" end="30525917505t" region="region23" style="style0">He should have taught you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1144" begin="30509237508t" end="30525917505t" region="region99" style="style0">to get off your arse</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1145" begin="30525917505t" end="30538015006t" region="region27" style="style0">and get your own water.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1146" begin="30561782500t" end="30575967505t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1147" begin="30588900007t" end="30600987500t" region="region30" style="style0">Sorry, Father.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1148" begin="30751137500t" end="30765740003t" region="region37" style="style0">(GROWLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1149" begin="30765740003t" end="30778672507t" region="region25" style="style0">(BEK YELLS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1150" begin="30784925003t" end="30800769999t" region="region21" style="style0">This is becoming</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1151" begin="30784925003t" end="30800769999t" region="region39" style="style0">unacceptable.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1152" begin="30867927506t" end="30880849999t" region="region28" style="style0">Where is the Eye of Horus?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1153" begin="30884190002t" end="30901287500t" region="region36" style="style0">Up your behind,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1154" begin="30901287500t" end="30911297500t" region="region0" style="style0">alongside the goats</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1155" begin="30901287500t" end="30911297500t" region="region60" style="style0">you keep up there.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1156" begin="30927152506t" end="30950919999t" region="region28" style="style0">Where is the Eye of Horus?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1157" begin="30961347500t" end="30973862502t" region="region25" style="style0">Right here.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1158" begin="30973862502t" end="30991377500t" region="region76" style="style0">(SCOFFS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1159" begin="30991377500t" end="31007232506t" region="region51" style="style0">MNEVIS: I thought</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1160" begin="30991377500t" end="31007232506t" region="region42" style="style0">you were crawling</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1161" begin="31007232506t" end="31020989999t" region="region32" style="style0">sightless in the mud</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1162" begin="31007232506t" end="31020989999t" region="region37" style="style0">somewhere.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1163" begin="31031417500t" end="31044767502t" region="region39" style="style0">Cut him down!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1164" begin="31051437500t" end="31063952502t" region="region37" style="style0">(GRUNTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1165" begin="31099827508t" end="31112750001t" region="region50" style="style0">(YELLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1166" begin="31099827508t" end="31112750001t" region="region37" style="style0">(GROANING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1167" begin="31159887508t" end="31171557500t" region="region76" style="style0">(GROANS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1168" begin="31171557500t" end="31186160003t" region="region18" style="style0">MNEVIS: See, brothers?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1169" begin="31186160003t" end="31206597505t" region="region33" style="style0">Without his other eye,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1170" begin="31186160003t" end="31206597505t" region="region25" style="style0">he is weak.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1171" begin="31206597505t" end="31221189999t" region="region46" style="style0">(GROWLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1172" begin="31206597505t" end="31221189999t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1173" begin="31297940006t" end="31310455008t" region="region95" style="style0">(GROANS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1174" begin="31297940006t" end="31310455008t" region="region61" style="style0">(ROARING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1175" begin="31557782506t" end="31571539999t" region="region66" style="style0">(YELLS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1176" begin="31662047500t" end="31674562502t" region="region39" style="style0">(BEK SCREAMS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1177" begin="31702087500t" end="31721689999t" region="region17" style="style0">Even if I were</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1178" begin="31702087500t" end="31721689999t" region="region5" style="style0">blind, deaf,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1179" begin="31736292503t" end="31751312508t" region="region44" style="style0">bereft of limbs...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1180" begin="31776750003t" end="31791352508t" region="region1" style="style0">no match for me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1181" begin="31776750003t" end="31791352508t" region="region75" style="style0">You're still</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1182" begin="31855995003t" end="31879355006t" region="region28" style="style0">I didn't fall to my death.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1183" begin="31855995003t" end="31879355006t" region="region33" style="style0">You'll be glad to know</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1184" begin="31879355006t" end="31892277500t" region="region37" style="style0">Praise Ra.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1185" begin="31892277500t" end="31907297505t" region="region21" style="style0">The deal doesn't</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1186" begin="31892277500t" end="31907297505t" region="region36" style="style0">count if I die.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1187" begin="31907297505t" end="31920230007t" region="region18" style="style0">is for Zaya and I both</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1188" begin="31907297505t" end="31920230007t" region="region10" style="style0">The whole point</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1189" begin="31920230007t" end="31934405001t" region="region3" style="style0">to be here, together.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1190" begin="31934405001t" end="31951512508t" region="region37" style="style0">Breathing!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1191" begin="31954842502t" end="31969445006t" region="region110" style="style0">Behind you!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1192" begin="32061205008t" end="32075380002t" region="region25" style="style0">BEK: Horus!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1193" begin="32075380002t" end="32089565006t" region="region47" style="style0">Horus!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1194" begin="32119177506t" end="32134605001t" region="region1" style="style0">(BEK EXCLAIMING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1195" begin="32154625001t" end="32181742508t" region="region21" style="style0">Oh, Ra, dear Ra,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1196" begin="32154625001t" end="32181742508t" region="region1" style="style0">please, help us!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1197" begin="32181742508t" end="32193412500t" region="region25" style="style0">(SCREAMING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1198" begin="32198840006t" end="32212179999t" region="region47" style="style0">Horus!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1199" begin="32224277501t" end="32239715006t" region="region13" style="style0">We are going to die!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1200" begin="32315620002t" end="32329805006t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1201" begin="32369427506t" end="32385272502t" region="region40" style="style0">(BREATHING HEAVILY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1202" begin="32407380003t" end="32419477506t" region="region42" style="style0">HORUS: After you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1203" begin="32439080006t" end="32452419999t" region="region5" style="style0">(BOTH GRUNT)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1204" begin="32493295000t" end="32510402507t" region="region66" style="style0">(PANTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1205" begin="32532917500t" end="32542927500t" region="region1" style="style0">you can do this?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1206" begin="32532917500t" end="32542927500t" region="region75" style="style0">Are you sure</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1207" begin="32542927500t" end="32563365000t" region="region18" style="style0">I saved you, didn't I?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1208" begin="32563365000t" end="32588812506t" region="region13" style="style0">you're useful to me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1209" begin="32563365000t" end="32588812506t" region="region98" style="style0">-Oh, you saved me?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1210" begin="32563365000t" end="32588812506t" region="region38" style="style0">-Only because</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1211" begin="32588812506t" end="32602987500t" region="region3" style="style0">what would be useful?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1212" begin="32588812506t" end="32602987500t" region="region38" style="style0">BEK: You know</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1213" begin="32602987500t" end="32623007500t" region="region36" style="style0">Your other eye.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1214" begin="32623007500t" end="32634687501t" region="region111" style="style0">I could steal it back for you,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1215" begin="32623007500t" end="32634687501t" region="region5" style="style0">if you like.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1216" begin="32634687501t" end="32652212508t" region="region13" style="style0">my patience, mortal.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1217" begin="32634687501t" end="32652212508t" region="region46" style="style0">Don't test</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1218" begin="32652212508t" end="32665135001t" region="region65" style="style0">My name is not &quot;mortal.&quot;</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1219" begin="32691835008t" end="32703922500t" region="region42" style="style0">What is it, then?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1220" begin="32709767506t" end="32722689999t" region="region11" style="style0">Bek.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1221" begin="32726865003t" end="32747302503t" region="region36" style="style0">Very well, Bek.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1222" begin="32747302503t" end="32763982500t" region="region51" style="style0">The roads will be</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1223" begin="32747302503t" end="32763982500t" region="region89" style="style0">watched now.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1224" begin="32763982500t" end="32780255006t" region="region36" style="style0">better hunters.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1225" begin="32763982500t" end="32780255006t" region="region38" style="style0">Set will send</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1226" begin="32903287500t" end="32929987506t" region="region111" style="style0">Well, that didn't go according</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1227" begin="32903287500t" end="32929987506t" region="region1" style="style0">to plan, did it?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1228" begin="32929987506t" end="32953337500t" region="region42" style="style0">MNEVIS: No, Lord.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1229" begin="32953337500t" end="32982542508t" region="region33" style="style0">My nephew did all this</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1230" begin="32953337500t" end="32982542508t" region="region39" style="style0">with one eye?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1231" begin="32982542508t" end="33003387500t" region="region21" style="style0">I underestimated</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1232" begin="32982542508t" end="33003387500t" region="region39" style="style0">his strength.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1233" begin="33003387500t" end="33015902502t" region="region65" style="style0">Tough to kill, that boy.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1234" begin="33030087506t" end="33043427500t" region="region36" style="style0">Like his uncle.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1235" begin="33053437500t" end="33079302506t" region="region18" style="style0">Who's he allying with?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1236" begin="33053437500t" end="33079302506t" region="region51" style="style0">Where's he going?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1237" begin="33079302506t" end="33103487500t" region="region38" style="style0">His only ally</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1238" begin="33079302506t" end="33103487500t" region="region30" style="style0">is the mortal.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1239" begin="33103487500t" end="33119760006t" region="region36" style="style0">an army, is it?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1240" begin="33103487500t" end="33119760006t" region="region63" style="style0">It's hardly</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1241" begin="33119760006t" end="33131440007t" region="region42" style="style0">I overheard them.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1242" begin="33131440007t" end="33143527500t" region="region21" style="style0">The mortal spoke</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1243" begin="33131440007t" end="33143527500t" region="region5" style="style0">of a bargain</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1244" begin="33143527500t" end="33156877502t" region="region3" style="style0">he'd made with Horus.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1245" begin="33162722508t" end="33186072502t" region="region42" style="style0">ambitious mortal.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1246" begin="33162722508t" end="33186072502t" region="region63" style="style0">This is one</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1247" begin="33186072502t" end="33205675001t" region="region1" style="style0">Horus has agreed</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1248" begin="33205675001t" end="33222782508t" region="region71" style="style0">to bring the mortal's woman</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1249" begin="33205675001t" end="33222782508t" region="region55" style="style0">back from death.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1250" begin="33236540002t" end="33251977508t" region="region39" style="style0">Are you sure?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1251" begin="33251977508t" end="33270745006t" region="region65" style="style0">I'm certain of it, Lord.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1252" begin="33270745006t" end="33283249999t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1253" begin="33313697500t" end="33332892508t" region="region3" style="style0">get that attended to.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1254" begin="33313697500t" end="33332892508t" region="region51" style="style0">You should really</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1255" begin="33332892508t" end="33356660002t" region="region33" style="style0">-Yes, Lord. Thank you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1256" begin="33332892508t" end="33356660002t" region="region37" style="style0">-Good job.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1257" begin="33377932503t" end="33391282507t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1258" begin="33426312502t" end="33453837500t" region="region35" style="style0">You should have trusted us</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1259" begin="33426312502t" end="33453837500t" region="region53" style="style0">with this from the start.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1260" begin="33453837500t" end="33468857505t" region="region40" style="style0">left you satisfied?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1261" begin="33453837500t" end="33468857505t" region="region51" style="style0">Haven't we always</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1262" begin="33499722506t" end="33518907505t" region="region18" style="style0">Then satisfy me again.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1263" begin="33582307508t" end="33594812500t" region="region56" style="style0">Did you let your wife live?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1264" begin="33634017500t" end="33660717506t" region="region3" style="style0">you and I will end up</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1265" begin="33634017500t" end="33660717506t" region="region52" style="style0">Sooner or later,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1266" begin="33660717506t" end="33673639999t" region="region30" style="style0">just the same.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1267" begin="33794177500t" end="33816285001t" region="region32" style="style0">The Land of the Dead</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1268" begin="33794177500t" end="33816285001t" region="region40" style="style0">and its Nine Gates.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1269" begin="33828382503t" end="33858830003t" region="region3" style="style0">Mistress of the West?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1270" begin="33828382503t" end="33858830003t" region="region10" style="style0">Is it accurate,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1271" begin="33858830003t" end="33874257500t" region="region40" style="style0">Don't call me that.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1272" begin="33874257500t" end="33894277500t" region="region27" style="style0">I left all that behind.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1273" begin="33894277500t" end="33918472503t" region="region51" style="style0">Soon, I will rule</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1274" begin="33894277500t" end="33918472503t" region="region59" style="style0">all the world.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1275" begin="33918472503t" end="33944327500t" region="region32" style="style0">The Land of the Dead</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1276" begin="33918472503t" end="33944327500t" region="region13" style="style0">is the final kingdom</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1277" begin="33944327500t" end="33958930003t" region="region30" style="style0">left standing.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1278" begin="33958930003t" end="33973939999t" region="region10" style="style0">You want things</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1279" begin="33958930003t" end="33973939999t" region="region36" style="style0">you can't have.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1280" begin="33998552503t" end="34012320007t" region="region42" style="style0">to take me there.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1281" begin="33998552503t" end="34012320007t" region="region62" style="style0">I want you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1282" begin="34012320007t" end="34027330002t" region="region53" style="style0">But you're a living soul.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1283" begin="34027330002t" end="34046515001t" region="region40" style="style0">a living soul, too,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1284" begin="34027330002t" end="34046515001t" region="region51" style="style0">Yes. And you were</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1285" begin="34046515001t" end="34065282500t" region="region41" style="style0">when you were counselor</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1286" begin="34046515001t" end="34065282500t" region="region89" style="style0">to the dead.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1287" begin="34065282500t" end="34081972507t" region="region41" style="style0">You know what's waiting</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1288" begin="34065282500t" end="34081972507t" region="region99" style="style0">for me if I go back.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1289" begin="34091147506t" end="34105322500t" region="region58" style="style0">You have your little bracelet</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1290" begin="34105322500t" end="34128265003t" region="region44" style="style0">from those demons.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1291" begin="34105322500t" end="34128265003t" region="region17" style="style0">to protect you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1292" begin="34128265003t" end="34141197506t" region="region30" style="style0">It's not that.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1293" begin="34148285003t" end="34174139999t" region="region23" style="style0">(WHISPERING) You miss it.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1294" begin="34148285003t" end="34174139999t" region="region64" style="style0">Don't you?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1295" begin="34186237501t" end="34212102507t" region="region56" style="style0">What it brought out in you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1296" begin="34186237501t" end="34212102507t" region="region38" style="style0">The darkness.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1297" begin="34217102502t" end="34234617500t" region="region30" style="style0">(WHISPERS) No.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1298" begin="34234617500t" end="34264229999t" region="region41" style="style0">Ah, you're not so good,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1299" begin="34234617500t" end="34264229999t" region="region55" style="style0">Goddess of Love.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1300" begin="34276745001t" end="34289260003t" region="region66" style="style0">I know.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1301" begin="34289260003t" end="34307610002t" region="region39" style="style0">Then do this.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1302" begin="34307610002t" end="34344309999t" region="region19" style="style0">Then we can have everything.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1303" begin="34307610002t" end="34344309999t" region="region23" style="style0">Prove your loyalty to me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1304" begin="34356407501t" end="34373932508t" region="region61" style="style0">Together.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1305" begin="34451090006t" end="34463187508t" region="region42" style="style0">(SOFTLY) Horus...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1306" begin="34476527501t" end="34493635008t" region="region76" style="style0">My love.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1307" begin="34552860007t" end="34564947500t" region="region1" style="style0">HATHOR:<span style="style1"> Horus...</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1308" begin="34626677501t" end="34644610000t" region="region18" style="style0">in your father's tomb?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1309" begin="34626677501t" end="34644610000t" region="region46" style="style0">You're not</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1310" begin="34681737506t" end="34694660000t" region="region45" style="style0">I was wondering</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1311" begin="34681737506t" end="34694660000t" region="region38" style="style0">where he was.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1312" begin="34681737506t" end="34694660000t" region="region66" style="style0">(GASPS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1313" begin="34711767506t" end="34724690000t" region="region25" style="style0">Now I know.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1314" begin="34730952506t" end="34744302508t" region="region66" style="style0">Thanks.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1315" begin="34765147500t" end="34789342503t" region="region54" style="style0">For someone who bends</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1316" begin="34765147500t" end="34789342503t" region="region36" style="style0">the will of men</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1317" begin="34789342503t" end="34804362508t" region="region18" style="style0">by batting her lashes,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1318" begin="34811867506t" end="34824382508t" region="region27" style="style0">you're not very clever.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1319" begin="34844402508t" end="34857325001t" region="region10" style="style0">How long has he</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1320" begin="34844402508t" end="34857325001t" region="region59" style="style0">had his sight?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1321" begin="34857325001t" end="34869422503t" region="region1" style="style0">Why do you care?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1322" begin="34869422503t" end="34883607508t" region="region76" style="style0">(SCOFFS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1323" begin="34897782502t" end="34914880000t" region="region30" style="style0">I'm yours now.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1324" begin="34919890003t" end="34934900000t" region="region65" style="style0">I'll do as you've asked.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1325" begin="34945327500t" end="34959512503t" region="region3" style="style0">Even if I kill Horus?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1326" begin="34975357500t" end="34987872502t" region="region27" style="style0">(WHISPERING) Of course.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1327" begin="34995377500t" end="35012902507t" region="region13" style="style0">Who cares about him?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1328" begin="35043767508t" end="35055437500t" region="region44" style="style0">you'd be exhausted</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1329" begin="35043767508t" end="35055437500t" region="region21" style="style0">I'd have thought</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1330" begin="35055437500t" end="35068370002t" region="region40" style="style0">from so much lying.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1331" begin="35169722503t" end="35204762508t" region="region54" style="style0">I loved Nephthys once</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1332" begin="35169722503t" end="35204762508t" region="region3" style="style0">and I took her wings.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1333" begin="35215597500t" end="35228947502t" region="region51" style="style0">Imagine what I'll</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1334" begin="35215597500t" end="35228947502t" region="region64" style="style0">do to you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1335" begin="35256055000t" end="35273162507t" region="region21" style="style0">Do that and I'll</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1336" begin="35256055000t" end="35273162507t" region="region30" style="style0">hunt you down.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1337" begin="35292347506t" end="35304862508t" region="region5" style="style0">(SET GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1338" begin="35304862508t" end="35316950001t" region="region25" style="style0">(SCREAMING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1339" begin="35360330003t" end="35374097508t" region="region36" style="style0">(HATHOR GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1340" begin="35374097508t" end="35385350000t" region="region56" style="style0">FEMALE DEMON: Let me touch.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1341" begin="35395777500t" end="35414555008t" region="region21" style="style0">(DEMON LAUGHING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1342" begin="35395777500t" end="35414555008t" region="region36" style="style0">(HATHOR GROANS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1343" begin="35497965001t" end="35514655008t" region="region76" style="style0">(GROANS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1344" begin="35514655008t" end="35528830002t" region="region40" style="style0">(BREATHING HEAVILY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1345" begin="35528830002t" end="35545927500t" region="region54" style="style0">I suppose it's better</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1346" begin="35528830002t" end="35545927500t" region="region39" style="style0">than running.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1347" begin="35553025006t" end="35572627506t" region="region61" style="style0">(PANTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1348" begin="35646027500t" end="35665630000t" region="region42" style="style0">(GROANING SOFTLY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1349" begin="35734875008t" end="35747380001t" region="region40" style="style0">(BEK GRUNTS SOFTLY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1350" begin="35870840003t" end="35895452508t" region="region40" style="style0">campsite next time?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1351" begin="35870840003t" end="35895452508t" region="region51" style="style0">a less unpleasant</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1352" begin="35870840003t" end="35895452508t" region="region112" style="style0">Can we find</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1353" begin="35906705000t" end="35923812507t" region="region11" style="style0">Hmm.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1354" begin="35937987501t" end="35959260002t" region="region4" style="style0">This used to be a garden</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1355" begin="35937987501t" end="35959260002t" region="region27" style="style0">like you've never seen.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1356" begin="36134857508t" end="36146110000t" region="region30" style="style0">What happened?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1357" begin="36156537500t" end="36183655006t" region="region113" style="style0">It was my father's</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1358" begin="36156537500t" end="36183655006t" region="region39" style="style0">first temple.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1359" begin="36183655006t" end="36201170003t" region="region3" style="style0">he opened the grounds</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1360" begin="36183655006t" end="36201170003t" region="region67" style="style0">In his generosity,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1361" begin="36201170003t" end="36216180000t" region="region33" style="style0">so the poor could bury</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1362" begin="36201170003t" end="36216180000t" region="region36" style="style0">their own here.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1363" begin="36236617500t" end="36253307506t" region="region51" style="style0">Set has corrupted</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1364" begin="36236617500t" end="36253307506t" region="region59" style="style0">his teachings.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1365" begin="36285842508t" end="36301270003t" region="region42" style="style0">loved this place.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1366" begin="36285842508t" end="36301270003t" region="region50" style="style0">My father</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1367" begin="36317532500t" end="36337552500t" region="region41" style="style0">So Set brought him here</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1368" begin="36317532500t" end="36337552500t" region="region55" style="style0">to be butchered.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1369" begin="36366747500t" end="36393865006t" region="region21" style="style0">His body was cut</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1370" begin="36366747500t" end="36393865006t" region="region36" style="style0">into 14 pieces.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1371" begin="36393865006t" end="36408457501t" region="region28" style="style0">The heart was never found.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1372" begin="36408457501t" end="36425565008t" region="region3" style="style0">Set salted the earth?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1373" begin="36425565008t" end="36451002503t" region="region44" style="style0">my mother's tears.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1374" begin="36425565008t" end="36451002503t" region="region46" style="style0">No. It was</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1375" begin="36465187508t" end="36480197502t" region="region10" style="style0">Before she took</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1376" begin="36465187508t" end="36480197502t" region="region39" style="style0">her own life.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1377" begin="36506062508t" end="36518150001t" region="region30" style="style0">I failed them.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1378" begin="36537335000t" end="36553607506t" region="region37" style="style0">I'm sorry.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1379" begin="36553607506t" end="36577792500t" region="region40" style="style0">I was on a journey.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1380" begin="36553607506t" end="36577792500t" region="region62" style="style0">Ra told me</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1381" begin="36596152508t" end="36632017505t" region="region41" style="style0">And if I reach the end,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1382" begin="36596152508t" end="36632017505t" region="region27" style="style0">I will be mighty again.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1383" begin="36647027500t" end="36661630003t" region="region1" style="style0">How does it end?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1384" begin="36661630003t" end="36676232508t" region="region36" style="style0">With vengeance.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1385" begin="36697912500t" end="36716680000t" region="region13" style="style0">through Set's skull.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1386" begin="36697912500t" end="36716680000t" region="region43" style="style0">Ends with my spear</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1387" begin="36733787506t" end="36750885003t" region="region28" style="style0">(RUMBLING IN THE DISTANCE)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1388" begin="36750885003t" end="36765487508t" region="region1" style="style0">Is that a storm?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1389" begin="36776332508t" end="36789255001t" region="region44" style="style0">There's no clouds.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1390" begin="36798847501t" end="36826382508t" region="region37" style="style0">(GROWLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1391" begin="36826382508t" end="36840557502t" region="region44" style="style0">riding their pets.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1392" begin="36826382508t" end="36840557502t" region="region38" style="style0">Set's hunters</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1393" begin="36857237500t" end="36887267500t" region="region43" style="style0">Those aren't pets.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1394" begin="36857237500t" end="36887267500t" region="region36" style="style0">A cat is a pet.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1395" begin="36887267500t" end="36907705000t" region="region103" style="style0">I can't withstand</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1396" begin="36887267500t" end="36907705000t" region="region55" style="style0">Not as I am now.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1397" begin="36887267500t" end="36907705000t" region="region88" style="style0">their venom.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1398" begin="36907705000t" end="36927307500t" region="region30" style="style0">we should run.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1399" begin="36907705000t" end="36927307500t" region="region75" style="style0">Then I guess</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1400" begin="36927307500t" end="36946910000t" region="region38" style="style0">Mortals do it</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1401" begin="36927307500t" end="36946910000t" region="region39" style="style0">all the time!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1402" begin="36927307500t" end="36946910000t" region="region114" style="style0">Run?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1403" begin="37011562503t" end="37026165008t" region="region30" style="style0">(HORN TOOTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1404" begin="37111245003t" end="37125430007t" region="region25" style="style0">Run faster!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1405" begin="37125430007t" end="37137100000t" region="region76" style="style0">I can't!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1406" begin="37145867508t" end="37157120000t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1407" begin="37162130003t" end="37181732503t" region="region115" style="style0">(ROARING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1408" begin="37181732503t" end="37193412506t" region="region25" style="style0">Run faster!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1409" begin="37193412506t" end="37207170000t" region="region76" style="style0">I can't!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1410" begin="37326465008t" end="37338552500t" region="region36" style="style0">HORUS: Come on!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1411" begin="37346485008t" end="37358572500t" region="region5" style="style0">(BOTH GRUNT)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1412" begin="37452837505t" end="37472857505t" region="region38" style="style0">to kill them.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1413" begin="37452837505t" end="37472857505t" region="region116" style="style0">-We have</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1414" begin="37452837505t" end="37472857505t" region="region47" style="style0">-&quot;We&quot;?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1415" begin="37472857505t" end="37493712506t" region="region18" style="style0">what's most important?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1416" begin="37472857505t" end="37493712506t" region="region32" style="style0">When you go fishing,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1417" begin="37493712506t" end="37512897505t" region="region51" style="style0">-It's the quality</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1418" begin="37493712506t" end="37512897505t" region="region117" style="style0">-I don't fish.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1419" begin="37493712506t" end="37512897505t" region="region5" style="style0">of the bait.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1420" begin="37512897505t" end="37524995006t" region="region40" style="style0">It's too dangerous.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1421" begin="37524995006t" end="37546685008t" region="region53" style="style0">Are you worried about me?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1422" begin="37546685008t" end="37567947500t" region="region0" style="style0">my aim with a spear</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1423" begin="37546685008t" end="37567947500t" region="region40" style="style0">is not what it was.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1424" begin="37546685008t" end="37567947500t" region="region118" style="style0">No, it's just</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1425" begin="37567947500t" end="37582132503t" region="region13" style="style0">before you throw it.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1426" begin="37567947500t" end="37582132503t" region="region10" style="style0">Then get closer</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1427" begin="37670552502t" end="37686407508t" region="region36" style="style0">Hey! Beautiful!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1428" begin="37716437508t" end="37731865003t" region="region43" style="style0">I meant the snake!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1429" begin="37716437508t" end="37731865003t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1430" begin="37731865003t" end="37746467508t" region="region61" style="style0">(ROARING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1431" begin="37784002506t" end="37797760000t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1432" begin="37837392508t" end="37849480001t" region="region61" style="style0">(SCREAMS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1433" begin="37934570006t" end="37947910000t" region="region37" style="style0">(GRUNTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1434" begin="38014650006t" end="38027990000t" region="region1" style="style0">(SNAKE GROANING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1435" begin="38077215008t" end="38099312500t" region="region43" style="style0">That worked great.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1436" begin="38077215008t" end="38099312500t" region="region36" style="style0">Let's go again.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1437" begin="38099312500t" end="38128507500t" region="region27" style="style0">needs to dangle longer.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1438" begin="38099312500t" end="38128507500t" region="region0" style="style0">This time, the bait</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1439" begin="38128507500t" end="38143110003t" region="region71" style="style0">I must strike the weak spot</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1440" begin="38128507500t" end="38143110003t" region="region89" style="style0">from behind.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1441" begin="38143110003t" end="38157295008t" region="region18" style="style0">they have a weak spot?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1442" begin="38143110003t" end="38157295008t" region="region0" style="style0">And how do you know</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1443" begin="38157295008t" end="38171052502t" region="region3" style="style0">But they must, right?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1444" begin="38157295008t" end="38171052502t" region="region95" style="style0">I don't.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1445" begin="38171052502t" end="38186072507t" region="region5" style="style0">(WHIMPERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1446" begin="38171052502t" end="38186072507t" region="region106" style="style0">Go!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1447" begin="38205675006t" end="38218180000t" region="region66" style="style0">(ROARS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1448" begin="38242792503t" end="38257395008t" region="region36" style="style0">(ANAT EXCLAIMS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1449" begin="38310357501t" end="38327465008t" region="region66" style="style0">(ROARS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1450" begin="38381262502t" end="38395865006t" region="region5" style="style0">(BEK GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1451" begin="38438817500t" end="38456342507t" region="region3" style="style0">You've made it angry.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1452" begin="38438817500t" end="38456342507t" region="region62" style="style0">Excellent!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1453" begin="38498877500t" end="38511392502t" region="region66" style="style0">(PANTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1454" begin="38530995001t" end="38543927505t" region="region66" style="style0">(YELLS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1455" begin="38548102508t" end="38560190001t" region="region61" style="style0">(PANTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1456" begin="38572705003t" end="38586472507t" region="region37" style="style0">(GRUNTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1457" begin="38618997500t" end="38636105006t" region="region2" style="style0">Too bad you can no longer fly.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1458" begin="38618997500t" end="38636105006t" region="region17" style="style0">(HORUS GROANS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1459" begin="38642775003t" end="38657377508t" region="region37" style="style0">(GRUNTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1460" begin="38694912506t" end="38708670000t" region="region30" style="style0">(BEK EXCLAIMS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1461" begin="38711175001t" end="38725777506t" region="region1" style="style0">Neither can you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1462" begin="38771652502t" end="38786255006t" region="region25" style="style0">(SCREAMING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1463" begin="38839217500t" end="38853402503t" region="region3" style="style0">(CONTINUES SCREAMING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1464" begin="38867170007t" end="38879257500t" region="region30" style="style0">(BEK CHUCKLES)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1465" begin="39059855000t" end="39075710006t" region="region11" style="style0">You!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1466" begin="39081127501t" end="39100730001t" region="region27" style="style0">and stay out of my way.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1467" begin="39081127501t" end="39100730001t" region="region88" style="style0">Just shut up</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1468" begin="39133682503t" end="39149527500t" region="region61" style="style0">(ROARING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1469" begin="39149527500t" end="39184985005t" region="region56" style="style0">you don't belong in battle.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1470" begin="39149527500t" end="39184985005t" region="region88" style="style0">Pretty girl,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1471" begin="39197917508t" end="39213345003t" region="region61" style="style0">Burn her!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1472" begin="39213345003t" end="39227947508t" region="region61" style="style0">(HISSING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1473" begin="39259637500t" end="39280910001t" region="region33" style="style0">What a lovely creature</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1474" begin="39259637500t" end="39280910001t" region="region76" style="style0">you are.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1475" begin="39293425003t" end="39307192507t" region="region1" style="style0">Let me help you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1476" begin="39335552506t" end="39348067508t" region="region44" style="style0">ASTARTE: Burn her!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1477" begin="39356825006t" end="39384767505t" region="region3" style="style0">You are so very cold.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1478" begin="39399777500t" end="39436905006t" region="region17" style="style0">Warm yourself.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1479" begin="39399777500t" end="39436905006t" region="region30" style="style0">I command you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1480" begin="39436905006t" end="39457760007t" region="region37" style="style0">(GROWLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1481" begin="39457760007t" end="39469847500t" region="region25" style="style0">(SCREAMING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1482" begin="39521567501t" end="39538675008t" region="region76" style="style0">Quickly.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1483" begin="39551597501t" end="39569122508t" region="region61" style="style0">(ROARING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1484" begin="39577045006t" end="39589967500t" region="region40" style="style0">(ASTARTE SCREAMING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1485" begin="39634600003t" end="39647115006t" region="region36" style="style0">was preferable.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1486" begin="39634600003t" end="39647115006t" region="region88" style="style0">Your company</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1487" begin="39740117500t" end="39759312508t" region="region44" style="style0">HORUS:<span style="style1"> Outrageous!</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1488" begin="39759312508t" end="39775992506t" region="region33" style="style0">HATHOR: You're welcome</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1489" begin="39759312508t" end="39775992506t" region="region3" style="style0">for saving your life.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1490" begin="39775992506t" end="39790167500t" region="region26" style="style0">So while I was sitting blind</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1491" begin="39775992506t" end="39790167500t" region="region13" style="style0">in my father's tomb,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1492" begin="39790167500t" end="39800177500t" region="region44" style="style0">a bed with the god</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1493" begin="39790167500t" end="39800177500t" region="region46" style="style0">you shared</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1494" begin="39800177500t" end="39820197500t" region="region27" style="style0">who pulled out my eyes.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1495" begin="39820197500t" end="39844810003t" region="region53" style="style0">on someone who can't see?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1496" begin="39820197500t" end="39844810003t" region="region97" style="style0">Why would I waste this</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1497" begin="39844810003t" end="39863160002t" region="region21" style="style0">Why would I ever</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1498" begin="39844810003t" end="39863160002t" region="region1" style="style0">trust you again?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1499" begin="39863160002t" end="39889025008t" region="region23" style="style0">He's slaying all the gods</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1500" begin="39863160002t" end="39889025008t" region="region3" style="style0">who won't bow to him.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1501" begin="39889025008t" end="39910287500t" region="region42" style="style0">That includes me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1502" begin="39910287500t" end="39927395006t" region="region0" style="style0">We're breaking into</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1503" begin="39910287500t" end="39927395006t" region="region39" style="style0">Set's temple.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1504" begin="39927395006t" end="39940317500t" region="region17" style="style0">Horus is going</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1505" begin="39927395006t" end="39940317500t" region="region5" style="style0">to kill him.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1506" begin="39940317500t" end="39954920003t" region="region40" style="style0">planning to get in?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1507" begin="39940317500t" end="39954920003t" region="region88" style="style0">How were you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1508" begin="39963260002t" end="39980775000t" region="region11" style="style0">Him?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1509" begin="39980775000t" end="40000377500t" region="region32" style="style0">He's seen the plans.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1510" begin="39980775000t" end="40000377500t" region="region42" style="style0">He knows the way.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1511" begin="40000377500t" end="40014145003t" region="region2" style="style0">Have you forgotten about that?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1512" begin="40000377500t" end="40014145003t" region="region33" style="style0">What about the Sphinx?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1513" begin="40014145003t" end="40034165003t" region="region61" style="style0">&quot;Sphinx&quot;?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1514" begin="40034165003t" end="40055437505t" region="region44" style="style0">to guard his fire.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1515" begin="40034165003t" end="40055437505t" region="region10" style="style0">Set captured it</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1516" begin="40055437505t" end="40080457500t" region="region4" style="style0">It will kill mercilessly</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1517" begin="40055437505t" end="40080457500t" region="region39" style="style0">all who enter</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1518" begin="40080457500t" end="40096730006t" region="region44" style="style0">answer its riddle.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1519" begin="40080457500t" end="40096730006t" region="region17" style="style0">if they cannot</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1520" begin="40096730006t" end="40109245008t" region="region44" style="style0">the riddle, right?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1521" begin="40096730006t" end="40109245008t" region="region17" style="style0">You can answer</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1522" begin="40109245008t" end="40123002502t" region="region36" style="style0">Thoth for help.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1523" begin="40109245008t" end="40123002502t" region="region88" style="style0">We shall ask</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1524" begin="40130507500t" end="40152615001t" region="region71" style="style0">(SCOFFS) Why would you ever</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1525" begin="40130507500t" end="40152615001t" region="region40" style="style0">do that on purpose?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1526" begin="40152615001t" end="40174722503t" region="region58" style="style0">than is absolutely necessary.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1527" begin="40152615001t" end="40174722503t" region="region68" style="style0">So we won't have</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1528" begin="40152615001t" end="40174722503t" region="region51" style="style0">to die any sooner</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1529" begin="40174722503t" end="40189742508t" region="region61" style="style0">Let's go.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1530" begin="40300677500t" end="40313610002t" region="region10" style="style0">Did he give you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1531" begin="40300677500t" end="40313610002t" region="region25" style="style0">that dress?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1532" begin="40334882503t" end="40354485003t" region="region44" style="style0">what was provided.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1533" begin="40334882503t" end="40354485003t" region="region75" style="style0">I chose from</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1534" begin="40354485003t" end="40367000006t" region="region40" style="style0">the one you thought</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1535" begin="40354485003t" end="40367000006t" region="region88" style="style0">So you chose</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1536" begin="40367000006t" end="40382427501t" region="region28" style="style0">would please him the most.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1537" begin="40382427501t" end="40400777500t" region="region23" style="style0">I dress to please myself.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1538" begin="40382427501t" end="40400777500t" region="region25" style="style0">HORUS: Hmm.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1539" begin="40400777500t" end="40423720002t" region="region27" style="style0">Why? You don't like it?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1540" begin="40423720002t" end="40440817500t" region="region30" style="style0">It's too much.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1541" begin="40440817500t" end="40467100006t" region="region10" style="style0">I'm the Goddess</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1542" begin="40440817500t" end="40467100006t" region="region89" style="style0">of Too Much.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1543" begin="40467100006t" end="40482945001t" region="region43" style="style0">And there's plenty</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1544" begin="40467100006t" end="40482945001t" region="region30" style="style0">I've given you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1545" begin="40482945001t" end="40498382507t" region="region58" style="style0">you've never found excessive.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1546" begin="40505887505t" end="40518820007t" region="region85" style="style0">Ah.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1547" begin="40518820007t" end="40539675008t" region="region28" style="style0">Now it's maybe too little.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1548" begin="40539675008t" end="40565112503t" region="region32" style="style0">You never used to be</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1549" begin="40539675008t" end="40565112503t" region="region44" style="style0">so hard to please.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1550" begin="40565112503t" end="40580132508t" region="region27" style="style0">You're slowing us down.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1551" begin="40581375000t" end="40598482507t" region="region11" style="style0">Ooh.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1552" begin="40620997500t" end="40643940002t" region="region52" style="style0">I think it makes</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1553" begin="40620997500t" end="40643940002t" region="region42" style="style0">you look roguish.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1554" begin="40643940002t" end="40663125001t" region="region10" style="style0">What did I look</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1555" begin="40643940002t" end="40663125001t" region="region89" style="style0">like before?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1556" begin="40663125001t" end="40678980007t" region="region63" style="style0">-Oblivious.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1557" begin="40663125001t" end="40678980007t" region="region11" style="style0">-Oh!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1558" begin="40678980007t" end="40689825008t" region="region44" style="style0">But in a cute way.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1559" begin="40689825008t" end="40710262508t" region="region44" style="style0">Oblivious of what?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1560" begin="40710262508t" end="40738205006t" region="region41" style="style0">Exactly. You always did</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1561" begin="40710262508t" end="40738205006t" region="region99" style="style0">take me for granted.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1562" begin="40738205006t" end="40755720003t" region="region78" style="style0">What?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1563" begin="40755720003t" end="40773652502t" region="region119" style="style0">With your eye back,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1564" begin="40755720003t" end="40773652502t" region="region10" style="style0">you should have</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1565" begin="40755720003t" end="40773652502t" region="region36" style="style0">come to get me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1566" begin="40773652502t" end="40790750000t" region="region38" style="style0">-Don't I mean</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1567" begin="40773652502t" end="40790750000t" region="region30" style="style0">enough to you?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1568" begin="40773652502t" end="40790750000t" region="region120" style="style0">-Oh?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1569" begin="40814110002t" end="40828712507t" region="region1" style="style0">(HATHOR SCREAMS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1570" begin="40841217500t" end="40854150002t" region="region66" style="style0">(GASPS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1571" begin="40915045003t" end="40934230002t" region="region37" style="style0">(LAUGHING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1572" begin="40934230002t" end="40957590006t" region="region33" style="style0">Be a dear and fetch me</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1573" begin="40934230002t" end="40957590006t" region="region42" style="style0">some clean water.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1574" begin="40991367500t" end="41007640006t" region="region51" style="style0">Would it kill you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1575" begin="40991367500t" end="41007640006t" region="region55" style="style0">to say &quot;please&quot;?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1576" begin="41007640006t" end="41037670006t" region="region3" style="style0">in the mood to argue.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1577" begin="41007640006t" end="41037670006t" region="region83" style="style0">I'm really not</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1578" begin="41037670006t" end="41079797508t" region="region51" style="style0">Go get it for me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1579" begin="41037670006t" end="41079797508t" region="region59" style="style0">I command you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1580" begin="41101477500t" end="41113575001t" region="region32" style="style0">You're all the same,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1581" begin="41101477500t" end="41113575001t" region="region25" style="style0">aren't you?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1582" begin="41128177506t" end="41141100000t" region="region1" style="style0">What's her name?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1583" begin="41155702503t" end="41182392500t" region="region119" style="style0">I can make any man,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1584" begin="41155702503t" end="41182392500t" region="region0" style="style0">woman, god or beast</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1585" begin="41155702503t" end="41182392500t" region="region59" style="style0">do my bidding.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1586" begin="41182392500t" end="41202412500t" region="region67" style="style0">Unless their heart</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1587" begin="41182392500t" end="41202412500t" region="region40" style="style0">belongs to another.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1588" begin="41215762503t" end="41230365008t" region="region36" style="style0">You're in love.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1589" begin="41251627500t" end="41276240003t" region="region1" style="style0">Her name's Zaya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1590" begin="41316697505t" end="41332125000t" region="region39" style="style0">I'm so sorry.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1591" begin="41416797505t" end="41441817500t" region="region17" style="style0">I promised her</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1592" begin="41416797505t" end="41441817500t" region="region30" style="style0">a proper home.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1593" begin="41441817500t" end="41461012508t" region="region0" style="style0">Money for a family.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1594" begin="41441817500t" end="41461012508t" region="region36" style="style0">Respectability.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1595" begin="41461012508t" end="41482692500t" region="region40" style="style0">I gave her nothing.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1596" begin="41482692500t" end="41497712506t" region="region54" style="style0">Oh, she wouldn't have</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1597" begin="41482692500t" end="41497712506t" region="region39" style="style0">been with you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1598" begin="41497712506t" end="41510227508t" region="region27" style="style0">if she didn't love you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1599" begin="41510227508t" end="41522732500t" region="region40" style="style0">Believe me, I know.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1600" begin="41522732500t" end="41536500003t" region="region32" style="style0">I'm going to make it</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1601" begin="41522732500t" end="41536500003t" region="region37" style="style0">up to her.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1602" begin="41536500003t" end="41551927500t" region="region13" style="style0">But I thought she...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1603" begin="41551927500t" end="41562772500t" region="region44" style="style0">to bring her back.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1604" begin="41551927500t" end="41562772500t" region="region17" style="style0">Horus is going</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1605" begin="41562772500t" end="41576957505t" region="region39" style="style0">He said that?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1606" begin="41576957505t" end="41597812506t" region="region21" style="style0">I know it's hard</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1607" begin="41576957505t" end="41597812506t" region="region36" style="style0">to see past his</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1608" begin="41597812506t" end="41611570000t" region="region51" style="style0">and proclamations</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1609" begin="41597812506t" end="41611570000t" region="region42" style="style0">of revenge but...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1610" begin="41597812506t" end="41611570000t" region="region80" style="style0">short temper</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1611" begin="41626590003t" end="41641600000t" region="region1" style="style0">He's not so bad.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1612" begin="41647862506t" end="41659125006t" region="region44" style="style0">It is hard to see.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1613" begin="41752127500t" end="41765477502t" region="region5" style="style0">There it is.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1614" begin="41774235001t" end="41789255006t" region="region40" style="style0">(METALLIC RATTLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1615" begin="42076622503t" end="42092050000t" region="region42" style="style0">BEK: Is that him?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1616" begin="42099147506t" end="42119167506t" region="region36" style="style0">-Of course not.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1617" begin="42099147506t" end="42119167506t" region="region100" style="style0">-Them?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1618" begin="42119167506t" end="42132507500t" region="region43" style="style0">Then who are they?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1619" begin="42119167506t" end="42132507500t" region="region66" style="style0">(GASPS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1620" begin="42132507500t" end="42147527505t" region="region3" style="style0">His trusted servants.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1621" begin="42158372506t" end="42179227506t" region="region27" style="style0">He only trusts himself.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1622" begin="42179227506t" end="42199665006t" region="region56" style="style0">Rich with generous compost.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1623" begin="42199665006t" end="42222597500t" region="region61" style="style0">Colorful.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1624" begin="42222597500t" end="42247210003t" region="region0" style="style0">Mainly in the green</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1625" begin="42222597500t" end="42247210003t" region="region60" style="style0">and red spectrums.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1626" begin="42247210003t" end="42291007508t" region="region121" style="style0">Variegated varieties with</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1627" begin="42247210003t" end="42291007508t" region="region41" style="style0">inflorescences composed</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1628" begin="42247210003t" end="42291007508t" region="region99" style="style0">of multiple florets,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1629" begin="42291007508t" end="42317280003t" region="region56" style="style0">each with a modified calyx.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1630" begin="42317280003t" end="42352727500t" region="region48" style="style0">Wise Lord of the Sacred Word,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1631" begin="42317280003t" end="42352727500t" region="region3" style="style0">we seek your counsel.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1632" begin="42352727500t" end="42385680002t" region="region13" style="style0">uprooted and burned.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1633" begin="42352727500t" end="42385680002t" region="region38" style="style0">Once, a weed,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1634" begin="42385680002t" end="42417797505t" region="region53" style="style0">for the vigor of its oils</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1635" begin="42385680002t" end="42417797505t" region="region62" style="style0">Now prized</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1636" begin="42417797505t" end="42441992508t" region="region43" style="style0">and the sustenance</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1637" begin="42417797505t" end="42441992508t" region="region30" style="style0">of its leaves.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1638" begin="42441992508t" end="42468265005t" region="region18" style="style0">But what is its truth?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1639" begin="42498712506t" end="42517897505t" region="region42" style="style0">You! Turn around.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1640" begin="42517897505t" end="42529995006t" region="region3" style="style0">the view from behind?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1641" begin="42517897505t" end="42529995006t" region="region62" style="style0">You prefer</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1642" begin="42529995006t" end="42559607506t" region="region40" style="style0">No, I... Well, yes.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1643" begin="42559607506t" end="42582957500t" region="region56" style="style0">You know I can't lie. Turn.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1644" begin="42582957500t" end="42599230006t" region="region3" style="style0">I'm not going to risk</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1645" begin="42599230006t" end="42619667506t" region="region26" style="style0">looking at those tricky eyes</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1646" begin="42599230006t" end="42619667506t" region="region61" style="style0">of yours.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1647" begin="42619667506t" end="42643852500t" region="region38" style="style0">-Forty-seven.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1648" begin="42619667506t" end="42643852500t" region="region25" style="style0">-Excuse me?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1649" begin="42643852500t" end="42657202503t" region="region71" style="style0">The percentage of knowledge</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1650" begin="42643852500t" end="42657202503t" region="region27" style="style0">I have so far recorded.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1651" begin="42657202503t" end="42678892506t" region="region27" style="style0">I'm not even half done.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1652" begin="42678892506t" end="42707670003t" region="region23" style="style0">-The answer to the riddle</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1653" begin="42678892506t" end="42707670003t" region="region24" style="style0">-Thoth, I only need...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1654" begin="42678892506t" end="42707670003t" region="region30" style="style0">of the Sphinx.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1655" begin="42707670003t" end="42728942506t" region="region32" style="style0">A child could deduce</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1656" begin="42707670003t" end="42728942506t" region="region1" style="style0">why you're here.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1657" begin="42728942506t" end="42745205001t" region="region42" style="style0">Go ask the riddle</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1658" begin="42745205001t" end="42765642502t" region="region40" style="style0">and relay it to me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1659" begin="42745205001t" end="42765642502t" region="region38" style="style0">and come back</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1660" begin="42765642502t" end="42779410006t" region="region30" style="style0">I'll solve it.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1661" begin="42779410006t" end="42799847506t" region="region19" style="style0">One of us would have to die.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1662" begin="42799847506t" end="42821537508t" region="region1" style="style0">Well, draw lots.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1663" begin="42821537508t" end="42840305006t" region="region17" style="style0">-Come with us.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1664" begin="42821537508t" end="42840305006t" region="region11" style="style0">-Ha!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1665" begin="42840305006t" end="42866160002t" region="region23" style="style0">-I'll give you one night.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1666" begin="42840305006t" end="42866160002t" region="region112" style="style0">-One night.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1667" begin="42840305006t" end="42866160002t" region="region47" style="style0">Hmm...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1668" begin="42866160002t" end="42886180002t" region="region30" style="style0">No, you won't.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1669" begin="42886180002t" end="42908287505t" region="region28" style="style0">before he destroys us all.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1670" begin="42886180002t" end="42908287505t" region="region0" style="style0">Set must be stopped</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1671" begin="42908287505t" end="42933307500t" region="region71" style="style0">You see the wisdom in that,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1672" begin="42908287505t" end="42933307500t" region="region64" style="style0">don't you?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1673" begin="42933307500t" end="42970017506t" region="region18" style="style0">too important to risk.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1674" begin="42933307500t" end="42970017506t" region="region63" style="style0">This is far</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1675" begin="42970017506t" end="42993367500t" region="region19" style="style0">the true names of the stars.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1676" begin="42970017506t" end="42993367500t" region="region75" style="style0">I can recite</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1677" begin="42993367500t" end="43011310007t" region="region66" style="style0">I know.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1678" begin="43011310007t" end="43023397500t" region="region71" style="style0">I've seen the world created</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1679" begin="43011310007t" end="43023397500t" region="region99" style="style0">from sand and water.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1680" begin="43023397500t" end="43041340007t" region="region76" style="style0">Mmm-hmm.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1681" begin="43041340007t" end="43055097501t" region="region4" style="style0">I contain all the wisdom</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1682" begin="43041340007t" end="43055097501t" region="region1" style="style0">in the universe.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1683" begin="43055097501t" end="43078040003t" region="region2" style="style0">More precious than some crown.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1684" begin="43078040003t" end="43103477500t" region="region30" style="style0">Ha! I have it!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1685" begin="43103477500t" end="43124750001t" region="region23" style="style0">Its mystery. Its essence.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1686" begin="43103477500t" end="43124750001t" region="region64" style="style0">Its truth.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1687" begin="43137265003t" end="43149780006t" region="region39" style="style0">It's lettuce!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1688" begin="43155615001t" end="43183557500t" region="region44" style="style0">dropped his guard.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1689" begin="43155615001t" end="43183557500t" region="region63" style="style0">Your father</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1690" begin="43183557500t" end="43205665001t" region="region51" style="style0">That was not only</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1691" begin="43183557500t" end="43205665001t" region="region42" style="style0">extremely stupid,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1692" begin="43205665001t" end="43234442500t" region="region4" style="style0">to write down everything</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1693" begin="43205665001t" end="43234442500t" region="region98" style="style0">but now I'm forced</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1694" begin="43205665001t" end="43234442500t" region="region47" style="style0">I know</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1695" begin="43234442500t" end="43258637505t" region="region18" style="style0">the remote possibility</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1696" begin="43234442500t" end="43258637505t" region="region32" style="style0">as a defense against</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1697" begin="43258637505t" end="43274482500t" region="region65" style="style0">that Set's war finds me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1698" begin="43274482500t" end="43309522506t" region="region35" style="style0">I'm sorry that the corpses</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1699" begin="43274482500t" end="43309522506t" region="region39" style="style0">of my parents</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1700" begin="43309522506t" end="43323697500t" region="region65" style="style0">have inconvenienced you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1701" begin="43323697500t" end="43360407506t" region="region51" style="style0">Apology accepted.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1702" begin="43323697500t" end="43360407506t" region="region39" style="style0">Now, get out!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1703" begin="43360407506t" end="43382515008t" region="region65" style="style0">But you have to help us!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1704" begin="43382515008t" end="43393767500t" region="region40" style="style0">(SWORDS CLATTERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1705" begin="43393767500t" end="43410875006t" region="region36" style="style0">THOTH: Careful.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1706" begin="43410875006t" end="43432147508t" region="region1" style="style0">I outnumber you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1707" begin="43450080006t" end="43463420000t" region="region42" style="style0">Whoa, whoa, whoa!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1708" begin="43482615008t" end="43502635008t" region="region62" style="style0">It's fine.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1709" begin="43482615008t" end="43502635008t" region="region25" style="style0">I'll do it.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1710" begin="43502635008t" end="43524315000t" region="region43" style="style0">I thought you were</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1711" begin="43502635008t" end="43524315000t" region="region36" style="style0">a stray baboon.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1712" begin="43524315000t" end="43548510003t" region="region23" style="style0">I told you I'd be the one</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1713" begin="43524315000t" end="43548510003t" region="region40" style="style0">to face the Sphinx.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1714" begin="43548510003t" end="43576035001t" region="region33" style="style0">Your chance of failure</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1715" begin="43548510003t" end="43576035001t" region="region1" style="style0">is overwhelming.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1716" begin="43576035001t" end="43596055001t" region="region18" style="style0">But before it kills me</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1717" begin="43576035001t" end="43596055001t" region="region50" style="style0">I'm sure.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1718" begin="43596055001t" end="43609822506t" region="region32" style="style0">I'm going to tell it</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1719" begin="43596055001t" end="43609822506t" region="region5" style="style0">that I asked</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1720" begin="43609822506t" end="43626502502t" region="region53" style="style0">the God of Wisdom to come</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1721" begin="43626502502t" end="43644017500t" region="region28" style="style0">he'd get the answer wrong.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1722" begin="43626502502t" end="43644017500t" region="region51" style="style0">but he was afraid</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1723" begin="43644017500t" end="43669882506t" region="region111" style="style0">This is the cleverest strategy</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1724" begin="43644017500t" end="43669882506t" region="region42" style="style0">you could devise?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1725" begin="43669882506t" end="43684057500t" region="region44" style="style0">Playing on my ego?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1726" begin="43684057500t" end="43705330001t" region="region56" style="style0">How vain do you think I am?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1727" begin="43738282503t" end="43752467508t" region="region37" style="style0">Um... Hmm.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1728" begin="43783332508t" end="43795420001t" region="region5" style="style0">Yes, well...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1729" begin="43802100007t" end="43813770000t" region="region78" style="style0">Fine.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1730" begin="43822537508t" end="43834207500t" region="region78" style="style0">Fine!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1731" begin="43872587508t" end="43884257500t" region="region61" style="style0">Let's go.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1732" begin="43902617508t" end="43914287500t" region="region11" style="style0">Bye.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1733" begin="43934307500t" end="43948492503t" region="region37" style="style0">Well done.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1734" begin="43948492503t" end="43963095008t" region="region37" style="style0">Thank you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1735" begin="44113245008t" end="44134507500t" region="region23" style="style0">HATHOR: You know his Zaya</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1736" begin="44113245008t" end="44134507500t" region="region99" style="style0">can never come back.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1737" begin="44134507500t" end="44154527500t" region="region21" style="style0">The King doesn't</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1738" begin="44134507500t" end="44154527500t" region="region36" style="style0">have the power.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1739" begin="44154527500t" end="44174965000t" region="region83" style="style0">Anubis doesn't</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1740" begin="44154527500t" end="44174965000t" region="region36" style="style0">have the power.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1741" begin="44174965000t" end="44188732503t" region="region42" style="style0">You deceived him.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1742" begin="44204577500t" end="44230442506t" region="region122" style="style0">He will probably die</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1743" begin="44204577500t" end="44230442506t" region="region40" style="style0">into Set's pyramid.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1744" begin="44204577500t" end="44230442506t" region="region10" style="style0">trying to break</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1745" begin="44230442506t" end="44249210003t" region="region13" style="style0">He offered his life.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1746" begin="44249210003t" end="44265472500t" region="region43" style="style0">Because he thought</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1747" begin="44249210003t" end="44265472500t" region="region44" style="style0">he could save her.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1748" begin="44265472500t" end="44284657500t" region="region0" style="style0">He believes what he</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1749" begin="44265472500t" end="44284657500t" region="region42" style="style0">wants to believe.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1750" begin="44284657500t" end="44314687500t" region="region18" style="style0">in more ways than one.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1751" begin="44284657500t" end="44314687500t" region="region51" style="style0">You've been blind</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1752" begin="44314687500t" end="44334707500t" region="region26" style="style0">You really watched the world</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1753" begin="44314687500t" end="44334707500t" region="region1" style="style0">come into being?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1754" begin="44334707500t" end="44353902508t" region="region5" style="style0">I don't lie.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1755" begin="44353902508t" end="44365572500t" region="region42" style="style0">watching it from,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1756" begin="44353902508t" end="44365572500t" region="region83" style="style0">Where were you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1757" begin="44365572500t" end="44382680007t" region="region0" style="style0">if nothing had been</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1758" begin="44365572500t" end="44382680007t" region="region89" style="style0">created yet?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1759" begin="44382680007t" end="44408535003t" region="region0" style="style0">If I even attempted</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1760" begin="44382680007t" end="44408535003t" region="region25" style="style0">to explain,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1761" begin="44408535003t" end="44426885001t" region="region69" style="style0">your brain would liquefy</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1762" begin="44408535003t" end="44426885001t" region="region53" style="style0">and run out of your ears.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1763" begin="44443575008t" end="44469012503t" region="region44" style="style0">a path of revenge.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1764" begin="44443575008t" end="44469012503t" region="region21" style="style0">I did not choose</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1765" begin="44469012503t" end="44486527501t" region="region3" style="style0">I chose none of this.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1766" begin="44486527501t" end="44504877500t" region="region111" style="style0">You tell me what kind of power</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1767" begin="44486527501t" end="44504877500t" region="region42" style="style0">do I really have?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1768" begin="44504877500t" end="44534082508t" region="region67" style="style0">You have the power</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1769" begin="44504877500t" end="44534082508t" region="region40" style="style0">to make this right.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1770" begin="44534082508t" end="44554927500t" region="region44" style="style0">to know the truth.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1771" begin="44534082508t" end="44554927500t" region="region63" style="style0">He deserves</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1772" begin="44554927500t" end="44589132503t" region="region41" style="style0">I need him to get us in</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1773" begin="44554927500t" end="44589132503t" region="region99" style="style0">to choke Set's fire.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1774" begin="44589132503t" end="44612492507t" region="region18" style="style0">Is that what you want?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1775" begin="44589132503t" end="44612492507t" region="region117" style="style0">If he refuses,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1776" begin="44589132503t" end="44612492507t" region="region17" style="style0">we'll all die.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1777" begin="44735107500t" end="44758885003t" region="region67" style="style0">It's too dangerous</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1778" begin="44735107500t" end="44758885003t" region="region40" style="style0">to cross the plain.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1779" begin="44758885003t" end="44773905008t" region="region65" style="style0">We'll wait for darkness.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1780" begin="44773905008t" end="44793090007t" region="region54" style="style0">But we're running out</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1781" begin="44773905008t" end="44793090007t" region="region70" style="style0">of time.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1782" begin="44793090007t" end="44809770003t" region="region32" style="style0">-I say we cross now.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1783" begin="44793090007t" end="44809770003t" region="region40" style="style0">-And I say we wait.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1784" begin="44833547508t" end="44845217500t" region="region61" style="style0">(EXHALES)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1785" begin="44918210002t" end="44955327500t" region="region26" style="style0">All the time you were apart,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1786" begin="44918210002t" end="44955327500t" region="region3" style="style0">she never forgot you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1787" begin="44968260002t" end="44992037506t" region="region53" style="style0">Hathor's heart, you know.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1788" begin="44968260002t" end="44992037506t" region="region54" style="style0">You've always been in</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1789" begin="44992037506t" end="45014145008t" region="region43" style="style0">Yes, but she's got</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1790" begin="44992037506t" end="45014145008t" region="region5" style="style0">a big heart.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1791" begin="45014145008t" end="45027902502t" region="region41" style="style0">Room enough for a crowd</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1792" begin="45014145008t" end="45027902502t" region="region61" style="style0">in there.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1793" begin="45043340007t" end="45078370002t" region="region33" style="style0">Tell me, oh, wise Lord</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1794" begin="45043340007t" end="45078370002t" region="region25" style="style0">of the Air.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1795" begin="45078370002t" end="45098390002t" region="region52" style="style0">Why do you think</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1796" begin="45078370002t" end="45098390002t" region="region42" style="style0">Set let you live?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1797" begin="45121750006t" end="45136342500t" region="region13" style="style0">She did it for love.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1798" begin="45136342500t" end="45165537500t" region="region28" style="style0">You'd punish her for that?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1799" begin="45165537500t" end="45185557500t" region="region27" style="style0">I didn't want her help.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1800" begin="45204752508t" end="45225180000t" region="region58" style="style0">I only ever wanted one thing.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1801" begin="45235607500t" end="45276482500t" region="region28" style="style0">I think everyone's a fool.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1802" begin="45235607500t" end="45276482500t" region="region123" style="style0">You know,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1803" begin="45276482500t" end="45303182507t" region="region3" style="style0">are bigger than most.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1804" begin="45276482500t" end="45303182507t" region="region51" style="style0">But you, My Lord,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1805" begin="45475022508t" end="45485857500t" region="region40" style="style0">thinking about her?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1806" begin="45475022508t" end="45485857500t" region="region10" style="style0">HATHOR: Are you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1807" begin="45518810002t" end="45532995006t" region="region44" style="style0">Of course you are.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1808" begin="45555927500t" end="45588045001t" region="region19" style="style0">as the Mistress of the West.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1809" begin="45555927500t" end="45588045001t" region="region21" style="style0">I was once known</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1810" begin="45588045001t" end="45613910007t" region="region0" style="style0">My duty was to help</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1811" begin="45588045001t" end="45613910007t" region="region64" style="style0">dead souls</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1812" begin="45613910007t" end="45632260006t" region="region42" style="style0">to the Afterlife.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1813" begin="45613910007t" end="45632260006t" region="region83" style="style0">make their way</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1814" begin="45632260006t" end="45654367508t" region="region65" style="style0">to the Land of the Dead?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1815" begin="45632260006t" end="45654367508t" region="region75" style="style0">You traveled</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1816" begin="45654367508t" end="45680222503t" region="region19" style="style0">Even to those who have died.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1817" begin="45654367508t" end="45680222503t" region="region4" style="style0">I'm the Goddess of Love.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1818" begin="45694407508t" end="45724437508t" region="region19" style="style0">I was young. Easily seduced.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1819" begin="45724437508t" end="45738195001t" region="region37" style="style0">&quot;Seduced&quot;?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1820" begin="45738195001t" end="45753215006t" region="region66" style="style0">Demons.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1821" begin="45753215006t" end="45774487508t" region="region27" style="style0">This keeps them at bay.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1822" begin="45774487508t" end="45806177500t" region="region53" style="style0">The Bracelet of 42 Stars.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1823" begin="45806177500t" end="45836207500t" region="region35" style="style0">One for each of the demons</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1824" begin="45806177500t" end="45836207500t" region="region65" style="style0">Horus slayed to free me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1825" begin="45836207500t" end="45856227500t" region="region43" style="style0">That's when I knew</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1826" begin="45836207500t" end="45856227500t" region="region5" style="style0">I loved him.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1827" begin="45856227500t" end="45882510006t" region="region65" style="style0">you're fighting for her.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1828" begin="45856227500t" end="45882510006t" region="region43" style="style0">Zaya needs to know</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1829" begin="45882510006t" end="45895850000t" region="region28" style="style0">So she does not lose hope.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1830" begin="45956327500t" end="45970512503t" region="region1" style="style0">(WHISPERS) Zaya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1831" begin="46006377500t" end="46017640001t" region="region78" style="style0">Zaya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1832" begin="46041417505t" end="46075205008t" region="region1" style="style0">Can you hear me?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1833" begin="46041417505t" end="46075205008t" region="region63" style="style0">Zaya? Zaya?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1834" begin="46081040003t" end="46094807508t" region="region78" style="style0">Zaya?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1835" begin="46098555001t" end="46113157506t" region="region37" style="style0">Who is it?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1836" begin="46125255008t" end="46142770006t" region="region5" style="style0">Who's there?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1837" begin="46142770006t" end="46170295003t" region="region6" style="style0"><span style="style1">Hathor, Mistress of the West.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1838" begin="46142770006t" end="46170295003t" region="region36" style="style0">ZAYA:<span style="style1"> Mistress.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1839" begin="46170295003t" end="46190732503t" region="region19" style="style0">from the Land of the Living.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1840" begin="46170295003t" end="46190732503t" region="region17" style="style0">I speak to you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1841" begin="46190732503t" end="46205335008t" region="region65" style="style0">Your beloved is with me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1842" begin="46205335008t" end="46219927502t" region="region30" style="style0">Zaya, it's me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1843" begin="46205335008t" end="46219927502t" region="region102" style="style0"><span style="style1">Bek?</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1844" begin="46238695001t" end="46254967508t" region="region35" style="style0"><span style="style1">I knew if there was a way,</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1845" begin="46238695001t" end="46254967508t" region="region44" style="style0"><span style="style1">you would find it.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1846" begin="46270812503t" end="46287492500t" region="region13" style="style0">But I can't see you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1847" begin="46287492500t" end="46300842503t" region="region93" style="style0"><span style="style1">we can be together again.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1848" begin="46287492500t" end="46300842503t" region="region75" style="style0">BEK:<span style="style1"> Listen,</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1849" begin="46300842503t" end="46310435003t" region="region7" style="style0"><span style="style1">You can return.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1850" begin="46310435003t" end="46325455008t" region="region76" style="style0">But how?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1851" begin="46332542506t" end="46346717500t" region="region44" style="style0">I'm helping Horus.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1852" begin="46346717500t" end="46366737500t" region="region18" style="style0">he's going to help us.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1853" begin="46346717500t" end="46366737500t" region="region46" style="style0">In return,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1854" begin="46366737500t" end="46386757500t" region="region43" style="style0">ZAYA:<span style="style1"> It is really</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1855" begin="46366737500t" end="46386757500t" region="region7" style="style0"><span style="style1">the Bek I love?</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1856" begin="46386757500t" end="46407612500t" region="region35" style="style0">I know, Zaya. I can hardly</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1857" begin="46386757500t" end="46407612500t" region="region44" style="style0">believe it myself.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1858" begin="46407612500t" end="46426380000t" region="region0" style="style0">(CHUCKLES) Bek, me,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1859" begin="46407612500t" end="46426380000t" region="region60" style="style0">trusting the gods.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1860" begin="46436807500t" end="46452662506t" region="region18" style="style0">But I was wrong, Zaya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1861" begin="46452662506t" end="46472682506t" region="region65" style="style0">as you said he would be.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1862" begin="46452662506t" end="46472682506t" region="region32" style="style0">Horus is a just god,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1863" begin="46472682506t" end="46492702506t" region="region56" style="style0">&quot;I told you so,&quot; right now.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1864" begin="46472682506t" end="46492702506t" region="region23" style="style0">You're probably thinking,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1865" begin="46492702506t" end="46518140001t" region="region48" style="style0">Well, yes. Just a little bit.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1866" begin="46492702506t" end="46518140001t" region="region70" style="style0">(LAUGHS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1867" begin="46533995006t" end="46551510003t" region="region40" style="style0">to hear your voice.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1868" begin="46533995006t" end="46551510003t" region="region88" style="style0">It's so good</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1869" begin="46551510003t" end="46569442502t" region="region20" style="style0"><span style="style1">to be fine, Zaya, trust me.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1870" begin="46551510003t" end="46569442502t" region="region41" style="style0">BEK:<span style="style1"> Everything's going</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1871" begin="46569442502t" end="46589880002t" region="region44" style="style0"><span style="style1">to bring you back.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1872" begin="46569442502t" end="46589880002t" region="region17" style="style0"><span style="style1">Horus is going</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1873" begin="46589880002t" end="46605317508t" region="region7" style="style0"><span style="style1">I know he will.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1874" begin="46617822500t" end="46632007505t" region="region11" style="style0">Bek?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1875" begin="46642017505t" end="46656202508t" region="region40" style="style0">Bek, are you there?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1876" begin="46659950002t" end="46679552502t" region="region21" style="style0">(STAFF CLATTERS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1877" begin="46659950002t" end="46679552502t" region="region66" style="style0">(GASPS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1878" begin="46679552502t" end="46709582502t" region="region26" style="style0">It is forbidden for the dead</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1879" begin="46679552502t" end="46709582502t" region="region53" style="style0">to speak with the living.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1880" begin="46727932500t" end="46742117505t" region="region85" style="style0">Go.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1881" begin="46971930003t" end="46988192500t" region="region27" style="style0">There's a wheel inside.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1882" begin="46988192500t" end="47009465001t" region="region18" style="style0">the sand stops moving.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1883" begin="46988192500t" end="47009465001t" region="region51" style="style0">When you turn it,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1884" begin="47009465001t" end="47027397500t" region="region27" style="style0">to go through the door.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1885" begin="47009465001t" end="47027397500t" region="region88" style="style0">We just need</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1886" begin="47027397500t" end="47046592508t" region="region43" style="style0">Good thing you saw</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1887" begin="47027397500t" end="47046592508t" region="region5" style="style0">those plans.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1888" begin="47046592508t" end="47067437500t" region="region23" style="style0">HORUS: If you didn't know</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1889" begin="47046592508t" end="47067437500t" region="region42" style="style0">which one it was,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1890" begin="47067437500t" end="47079952502t" region="region0" style="style0">this would truly be</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1891" begin="47067437500t" end="47079952502t" region="region25" style="style0">impossible.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1892" begin="47094555006t" end="47117487500t" region="region74" style="style0">-Bek?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1893" begin="47094555006t" end="47117487500t" region="region78" style="style0">-Yes?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1894" begin="47117487500t" end="47137507500t" region="region53" style="style0">which is the door, right?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1895" begin="47117487500t" end="47137507500t" region="region63" style="style0">You do know</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1896" begin="47147517500t" end="47161702503t" region="region27" style="style0">Yes, of course, it's...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1897" begin="47161702503t" end="47176305008t" region="region61" style="style0">This one.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1898" begin="47188392500t" end="47204247506t" region="region10" style="style0">No, no, it's...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1899" begin="47188392500t" end="47204247506t" region="region59" style="style0">It's that one.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1900" begin="47213422506t" end="47225937508t" region="region18" style="style0">No, no, it's this one!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1901" begin="47352727505t" end="47367320000t" region="region36" style="style0">Roll the bones.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1902" begin="47377747500t" end="47396525008t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1903" begin="47487857500t" end="47501207502t" region="region61" style="style0">(YELLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1904" begin="47650105001t" end="47664707506t" region="region61" style="style0">(YELLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1905" begin="47684727506t" end="47699320001t" region="region40" style="style0">(RHYTHMIC THUMPING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1906" begin="47781905003t" end="47795672507t" region="region37" style="style0">(CHUCKLES)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1907" begin="47814440006t" end="47824450006t" region="region40" style="style0">THOTH: You guessed?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1908" begin="47824450006t" end="47842800003t" region="region44" style="style0">(STUTTERS) Well...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1909" begin="47842800003t" end="47878247500t" region="region33" style="style0">I find your dependence</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1910" begin="47842800003t" end="47878247500t" region="region13" style="style0">on chance troubling.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1911" begin="47878247500t" end="47892850003t" region="region10" style="style0">If you continue</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1912" begin="47878247500t" end="47892850003t" region="region25" style="style0">to survive,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1913" begin="47892850003t" end="47907860000t" region="region0" style="style0">I may need to study</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1914" begin="47892850003t" end="47907860000t" region="region89" style="style0">you further.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1915" begin="47916627508t" end="47937482508t" region="region65" style="style0">which way to the Sphinx?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1916" begin="47916627508t" end="47937482508t" region="region124" style="style0">Now,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1917" begin="48259462500t" end="48288657500t" region="region4" style="style0">Trespassers in the House</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1918" begin="48259462500t" end="48288657500t" region="region5" style="style0">of the King,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1919" begin="48288657500t" end="48316192507t" region="region21" style="style0">answer my riddle</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1920" begin="48288657500t" end="48316192507t" region="region36" style="style0">or cease to be.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1921" begin="48323697505t" end="48338290000t" region="region47" style="style0">Go on.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1922" begin="48343300003t" end="48357902508t" region="region86" style="style0">I'm waiting.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1923" begin="48362902503t" end="48376670007t" region="region76" style="style0">(GROWLS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1924" begin="48376670007t" end="48394185005t" region="region5" style="style0">I never was.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1925" begin="48408777500t" end="48428797500t" region="region1" style="style0">Am always to be.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1926" begin="48428797500t" end="48466760007t" region="region0" style="style0">No one ever saw me,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1927" begin="48428797500t" end="48466760007t" region="region59" style="style0">nor ever will.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1928" begin="48466760007t" end="48504712506t" region="region71" style="style0">And yet I am the confidence</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1929" begin="48466760007t" end="48504712506t" region="region19" style="style0">of all who live and breathe.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1930" begin="48504712506t" end="48538082508t" region="region37" style="style0">What am I?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1931" begin="48548917500t" end="48578530000t" region="region3" style="style0">Order. You are Order.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1932" begin="48621075001t" end="48636095006t" region="region13" style="style0">I never doubted you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1933" begin="48660697501t" end="48678222508t" region="region37" style="style0">(GRUNTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1934" begin="48689057500t" end="48701572502t" region="region37" style="style0">Incorrect.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1935" begin="48717010007t" end="48737865008t" region="region44" style="style0">Try again. Please.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1936" begin="48758302508t" end="48776235006t" region="region54" style="style0">That was a completely</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1937" begin="48758302508t" end="48776235006t" region="region55" style="style0">suitable answer.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1938" begin="48782905003t" end="48794167505t" region="region37" style="style0">(GROWLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1939" begin="48794167505t" end="48810430001t" region="region36" style="style0">You are Purity.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1940" begin="48839207500t" end="48851722502t" region="region95" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1941" begin="48839207500t" end="48851722502t" region="region61" style="style0">(YELLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1942" begin="48870907501t" end="48884257505t" region="region66" style="style0">(GASPS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1943" begin="48884257505t" end="48909277500t" region="region5" style="style0">Wrong again.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1944" begin="48909277500t" end="48929297500t" region="region42" style="style0">&quot;What never was.&quot;</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1945" begin="48909277500t" end="48929297500t" region="region88" style="style0">(STUTTERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1946" begin="48929297500t" end="48955162506t" region="region36" style="style0">&quot;Always to be.&quot;</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1947" begin="48955162506t" end="48973512503t" region="region26" style="style0">In the future. Non-existent.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1948" begin="48955162506t" end="48973512503t" region="region37" style="style0">Imaginary.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1949" begin="48973512503t" end="48988115008t" region="region61" style="style0">(ROARING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1950" begin="48999785000t" end="49015640006t" region="region82" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1951" begin="48999785000t" end="49015640006t" region="region47" style="style0">Yet...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1952" begin="49015640006t" end="49043165003t" region="region32" style="style0">THOTH: Yet it exists</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1953" begin="49015640006t" end="49043165003t" region="region1" style="style0">and &quot;never was.&quot;</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1954" begin="49043165003t" end="49073195003t" region="region13" style="style0">(STRAINING) Thoth...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1955" begin="49043165003t" end="49073195003t" region="region10" style="style0">&quot;Always to be.&quot;</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1956" begin="49073195003t" end="49097390007t" region="region19" style="style0">of all who live and breathe.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1957" begin="49073195003t" end="49097390007t" region="region33" style="style0">Yet I'm the confidence</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1958" begin="49097390007t" end="49109477500t" region="region53" style="style0">Mortals live and breathe!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1959" begin="49109477500t" end="49125332506t" region="region0" style="style0">Maybe stop thinking</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1960" begin="49109477500t" end="49125332506t" region="region25" style="style0">like a god.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1961" begin="49125332506t" end="49135342506t" region="region32" style="style0">Then I might as well</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1962" begin="49125332506t" end="49135342506t" region="region30" style="style0">stop thinking.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1963" begin="49135342506t" end="49148275008t" region="region47" style="style0">Thoth!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1964" begin="49154110003t" end="49169537500t" region="region72" style="style0">Wait, wait, I have it!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1965" begin="49169537500t" end="49187480007t" region="region42" style="style0">You are Tomorrow.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1966" begin="49187480007t" end="49206247506t" region="region25" style="style0">Oh, bother.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1967" begin="49227937508t" end="49239607500t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1968" begin="49294250003t" end="49308852508t" region="region36" style="style0">(SPHINX GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1969" begin="49429797500t" end="49442312502t" region="region1" style="style0">HORUS: One drop.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1970" begin="49558267508t" end="49570772500t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1971" begin="49570772500t" end="49583705003t" region="region85" style="style0">No!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1972" begin="49583705003t" end="49597055006t" region="region2" style="style0">(VOICES ECHOING AND MURMURING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1973" begin="49614152503t" end="49628755008t" region="region37" style="style0">(GROANING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1974" begin="49664620003t" end="49680047500t" region="region40" style="style0">I should thank you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1975" begin="49695067505t" end="49716340006t" region="region111" style="style0">You lured him from his library</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1976" begin="49695067505t" end="49716340006t" region="region53" style="style0">so that I didn't have to.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1977" begin="49750117500t" end="49768060007t" region="region1" style="style0">The final piece.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1978" begin="49768060007t" end="49783070002t" region="region25" style="style0">You coward.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1979" begin="49783070002t" end="49798507508t" region="region17" style="style0">Open this gate</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1980" begin="49783070002t" end="49798507508t" region="region39" style="style0">and fight me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1981" begin="49798507508t" end="49809760000t" region="region47" style="style0">Again?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1982" begin="49820187500t" end="49850217500t" region="region125" style="style0">Hasn't she's seen you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1983" begin="49820187500t" end="49850217500t" region="region89" style="style0">lose enough?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1984" begin="49850217500t" end="49862315001t" region="region43" style="style0">Can't you allow me</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1985" begin="49850217500t" end="49862315001t" region="region5" style="style0">to spare you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1986" begin="49862315001t" end="49883170002t" region="region10" style="style0">one last moment</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1987" begin="49862315001t" end="49883170002t" region="region1" style="style0">of embarrassment</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1988" begin="49883170002t" end="49897772507t" region="region36" style="style0">before you die?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1989" begin="49900685000t" end="49917792507t" region="region78" style="style0">Stop!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1990" begin="49932802502t" end="49947405006t" region="region36" style="style0">Recognize this?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1991" begin="49973260002t" end="49995785005t" region="region111" style="style0">Did he tell you he could bring</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1992" begin="49973260002t" end="49995785005t" region="region56" style="style0">your woman back from death?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1993" begin="50009552508t" end="50022475001t" region="region44" style="style0">It's not possible.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1994" begin="50030397500t" end="50047505006t" region="region1" style="style0">Not even for me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1995" begin="50047505006t" end="50060010000t" region="region58" style="style0">You expect me to believe you?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1996" begin="50078787508t" end="50091292500t" region="region13" style="style0">I don't have to lie.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1997" begin="50100467500t" end="50125497505t" region="region41" style="style0">How else would a blind,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1998" begin="50100467500t" end="50125497505t" region="region25" style="style0">useless god</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1999" begin="50125497505t" end="50137595006t" region="region13" style="style0">get you to help him?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2000" begin="50156780006t" end="50170120000t" region="region47" style="style0">Go on.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2001" begin="50173042502t" end="50187227506t" region="region76" style="style0">Ask him.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2002" begin="50206412506t" end="50227267506t" region="region75" style="style0">-Pour it in.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2003" begin="50206412506t" end="50227267506t" region="region5" style="style0">-Is it true?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2004" begin="50227267506t" end="50243947502t" region="region1" style="style0">Bek, pour it in!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2005" begin="50258550007t" end="50270220000t" region="region85" style="style0">No!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2006" begin="50277735006t" end="50290240000t" region="region5" style="style0">(SET GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2007" begin="50390757500t" end="50415787505t" region="region51" style="style0">Shame you weren't</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2008" begin="50390757500t" end="50415787505t" region="region25" style="style0">on my side.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2009" begin="50415787505t" end="50447070006t" region="region33" style="style0">that doesn't let death</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2010" begin="50415787505t" end="50447070006t" region="region42" style="style0">stand in his way.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2011" begin="50415787505t" end="50447070006t" region="region87" style="style0">I admire someone</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2012" begin="50447070006t" end="50478352507t" region="region21" style="style0">But this is what</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2013" begin="50447070006t" end="50478352507t" region="region30" style="style0">love gets you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2014" begin="50500867500t" end="50517557506t" region="region43" style="style0">It's quite fitting</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2015" begin="50500867500t" end="50517557506t" region="region1" style="style0">that you'll both</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2016" begin="50517557506t" end="50538830007t" region="region51" style="style0">die together here</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2017" begin="50517557506t" end="50538830007t" region="region89" style="style0">in my house.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2018" begin="50538830007t" end="50555927505t" region="region56" style="style0">I'll miss the conversation.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2019" begin="50555927505t" end="50570520000t" region="region39" style="style0">And the rest.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2020" begin="50613900002t" end="50628085006t" region="region66" style="style0">(GASPS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2021" begin="50665202503t" end="50679805008t" region="region37" style="style0">(GRUNTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2022" begin="50851217500t" end="50863315001t" region="region37" style="style0">(GRUNTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2023" begin="50995950003t" end="51011795000t" region="region30" style="style0">(HORUS GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2024" begin="51031397500t" end="51045582503t" region="region37" style="style0">(COUGHING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2025" begin="51085205003t" end="51098137506t" region="region42" style="style0">(EXHALES HEAVILY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2026" begin="51098137506t" end="51113147501t" region="region65" style="style0">You denied me vengeance.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2027" begin="51113147501t" end="51131497500t" region="region61" style="style0">(PANTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2028" begin="51131497500t" end="51146517505t" region="region3" style="style0">Zaya thought you were</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2029" begin="51146517505t" end="51156527505t" region="region67" style="style0">the greatest thing</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2030" begin="51146517505t" end="51156527505t" region="region40" style="style0">in all of creation.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2031" begin="51171537500t" end="51187810006t" region="region48" style="style0">Every day, she prayed for you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2032" begin="51171537500t" end="51187810006t" region="region59" style="style0">to save Egypt,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2033" begin="51187810006t" end="51199490007t" region="region13" style="style0">but you didn't come.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2034" begin="51199490007t" end="51221587500t" region="region21" style="style0">I was in a tomb.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2035" begin="51199490007t" end="51221587500t" region="region30" style="style0">I didn't hear.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2036" begin="51221587500t" end="51242025000t" region="region18" style="style0">No, you didn't listen.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2037" begin="51242025000t" end="51256210003t" region="region53" style="style0">is your stupid vengeance.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2038" begin="51242025000t" end="51256210003t" region="region67" style="style0">All you care about</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2039" begin="51276230003t" end="51294162502t" region="region18" style="style0">I was wrong about you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2040" begin="51276230003t" end="51294162502t" region="region43" style="style0">I started to think</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2041" begin="51311677500t" end="51326280003t" region="region4" style="style0">But I've finally learned</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2042" begin="51311677500t" end="51326280003t" region="region27" style="style0">the lesson of the gods.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2043" begin="51326280003t" end="51341290000t" region="region27" style="style0">We don't matter to you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2044" begin="51366320003t" end="51378417506t" region="region40" style="style0">Well, now you know.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2045" begin="51556092503t" end="51569442507t" region="region40" style="style0">Anubis, come forth.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2046" begin="51620745008t" end="51634085001t" region="region37" style="style0">(SNARLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2047" begin="51642007500t" end="51662027500t" region="region61" style="style0">Mistress.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2048" begin="51662027500t" end="51692057500t" region="region19" style="style0">as lovely as the first dawn.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2049" begin="51662027500t" end="51692057500t" region="region38" style="style0">You are still</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2050" begin="51692057500t" end="51712077500t" region="region56" style="style0">Hathor, what are you doing?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2051" begin="51712077500t" end="51742107500t" region="region71" style="style0">This mortal's beloved bears</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2052" begin="51712077500t" end="51742107500t" region="region56" style="style0">no treasure for the scales.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2053" begin="51742107500t" end="51761302508t" region="region65" style="style0">Perhaps we can help her.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2054" begin="51761302508t" end="51786322503t" region="region27" style="style0">You ask much, Mistress.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2055" begin="51786322503t" end="51822187500t" region="region41" style="style0">It would require a very</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2056" begin="51786322503t" end="51822187500t" region="region65" style="style0">special treasure indeed.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2057" begin="51822187500t" end="51836372503t" region="region85" style="style0">No.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2058" begin="51836372503t" end="51853052500t" region="region25" style="style0">-Like this?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2059" begin="51836372503t" end="51853052500t" region="region82" style="style0">-No. No!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2060" begin="51853052500t" end="51881005008t" region="region3" style="style0">Mistress of the West?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2061" begin="51853052500t" end="51881005008t" region="region95" style="style0">For you,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2062" begin="51892257500t" end="51912277500t" region="region11" style="style0">Yes.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2063" begin="51912277500t" end="51931880000t" region="region28" style="style0">to give it to her himself.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2064" begin="51912277500t" end="51931880000t" region="region51" style="style0">Grant him passage</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2065" begin="51964415001t" end="51979852507t" region="region21" style="style0">You will see her</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2066" begin="51964415001t" end="51979852507t" region="region30" style="style0">one last time.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2067" begin="51986522503t" end="52001125008t" region="region37" style="style0">Thank you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2068" begin="52019057506t" end="52041165008t" region="region13" style="style0">No, no, I forbid it.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2069" begin="52041165008t" end="52062427500t" region="region51" style="style0">We're both guilty</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2070" begin="52041165008t" end="52062427500t" region="region42" style="style0">of deceiving Bek.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2071" begin="52062427500t" end="52076195003t" region="region18" style="style0">This will make amends.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2072" begin="52076195003t" end="52111652508t" region="region17" style="style0">Not like this.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2073" begin="52076195003t" end="52111652508t" region="region39" style="style0">Not with you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2074" begin="52111652508t" end="52136255003t" region="region38" style="style0">I command you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2075" begin="52111652508t" end="52136255003t" region="region30" style="style0">to release me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2076" begin="52136255003t" end="52170042507t" region="region54" style="style0">You can't command me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2077" begin="52136255003t" end="52170042507t" region="region39" style="style0">You know why.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2078" begin="52199237506t" end="52215917502t" region="region65" style="style0">I'm the Goddess of Love.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2079" begin="52241365008t" end="52270977508t" region="region0" style="style0">If I don't do this,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2080" begin="52241365008t" end="52270977508t" region="region89" style="style0">I'm nothing.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2081" begin="52270977508t" end="52292240000t" region="region27" style="style0">I can't lose you again.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2082" begin="52427380003t" end="52441565008t" region="region76" style="style0">(GROANS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2083" begin="52670960007t" end="52682630000t" region="region76" style="style0">Take it.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2084" begin="52795662502t" end="52812760000t" region="region27" style="style0">Do what you need to do.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2085" begin="53003367500t" end="53017970003t" region="region27" style="style0">The Hall of Two Truths.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2086" begin="53034232500t" end="53053000000t" region="region53" style="style0">Where we shall be judged.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2087" begin="53079700006t" end="53098467505t" region="region53" style="style0">HEAD JUDGE: Step forward.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2088" begin="53239442506t" end="53256122502t" region="region44" style="style0">What do you offer?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2089" begin="53297832503t" end="53312435008t" region="region1" style="style0">(SCALE CLICKING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2090" begin="53336620002t" end="53351222507t" region="region39" style="style0">Step forward.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2091" begin="53393757500t" end="53433380000t" region="region3" style="style0">I shall live forever!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2092" begin="53473012508t" end="53488440003t" region="region2" style="style0">HEAD JUDGE: What do you offer?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2093" begin="53540995006t" end="53553500000t" region="region1" style="style0">(SCALE CLICKING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2094" begin="53586452502t" end="53613560000t" region="region39" style="style0">Step forward.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2095" begin="53718252503t" end="53732855008t" region="region25" style="style0">(SCREAMING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2096" begin="53788740003t" end="53807507502t" region="region39" style="style0">Step forward.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2097" begin="53908025003t" end="53928880003t" region="region44" style="style0">What do you offer?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2098" begin="53948065003t" end="53973919999t" region="region44" style="style0">What do you offer?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2099" begin="54064427500t" end="54076942502t" region="region78" style="style0">Zaya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2100" begin="54084447500t" end="54099050003t" region="region18" style="style0">(CHUCKLES SOFTLY) Bek.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2101" begin="54323862508t" end="54342212507t" region="region39" style="style0">(SET ROARING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2102" begin="54363902508t" end="54383922508t" region="region5" style="style0">SLAVES: Set,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2103" begin="54383922508t" end="54416865001t" region="region4" style="style0">receive the golden wings</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2104" begin="54383922508t" end="54416865001t" region="region5" style="style0">of Nephthys.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2105" begin="54416865001t" end="54449400003t" region="region28" style="style0">from those who would harm.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2106" begin="54416865001t" end="54449400003t" region="region32" style="style0">May they protect him</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2107" begin="54538655003t" end="54552422507t" region="region37" style="style0">(CLANKING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2108" begin="54576607501t" end="54614977500t" region="region35" style="style0">SLAVES: The karr of Thoth,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2109" begin="54576607501t" end="54614977500t" region="region30" style="style0">God of Wisdom.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2110" begin="54614977500t" end="54640425005t" region="region56" style="style0">Allow him knowledge of old.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2111" begin="54659610003t" end="54671707506t" region="region27" style="style0">(ELECTRICITY CRACKLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2112" begin="54699650003t" end="54723845008t" region="region13" style="style0">The heart of Osiris.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2113" begin="54723845008t" end="54754292508t" region="region43" style="style0">Grant him dominion</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2114" begin="54723845008t" end="54754292508t" region="region36" style="style0">over all Lands.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2115" begin="54775137500t" end="54795157500t" region="region40" style="style0">The all-seeing eye.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2116" begin="54795157500t" end="54831867506t" region="region33" style="style0">Reward him so no enemy</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2117" begin="54795157500t" end="54831867506t" region="region5" style="style0">can deceive.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2118" begin="54855217500t" end="54868567502t" region="region37" style="style0">(GROWLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2119" begin="54944482508t" end="54956570001t" region="region5" style="style0">(SET GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2120" begin="54999950003t" end="55017882502t" region="region65" style="style0">You look glorious, Lord.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2121" begin="55055835000t" end="55072942507t" region="region66" style="style0">I know.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2122" begin="55273560007t" end="55285647500t" region="region30" style="style0">SET: Father...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2123" begin="55328192502t" end="55354057508t" region="region32" style="style0">I noticed the tower.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2124" begin="55328192502t" end="55354057508t" region="region25" style="style0">Impressive.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2125" begin="55361562506t" end="55379912503t" region="region40" style="style0">I built it for you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2126" begin="55379912503t" end="55410777505t" region="region33" style="style0">If it were any taller,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2127" begin="55379912503t" end="55410777505t" region="region18" style="style0">it would be in my way.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2128" begin="55410777505t" end="55442895006t" region="region83" style="style0">Turn your eyes</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2129" begin="55410777505t" end="55442895006t" region="region36" style="style0">from your sails</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2130" begin="55442895006t" end="55455399999t" region="region33" style="style0">and look at everything</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2131" begin="55442895006t" end="55455399999t" region="region37" style="style0">I've done.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2132" begin="55475837500t" end="55494197508t" region="region65" style="style0">What Osiris never could.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2133" begin="55494197508t" end="55510460003t" region="region53" style="style0">I rule all that breathes.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2134" begin="55522975006t" end="55538402502t" region="region10" style="style0">And all that is</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2135" begin="55522975006t" end="55538402502t" region="region59" style="style0">breathed upon.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2136" begin="55553005006t" end="55576355000t" region="region21" style="style0">None is mightier</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2137" begin="55553005006t" end="55576355000t" region="region30" style="style0">below the sun.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2138" begin="55576355000t" end="55612230006t" region="region13" style="style0">as I've honored you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2139" begin="55576355000t" end="55612230006t" region="region38" style="style0">Then honor me</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2140" begin="55612230006t" end="55626822500t" region="region2" style="style0">If honor had been your intent,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2141" begin="55626822500t" end="55656852500t" region="region19" style="style0">from murdering your brother.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2142" begin="55626822500t" end="55656852500t" region="region4" style="style0">you might have abstained</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2143" begin="55656852500t" end="55687717501t" region="region18" style="style0">everything down there.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2144" begin="55656852500t" end="55687717501t" region="region38" style="style0">So you do see</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2145" begin="55687717501t" end="55721087505t" region="region53" style="style0">do you care what happens?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2146" begin="55687717501t" end="55721087505t" region="region52" style="style0">Tell me, Father,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2147" begin="55742360006t" end="55774895008t" region="region28" style="style0">I care more than you know.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2148" begin="55774895008t" end="55792827506t" region="region1" style="style0">I cast out alone</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2149" begin="55774895008t" end="55792827506t" region="region75" style="style0">Then why was</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2150" begin="55809925003t" end="55830362503t" region="region27" style="style0">to walk on burning sand</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2151" begin="55809925003t" end="55830362503t" region="region88" style="style0">(WHISPERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2152" begin="55844130007t" end="55874577508t" region="region21" style="style0">while my brother</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2153" begin="55844130007t" end="55874577508t" region="region36" style="style0">played barefoot</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2154" begin="55874577508t" end="55889170002t" region="region28" style="style0">by the shores of the Nile?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2155" begin="55916277500t" end="55938385001t" region="region21" style="style0">Why did you make</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2156" begin="55916277500t" end="55938385001t" region="region5" style="style0">Osiris King?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2157" begin="55938385001t" end="55973007506t" region="region10" style="style0">And why did you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2158" begin="55938385001t" end="55973007506t" region="region36" style="style0">give him a son?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2159" begin="55973007506t" end="56000950003t" region="region58" style="style0">the chance to even give life.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2160" begin="55973007506t" end="56000950003t" region="region54" style="style0">And yet you denied me</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2161" begin="56000950003t" end="56023057506t" region="region40" style="style0">This was your test.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2162" begin="56023057506t" end="56036815000t" region="region13" style="style0">You didn't test him.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2163" begin="56036815000t" end="56057670001t" region="region40" style="style0">the crown of Egypt.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2164" begin="56036815000t" end="56057670001t" region="region38" style="style0">I gave Osiris</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2165" begin="56072272506t" end="56116477500t" region="region58" style="style0">he didn't cling to his power.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2166" begin="56072272506t" end="56116477500t" region="region41" style="style0">And when the time came,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2167" begin="56116477500t" end="56160275003t" region="region41" style="style0">He gave it away freely.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2168" begin="56116477500t" end="56160275003t" region="region40" style="style0">He passed his test.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2169" begin="56160275003t" end="56176955000t" region="region42" style="style0">I've passed mine.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2170" begin="56160275003t" end="56176955000t" region="region38" style="style0">And I'd wager</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2171" begin="56176955000t" end="56194062507t" region="region76" style="style0">Not yet.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2172" begin="56199480002t" end="56219082502t" region="region5" style="style0">It's true...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2173" begin="56219082502t" end="56237850001t" region="region43" style="style0">I did not want you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2174" begin="56219082502t" end="56237850001t" region="region42" style="style0">to have children.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2175" begin="56246607500t" end="56266627500t" region="region13" style="style0">This was a kindness,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2176" begin="56266627500t" end="56285822508t" region="region35" style="style0">because I did not want you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2177" begin="56266627500t" end="56285822508t" region="region5" style="style0">to miss them</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2178" begin="56285822508t" end="56299580002t" region="region18" style="style0">as terribly as I have.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2179" begin="56299580002t" end="56313765006t" region="region37" style="style0">Miss them?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2180" begin="56326687500t" end="56342125005t" region="region42" style="style0">to take my place.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2181" begin="56326687500t" end="56342125005t" region="region62" style="style0">I need you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2182" begin="56366727500t" end="56379660002t" region="region78" style="style0">Here?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2183" begin="56379660002t" end="56406767500t" region="region44" style="style0">test ends, my son.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2184" begin="56379660002t" end="56406767500t" region="region21" style="style0">This is how your</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2185" begin="56406767500t" end="56426369999t" region="region56" style="style0">There is no greater burden.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2186" begin="56451400003t" end="56464332507t" region="region3" style="style0">But no greater honor.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2187" begin="56496857500t" end="56525645008t" region="region51" style="style0">All you have done</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2188" begin="56496857500t" end="56525645008t" region="region55" style="style0">can be forgiven.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2189" begin="56586947500t" end="56632415005t" region="region33" style="style0">You expect me to joust</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2190" begin="56586947500t" end="56632415005t" region="region36" style="style0">with this beast</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2191" begin="56645765008t" end="56685387508t" region="region51" style="style0">night after night</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2192" begin="56645765008t" end="56685387508t" region="region89" style="style0">until I die?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2193" begin="56685387508t" end="56701232503t" region="region42" style="style0">What do you want?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2194" begin="56707067500t" end="56725010007t" region="region5" style="style0">Immortality.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2195" begin="56725010007t" end="56757117500t" region="region23" style="style0">Immortality awaits us all</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2196" begin="56725010007t" end="56757117500t" region="region42" style="style0">in the Afterlife.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2197" begin="56757117500t" end="56789235001t" region="region32" style="style0">I don't want to die.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2198" begin="56757117500t" end="56789235001t" region="region36" style="style0">I want to live.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2199" begin="56789235001t" end="56805090007t" region="region76" style="style0">Forever.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2200" begin="56805090007t" end="56827187500t" region="region53" style="style0">in the lands I conquered.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2201" begin="56805090007t" end="56827187500t" region="region62" style="style0">Down there</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2202" begin="56827187500t" end="56837197500t" region="region25" style="style0">My kingdom.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2203" begin="56837197500t" end="56860975003t" region="region53" style="style0">This should be my reward.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2204" begin="56860975003t" end="56896015008t" region="region26" style="style0">How? The only way to achieve</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2205" begin="56860975003t" end="56896015008t" region="region13" style="style0">this is unthinkable.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2206" begin="56896015008t" end="56912277505t" region="region17" style="style0">One would need</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2207" begin="56896015008t" end="56912277505t" region="region5" style="style0">to devour...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2208" begin="56912277505t" end="56931045003t" region="region3" style="style0">The Afterlife itself.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2209" begin="56931045003t" end="56956492508t" region="region41" style="style0">You would unleash Chaos</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2210" begin="56931045003t" end="56956492508t" region="region59" style="style0">upon creation?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2211" begin="56956492508t" end="56977337500t" region="region58" style="style0">You would destroy everything?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2212" begin="56977337500t" end="57006542508t" region="region65" style="style0">Not destroy. Reshape it.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2213" begin="57006542508t" end="57030310002t" region="region27" style="style0">I will take your place.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2214" begin="57030310002t" end="57050747502t" region="region41" style="style0">But it won't be sitting</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2215" begin="57030310002t" end="57050747502t" region="region60" style="style0">on some damn boat.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2216" begin="57227587500t" end="57242607505t" region="region27" style="style0">(SET BREATHING HEAVILY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2217" begin="57296832508t" end="57311842503t" region="region36" style="style0">withstand that.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2218" begin="57296832508t" end="57311842503t" region="region88" style="style0">No god could</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2219" begin="57327687500t" end="57348125000t" region="region3" style="style0">I'm not just one god.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2220" begin="57360640002t" end="57374825006t" region="region66" style="style0">(GASPS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2221" begin="57715165006t" end="57742272503t" region="region2" style="style0">HEAD JUDGE: What do you offer?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2222" begin="57742272503t" end="57764797506t" region="region53" style="style0">a place in the Afterlife.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2223" begin="57742272503t" end="57764797506t" region="region51" style="style0">This will buy you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2224" begin="57764797506t" end="57777719999t" region="region61" style="style0">ZAYA: No.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2225" begin="57787322508t" end="57799410001t" region="region1" style="style0">Not without you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2226" begin="57826527508t" end="57838197500t" region="region37" style="style0">(RUMBLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2227" begin="57884917506t" end="57903267505t" region="region42" style="style0">(SOULS SCREAMING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2228" begin="57903267505t" end="57927462508t" region="region53" style="style0">The gate has been broken!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2229" begin="57927462508t" end="57948307500t" region="region30" style="style0">Chaos spreads.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2230" begin="57948307500t" end="57962492503t" region="region44" style="style0">destroy this land.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2231" begin="57948307500t" end="57962492503t" region="region38" style="style0">Apophis shall</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2232" begin="58014212506t" end="58027969999t" region="region44" style="style0">(APOPHIS GRUNTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2233" begin="58076360007t" end="58098457500t" region="region30" style="style0">only hope now.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2234" begin="58076360007t" end="58098457500t" region="region75" style="style0">Horus is our</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2235" begin="58098457500t" end="58111390002t" region="region18" style="style0">you think he is, Zaya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2236" begin="58098457500t" end="58111390002t" region="region21" style="style0">He's not the god</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2237" begin="58111390002t" end="58127245008t" region="region30" style="style0">He lied to me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2238" begin="58127245008t" end="58145177506t" region="region65" style="style0">Give him another chance.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2239" begin="58145177506t" end="58165615006t" region="region32" style="style0">He only got this far</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2240" begin="58145177506t" end="58165615006t" region="region36" style="style0">because of you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2241" begin="58165615006t" end="58184382506t" region="region19" style="style0">My strength is not infinite.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2242" begin="58184382506t" end="58216917508t" region="region58" style="style0">has any plan to rectify this,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2243" begin="58184382506t" end="58216917508t" region="region97" style="style0">If the Lord of the Air</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2244" begin="58216917508t" end="58238597500t" region="region56" style="style0">he should do so with haste.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2245" begin="58238597500t" end="58267802508t" region="region41" style="style0">If you don't trust him,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2246" begin="58238597500t" end="58267802508t" region="region61" style="style0">trust me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2247" begin="58267802508t" end="58279890001t" region="region10" style="style0">I know we'll be</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2248" begin="58267802508t" end="58279890001t" region="region36" style="style0">together again.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2249" begin="58400427501t" end="58415030006t" region="region3" style="style0">HORUS: Ra has fallen.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2250" begin="58415030006t" end="58433380003t" region="region65" style="style0">Set has unleashed Chaos.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2251" begin="58433380003t" end="58448389999t" region="region18" style="style0">So how do we stop him?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2252" begin="58469245000t" end="58488847500t" region="region28" style="style0">You never give up, do you?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2253" begin="58488847500t" end="58504285005t" region="region13" style="style0">Zaya told me not to.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2254" begin="58488847500t" end="58504285005t" region="region75" style="style0">Only because</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2255" begin="58509285000t" end="58525557506t" region="region49" style="style0">about our bargain?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2256" begin="58509285000t" end="58525557506t" region="region0" style="style0">You didn't tell her</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2257" begin="58525557506t" end="58539315000t" region="region13" style="style0">Yes, I did tell her.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2258" begin="58539315000t" end="58555587506t" region="region28" style="style0">she still believes in you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2259" begin="58539315000t" end="58555587506t" region="region32" style="style0">But for some reason,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2260" begin="58576025006t" end="58588529999t" region="region2" style="style0">We must return to the capital.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2261" begin="58598957500t" end="58613977505t" region="region4" style="style0">Then we have a long walk</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2262" begin="58598957500t" end="58613977505t" region="region5" style="style0">ahead of us.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2263" begin="58625657506t" end="58641920002t" region="region1" style="style0">(BIRDS CHIRPING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2264" begin="58641920002t" end="58656522507t" region="region1" style="style0">I prefer flying.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2265" begin="58693222503t" end="58704485005t" region="region61" style="style0">Nephthys.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2266" begin="58709067500t" end="58731175001t" region="region65" style="style0">she's trying to help us.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2267" begin="58709067500t" end="58731175001t" region="region43" style="style0">Even beyond death,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2268" begin="58785400006t" end="58796662507t" region="region44" style="style0">(THUNDER RUMBLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2269" begin="58903850003t" end="58918859999t" region="region5" style="style0">Come, demon!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2270" begin="59008125008t" end="59020212500t" region="region37" style="style0">(GROWLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2271" begin="59189547500t" end="59211237501t" region="region28" style="style0">HORUS: Set has Ra's spear.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2272" begin="59211237501t" end="59227510007t" region="region32" style="style0">He's drawing Apophis</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2273" begin="59211237501t" end="59227510007t" region="region5" style="style0">to the Nile,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2274" begin="59227510007t" end="59235432506t" region="region28" style="style0">to the source of all life.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2275" begin="59235432506t" end="59253365003t" region="region11" style="style0">Why?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2276" begin="59253365003t" end="59289647500t" region="region65" style="style0">To destroy all creation.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2277" begin="59253365003t" end="59289647500t" region="region75" style="style0">To drink it.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2278" begin="59289647500t" end="59309667500t" region="region35" style="style0">Ra isn't dead. And only he</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2279" begin="59289647500t" end="59309667500t" region="region13" style="style0">can make this right.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2280" begin="59309667500t" end="59329687500t" region="region27" style="style0">But he needs his spear.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2281" begin="59329687500t" end="59342202502t" region="region53" style="style0">So how do we get it back?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2282" begin="59351377501t" end="59369309999t" region="region10" style="style0">Maybe it's time</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2283" begin="59351377501t" end="59369309999t" region="region59" style="style0">we go fishing.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2284" begin="59438137508t" end="59459817500t" region="region19" style="style0">(URSHU PRAYING INDISTINCTLY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2285" begin="59459817500t" end="59486935006t" region="region41" style="style0">I come in your service,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2286" begin="59459817500t" end="59486935006t" region="region99" style="style0">I ask for your help.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2287" begin="59486935006t" end="59499032508t" region="region36" style="style0">HORUS: Builder.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2288" begin="59486935006t" end="59499032508t" region="region105" style="style0">(GASPS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2289" begin="59518217508t" end="59532810002t" region="region13" style="style0">We have need of you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2290" begin="59532810002t" end="59549489999t" region="region37" style="style0">(RUMBLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2291" begin="59579937500t" end="59593287502t" region="region40" style="style0">(SOLDIERS SHOUTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2292" begin="59720077500t" end="59749282508t" region="region23" style="style0">It is the single greatest</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2293" begin="59720077500t" end="59749282508t" region="region53" style="style0">architectural achievement</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2294" begin="59749282508t" end="59766380006t" region="region42" style="style0">and ever will be.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2295" begin="59749282508t" end="59766380006t" region="region38" style="style0">that ever was</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2296" begin="59775972506t" end="59789729999t" region="region78" style="style0">My...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2297" begin="59800157500t" end="59840197500t" region="region44" style="style0">Lord Set's obelisk</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2298" begin="59800157500t" end="59840197500t" region="region105" style="style0">I mean,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2299" begin="59840197500t" end="59886917506t" region="region44" style="style0">2,220 cubits tall.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2300" begin="59840197500t" end="59886917506t" region="region17" style="style0">stands exactly</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2301" begin="59886917506t" end="59901927501t" region="region44" style="style0">And not a rod off.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2302" begin="59901927501t" end="59924035003t" region="region4" style="style0">Built from seven billion</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2303" begin="59901927501t" end="59924035003t" region="region44" style="style0">blocks of granite,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2304" begin="59924035003t" end="59952812502t" region="region43" style="style0">five billion slabs</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2305" begin="59924035003t" end="59952812502t" region="region44" style="style0">of Tura limestone,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2306" begin="59952812502t" end="59980337500t" region="region4" style="style0">and nine billion talents</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2307" begin="59952812502t" end="59980337500t" region="region76" style="style0">of gold.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2308" begin="59980337500t" end="59994940003t" region="region40" style="style0">of how many slaves?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2309" begin="59980337500t" end="59994940003t" region="region38" style="style0">And the lives</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2310" begin="60006620006t" end="60044155003t" region="region47" style="style0">5,930.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2311" begin="60044155003t" end="60057922507t" region="region61" style="style0">No, wait.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2312" begin="60068350007t" end="60107555006t" region="region1" style="style0">Make that 5,931.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2313" begin="60107555006t" end="60124652503t" region="region0" style="style0">Don't! You need him</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2314" begin="60107555006t" end="60124652503t" region="region40" style="style0">to get to the roof.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2315" begin="60157605006t" end="60170109999t" region="region56" style="style0">HORUS: I'll see you up top.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2316" begin="60230587500t" end="60247695006t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2317" begin="60466662506t" end="60490429999t" region="region28" style="style0">as if he were your friend.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2318" begin="60466662506t" end="60490429999t" region="region32" style="style0">You stood beside him</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2319" begin="60500857500t" end="60515460003t" region="region39" style="style0">how it feels.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2320" begin="60500857500t" end="60515460003t" region="region62" style="style0">Oh, I know</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2321" begin="60515460003t" end="60534645003t" region="region36" style="style0">Favor of a god.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2322" begin="60534645003t" end="60554665003t" region="region44" style="style0">It's intoxicating.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2323" begin="60554665003t" end="60580937500t" region="region65" style="style0">the wrong one to follow.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2324" begin="60554665003t" end="60580937500t" region="region32" style="style0">I'm sorry you picked</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2325" begin="60580937500t" end="60593870002t" region="region36" style="style0">He's improving.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2326" begin="60593870002t" end="60617647506t" region="region4" style="style0">Your woman's still dead,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2327" begin="60593870002t" end="60617647506t" region="region37" style="style0">isn't she?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2328" begin="60617647506t" end="60651007500t" region="region40" style="style0">Such a pretty girl.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2329" begin="60617647506t" end="60651007500t" region="region126" style="style0">Shame.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2330" begin="60651007500t" end="60661017500t" region="region47" style="style0">Hmm...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2331" begin="60661017500t" end="60681455000t" region="region18" style="style0">Such lovely soft skin.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2332" begin="60681455000t" end="60703980002t" region="region76" style="style0">(GROANS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2333" begin="60726922506t" end="60746107505t" region="region53" style="style0">Riches for the Afterlife.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2334" begin="60746107505t" end="60761117500t" region="region5" style="style0">(BEK COUGHS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2335" begin="60761117500t" end="60779477508t" region="region28" style="style0">You see? I'm ready to die.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2336" begin="60849965008t" end="60862052500t" region="region5" style="style0">(BOTH GRUNT)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2337" begin="60971327500t" end="60985930003t" region="region44" style="style0">(APOPHIS GROWLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2338" begin="61093117501t" end="61108137506t" region="region37" style="style0">(GRUNTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2339" begin="61186130003t" end="61201139999t" region="region40" style="style0">(METALLIC RATTLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2340" begin="61292482500t" end="61320435008t" region="region40" style="style0">SET: Come, Apophis!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2341" begin="61410525008t" end="61423030001t" region="region44" style="style0">(THUNDER RUMBLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2342" begin="61473497501t" end="61490605008t" region="region76" style="style0">(GROANS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2343" begin="61574432502t" end="61596957505t" region="region18" style="style0">stayed under the sand.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2344" begin="61574432502t" end="61596957505t" region="region10" style="style0">You should have</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2345" begin="61596957505t" end="61611967500t" region="region13" style="style0">killing for a crown,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2346" begin="61596957505t" end="61611967500t" region="region21" style="style0">I can understand</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2347" begin="61611967500t" end="61628240006t" region="region13" style="style0">but this is madness.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2348" begin="61628240006t" end="61644920002t" region="region3" style="style0">you don't understand.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2349" begin="61628240006t" end="61644920002t" region="region50" style="style0">Of course</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2350" begin="61644920002t" end="61660357508t" region="region30" style="style0">How could you?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2351" begin="61660357508t" end="61675367502t" region="region42" style="style0">of a favored son.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2352" begin="61660357508t" end="61675367502t" region="region63" style="style0">Favored son</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2353" begin="61729175006t" end="61741679999t" region="region76" style="style0">(GROANS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2354" begin="62039485006t" end="62051989999t" region="region39" style="style0">(BEK YELLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2355" begin="62139167506t" end="62152507500t" region="region61" style="style0">(GAGGING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2356" begin="62152507500t" end="62169615006t" region="region25" style="style0">By the way,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2357" begin="62169615006t" end="62190470007t" region="region41" style="style0">Apophis is going to eat</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2358" begin="62169615006t" end="62190470007t" region="region3" style="style0">the Land of the Dead.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2359" begin="62190470007t" end="62204645001t" region="region96" style="style0">You'll never make it</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2360" begin="62190470007t" end="62204645001t" region="region3" style="style0">to the Afterlife now.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2361" begin="62204645001t" end="62219247506t" region="region36" style="style0">(STRAINS) What?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2362" begin="62248860006t" end="62262199999t" region="region61" style="style0">(YELLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2363" begin="62294735001t" end="62313920001t" region="region58" style="style0">Who picked the wrong god now?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2364" begin="62444885001t" end="62459070006t" region="region76" style="style0">(GROANS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2365" begin="62572927500t" end="62587112503t" region="region36" style="style0">(BOTH GRUNTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2366" begin="62630910007t" end="62663017500t" region="region71" style="style0">I think I may actually miss</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2367" begin="62630910007t" end="62663017500t" region="region53" style="style0">our little get-togethers.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2368" begin="62672202508t" end="62683872500t" region="region76" style="style0">(GROANS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2369" begin="62713485000t" end="62735592502t" region="region21" style="style0">But you're still</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2370" begin="62713485000t" end="62735592502t" region="region1" style="style0">no match for me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2371" begin="62746855003t" end="62761875008t" region="region39" style="style0">You're right.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2372" begin="62777302503t" end="62792322508t" region="region44" style="style0">I'm just the bait.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2373" begin="62850295006t" end="62862799999t" region="region10" style="style0">Now you're just</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2374" begin="62850295006t" end="62862799999t" region="region1" style="style0">becoming a pest.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2375" begin="62876150002t" end="62890752507t" region="region5" style="style0">(SET GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2376" begin="62895752502t" end="62910355006t" region="region30" style="style0">(BEK EXCLAIMS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2377" begin="62962075008t" end="62974162500t" region="region5" style="style0">(BEK GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2378" begin="62992522508t" end="63004192500t" region="region76" style="style0">(GROANS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2379" begin="63046320002t" end="63063835000t" region="region47" style="style0">Horus!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2380" begin="63283637500t" end="63294900001t" region="region66" style="style0">(YELLS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2381" begin="63345367501t" end="63359970006t" region="region37" style="style0">(GRUNTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2382" begin="63404175000t" end="63421282507t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2383" begin="63485507501t" end="63503032508t" region="region4" style="style0">You don't think your eye</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2384" begin="63485507501t" end="63503032508t" region="region36" style="style0">might have been</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2385" begin="63503032508t" end="63516790002t" region="region3" style="style0">than a wounded thief?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2386" begin="63503032508t" end="63516790002t" region="region63" style="style0">more useful</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2387" begin="63516790002t" end="63531392507t" region="region30" style="style0">Probably, yes.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2388" begin="63553907500t" end="63573509999t" region="region4" style="style0">I'm sorry for everything</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2389" begin="63553907500t" end="63573509999t" region="region42" style="style0">I've done to you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2390" begin="63576432502t" end="63593947500t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2391" begin="63593947500t" end="63606880002t" region="region36" style="style0">Including this.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2392" begin="63606880002t" end="63621065006t" region="region61" style="style0">Accepted.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2393" begin="63917190002t" end="63953065008t" region="region53" style="style0">I'd steal your other eye.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2394" begin="63917190002t" end="63953065008t" region="region54" style="style0">(CHUCKLES) I told you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2395" begin="63953065008t" end="63965152500t" region="region3" style="style0">saved me some trouble</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2396" begin="63953065008t" end="63965152500t" region="region67" style="style0">But you could have</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2397" begin="63965152500t" end="63978920003t" region="region40" style="style0">you didn't need it.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2398" begin="63965152500t" end="63978920003t" region="region63" style="style0">and told me</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2399" begin="63978920003t" end="63999357505t" region="region3" style="style0">Ra showed me the way,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2400" begin="63999357505t" end="64015202500t" region="region13" style="style0">but I didn't listen.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2401" begin="64015202500t" end="64040232506t" region="region35" style="style0">I believed I needed my eye</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2402" begin="64015202500t" end="64040232506t" region="region39" style="style0">to transform,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2403" begin="64040232506t" end="64067340002t" region="region26" style="style0">but my journey isn't to seek</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2404" begin="64040232506t" end="64067340002t" region="region3" style="style0">revenge at all costs.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2405" begin="64081107506t" end="64096952502t" region="region56" style="style0">It is to protect my people.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2406" begin="64108215003t" end="64133662508t" region="region0" style="style0">Stop congratulating</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2407" begin="64108215003t" end="64133662508t" region="region61" style="style0">yourself.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2408" begin="64133662508t" end="64144497500t" region="region42" style="style0">protecting to do.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2409" begin="64133662508t" end="64144497500t" region="region10" style="style0">You've got more</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2410" begin="64281307506t" end="64294229999t" region="region36" style="style0">(GROANS SOFTLY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2411" begin="64398922503t" end="64413942508t" region="region42" style="style0">(PEOPLE CHEERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2412" begin="64789312503t" end="64803915008t" region="region30" style="style0">(SET GRUNTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2413" begin="64861052506t" end="64874809999t" region="region30" style="style0">(SET GROANING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2414" begin="64925695000t" end="64937792502t" region="region25" style="style0">(SCREAMING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2415" begin="64985755000t" end="65002862507t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2416" begin="65095447500t" end="65105457500t" region="region44" style="style0">(APOPHIS GROWLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2417" begin="65105457500t" end="65120477505t" region="region13" style="style0">(SOLDIERS SCREAMING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2418" begin="65350707505t" end="65366970001t" region="region42" style="style0">(GROANING SOFTLY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2419" begin="65495847500t" end="65511285005t" region="region37" style="style0">(COUGHING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2420" begin="65540480003t" end="65555489999t" region="region40" style="style0">(BREATHING HEAVILY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2421" begin="65583860007t" end="65625559999t" region="region3" style="style0">Behold, the new King.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2422" begin="65645997500t" end="65671027505t" region="region58" style="style0">the greatest of all the gods.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2423" begin="65645997500t" end="65671027505t" region="region67" style="style0">I thought you were</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2424" begin="65671027505t" end="65691882506t" region="region1" style="style0">Now look at you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2425" begin="65671027505t" end="65691882506t" region="region82" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2426" begin="65691882506t" end="65711902506t" region="region42" style="style0">You have nothing.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2427" begin="65711902506t" end="65735669999t" region="region18" style="style0">I am the greatest god.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2428" begin="65746097500t" end="65759447502t" region="region44" style="style0">I spared you once.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2429" begin="65766535000t" end="65776127500t" region="region11" style="style0">Huh?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2430" begin="65776127500t" end="65797817501t" region="region40" style="style0">I showed you mercy.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2431" begin="65797817501t" end="65814507508t" region="region28" style="style0">I won't make that mistake.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2432" begin="65822847506t" end="65835769999t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2433" begin="65999270002t" end="66019707502t" region="region0" style="style0">HORUS: Grandfather,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2434" begin="65999270002t" end="66019707502t" region="region40" style="style0">there's still time.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2435" begin="66071427505t" end="66086019999t" region="region30" style="style0">Enough, beast!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2436" begin="66146497500t" end="66161100003t" region="region1" style="style0">(APOPHIS GROANS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2437" begin="66347115000t" end="66364222507t" region="region66" style="style0">(SIGHS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2438" begin="66870140002t" end="66884325006t" region="region37" style="style0">Thank you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2439" begin="66925200007t" end="66940627502t" region="region1" style="style0">(CROWD CHEERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2440" begin="66947297500t" end="66960230002t" region="region37" style="style0">(APPLAUSE)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2441" begin="66985677508t" end="67004445006t" region="region56" style="style0">HORUS: We make a good team.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2442" begin="67004445006t" end="67025717508t" region="region42" style="style0">you're not a god?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2443" begin="67004445006t" end="67025717508t" region="region88" style="style0">Are you sure</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2444" begin="67025717508t" end="67047397500t" region="region56" style="style0">What would I be the god of?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2445" begin="67047397500t" end="67063252506t" region="region42" style="style0">(EXHALES HEAVILY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2446" begin="67063252506t" end="67077009999t" region="region37" style="style0">Stupidity?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2447" begin="67092030003t" end="67106632508t" region="region36" style="style0">The Impossible.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2448" begin="67150420002t" end="67164605006t" region="region11" style="style0">Bek?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2449" begin="67701805003t" end="67720572502t" region="region51" style="style0">I have never been</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2450" begin="67701805003t" end="67720572502t" region="region70" style="style0">in debt.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2451" begin="67720572502t" end="67743097505t" region="region32" style="style0">And yet I am in debt</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2452" begin="67720572502t" end="67743097505t" region="region42" style="style0">to you, grandson.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2453" begin="67753942506t" end="67778127500t" region="region18" style="style0">Ask whatever you will.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2454" begin="67778127500t" end="67801905003t" region="region32" style="style0">Mountains will kneel</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2455" begin="67778127500t" end="67801905003t" region="region25" style="style0">before you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2456" begin="67801905003t" end="67818167500t" region="region3" style="style0">will do your bidding.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2457" begin="67801905003t" end="67818167500t" region="region50" style="style0">The winds</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2458" begin="67818167500t" end="67843197505t" region="region28" style="style0">for Apophis still hungers.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2459" begin="67818167500t" end="67843197505t" region="region10" style="style0">Answer quickly,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2460" begin="67856547508t" end="67875732507t" region="region56" style="style0">And night is always coming.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2461" begin="67917442508t" end="67929530001t" region="region36" style="style0">I want nothing.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2462" begin="67949967501t" end="67967899999t" region="region4" style="style0">Except what's impossible</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2463" begin="67949967501t" end="67967899999t" region="region36" style="style0">for me to give.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2464" begin="68142245003t" end="68159760001t" region="region61" style="style0">(GASPING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2465" begin="68228995000t" end="68248597500t" region="region66" style="style0">Am I...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2466" begin="68248597500t" end="68269035000t" region="region71" style="style0">(CHUCKLES) You've returned.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2467" begin="68248597500t" end="68269035000t" region="region64" style="style0">(LAUGHING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2468" begin="68269035000t" end="68287812508t" region="region25" style="style0">HORUS: Bek?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2469" begin="68287812508t" end="68298647500t" region="region42" style="style0">want to help her.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2470" begin="68287812508t" end="68298647500t" region="region50" style="style0">You might</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2471" begin="68319502500t" end="68337445008t" region="region78" style="style0">Zaya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2472" begin="68364970006t" end="68378309999t" region="region27" style="style0">(ZAYA BREATHES HEAVILY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2473" begin="68386660007t" end="68403340003t" region="region39" style="style0">(SOFTLY) Bek.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2474" begin="68403340003t" end="68417942508t" region="region5" style="style0">HORUS: Zaya?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2475" begin="68425030006t" end="68437127508t" region="region37" style="style0">I'm Horus.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2476" begin="68437127508t" end="68448797500t" region="region76" style="style0">My Lord.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2477" begin="68448797500t" end="68463400003t" region="region83" style="style0">I thought this</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2478" begin="68448797500t" end="68463400003t" region="region36" style="style0">was impossible.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2479" begin="68463400003t" end="68488419999t" region="region1" style="style0">Impossible? Yes.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2480" begin="68568917500t" end="68579762500t" region="region1" style="style0">(CROWD CHEERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2481" begin="68579762500t" end="68608539999t" region="region2" style="style0">CROWD: Hail Ra, Lord of Light!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2482" begin="68626065006t" end="68651502502t" region="region27" style="style0">Hail Ra, Lord of Light!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2483" begin="68679027500t" end="68704892506t" region="region18" style="style0"><span style="style1">wisdom had been found.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2484" begin="68679027500t" end="68704892506t" region="region51" style="style0">OLDER BEK:<span style="style1"> And so</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2485" begin="68704892506t" end="68739087500t" region="region33" style="style0"><span style="style1">Tests had been passed.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2486" begin="68704892506t" end="68739087500t" region="region3" style="style0"><span style="style1">Second chances given.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2487" begin="68739087500t" end="68756195006t" region="region30" style="style0"><span style="style1">To live again.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2488" begin="68756195006t" end="68776215006t" region="region44" style="style0"><span style="style1">To be whole again.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2489" begin="68776215006t" end="68802070002t" region="region28" style="style0"><span style="style1">Horus mourned his parents.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2490" begin="68802070002t" end="68827935008t" region="region35" style="style0"><span style="style1">They had long since passed</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2491" begin="68802070002t" end="68827935008t" region="region40" style="style0"><span style="style1">into the Afterlife.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2492" begin="68827935008t" end="68848372508t" region="region127" style="style0"><span style="style1">it was the wisdom of Ra</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2493" begin="68827935008t" end="68848372508t" region="region9" style="style0"><span style="style1">But he knew</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2494" begin="68848372508t" end="68881315001t" region="region14" style="style0"><span style="style1">remain as it had always been.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2495" begin="68848372508t" end="68881315001t" region="region15" style="style0"><span style="style1">that the Final Gate would</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2496" begin="68881315001t" end="68933035003t" region="region111" style="style0"><span style="style1">An unbreakable barrier between</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2497" begin="68881315001t" end="68933035003t" region="region28" style="style0"><span style="style1">this life and immortality.</span></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2498" begin="68933035003t" end="68943880003t" region="region13" style="style0">You think I'm ready?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2499" begin="68943880003t" end="68969317500t" region="region40" style="style0">Hmm, true readiness</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2500" begin="68969317500t" end="69003522503t" region="region35" style="style0">is a notoriously difficult</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2501" begin="68969317500t" end="69003522503t" region="region42" style="style0">state to achieve.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2502" begin="69003522503t" end="69028960000t" region="region23" style="style0">-But you're close enough.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2503" begin="69003522503t" end="69028960000t" region="region78" style="style0">-Hmm.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2504" begin="69157430007t" end="69184537505t" region="region36" style="style0">Arise, Horus...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2505" begin="69184537505t" end="69210810001t" region="region44" style="style0">King of all Egypt.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2506" begin="69255860006t" end="69269200000t" region="region1" style="style0">(CROWD CHEERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2507" begin="69305492506t" end="69330095000t" region="region13" style="style0">From this moment on,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2508" begin="69330095000t" end="69352202502t" region="region48" style="style0">the Afterlife must be earned,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2509" begin="69330095000t" end="69352202502t" region="region59" style="style0">not with gold,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2510" begin="69368892508t" end="69397252507t" region="region43" style="style0">but by good deeds,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2511" begin="69368892508t" end="69397252507t" region="region25" style="style0">compassion,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2512" begin="69407680007t" end="69420602500t" region="region36" style="style0">and generosity.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2513" begin="69429777500t" end="69468575008t" region="region33" style="style0">What we do, how we act</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2514" begin="69429777500t" end="69468575008t" region="region3" style="style0">in this life matters.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2515" begin="69482750002t" end="69499430000t" region="region1" style="style0">(CROWD CHEERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2516" begin="69543645003t" end="69558247508t" region="region21" style="style0">Are you thinking</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2517" begin="69543645003t" end="69558247508t" region="region37" style="style0">about her?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2518" begin="69579927500t" end="69594947505t" region="region40" style="style0">Of course, you are.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2519" begin="69635822506t" end="69653337502t" region="region48" style="style0">You didn't think I'd misplace</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2520" begin="69635822506t" end="69653337502t" region="region81" style="style0">Egypt's greatest treasure?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2521" begin="69670435000t" end="69697970007t" region="region28" style="style0">if I were gone a few days?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2522" begin="69670435000t" end="69697970007t" region="region4" style="style0">You think they'd miss me</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2523" begin="69697970007t" end="69720067500t" region="region21" style="style0">As Chief Advisor</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2524" begin="69697970007t" end="69720067500t" region="region5" style="style0">to the King,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2525" begin="69720067500t" end="69740087500t" region="region33" style="style0">it's my duty to ensure</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2526" begin="69720067500t" end="69740087500t" region="region40" style="style0">they hardly notice.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2527" begin="69740087500t" end="69760107500t" region="region28" style="style0">BEK: But if anyone asks...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2528" begin="69740087500t" end="69760107500t" region="region46" style="style0">(CHUCKLES)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2529" begin="69760107500t" end="69776797506t" region="region13" style="style0">to go help a friend.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2530" begin="69760107500t" end="69776797506t" region="region10" style="style0">Tell them I had</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2531" begin="69800147500t" end="69827682507t" region="region18" style="style0">in your capable hands.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2532" begin="69800147500t" end="69827682507t" region="region38" style="style0">I leave Egypt</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2533" begin="69839362508t" end="69849780000t" region="region37" style="style0">(CHUCKLES)</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
